{"label": null, "error": "single positional indexer is out-of-bounds", "id": "d35c1f5e5731498e00c4", "mutation_id": "8ba378919bb5080f4866", "mtype": "delete", "required": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-205", "jurisdiction": "QAT", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "reason": "Relates to publishing a privacy policy and data subject rights; does not address cooperation with the supervisory authority."}, {"id": "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "reason": "Scope exemptions; contains no duty of cooperation with the supervisory authority."}, {"id": "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "reason": "Sets qualifications for the DPO; no supervisory-authority cooperation duty."}, {"id": "40626451a5025d77cff5", "reason": "Pre-processing notice to data subjects; unrelated to cooperation with the authority."}, {"id": "79ac84c7165bc6aa1c06", "reason": "Record of processing obligations; does not impose cooperation with the authority."}, {"id": "3f916831456908af27d8", "reason": "Provides enforcement powers of the ministry; does not state a processor's cooperation obligation."}, {"id": "487015f110e7b88b5c03", "reason": "Concerns attaching policies when seeking a permit; not a general cooperation duty with the authority."}, {"id": "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "reason": "Permit application content for controllers; not a general processor cooperation obligation."}, {"id": "4cae06662b03e16ab229", "reason": "Child data processing safeguards; no cooperation duty with the authority."}, {"id": "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "reason": "Requires appointment of a DPO; does not cover cooperation with the authority."}, {"id": "6ada991a77a31372fb4c", "reason": "Cooperation with an external auditor, not the supervisory authority."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المسؤول عن تحديد المقاصد ووسائل التعامل مع المعلومات والمشغّل لصالحه", "article": "Article 18"}, "modality": {"span": "يتعيّن", "article": "Article 18"}, "action": {"span": "إجراء التنسيق مع السلطة الوزارية، وتسليم ما تستدعيه من معلومات ووثائق وتقدّره ضرورياً", "article": "Article 18"}, "scope": {"span": "لتمكينها من أداء مهامها بمقتضى نصوص التشريع النافذ", "article": "Article 18"}, "condition": {"span": "تسليم ما تستدعيه من معلومات ووثائق", "article": "Article 18"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "على أن يتم ذلك ضمن المهلة التي تقرّرها القواعد التنظيمية", "article": "Article 18"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "processor", "target": "المشغّل لصالحه (ضمن: المسؤول عن تحديد المقاصد ... والمشغّل لصالحه)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 18"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "obligation", "target": "يتعيّن", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 18"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "cooperate with the supervisory authority", "target": "إجراء التنسيق مع السلطة الوزارية، وتسليم ما تستدعيه من معلومات ووثائق", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 18"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "in the performance of the supervisory authority's tasks", "target": "لتمكينها من أداء مهامها بمقتضى نصوص التشريع النافذ", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 18"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "on request by the supervisory authority", "target": "تسليم ما تستدعيه من معلومات ووثائق", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 18"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "None", "target": "على أن يتم ذلك ضمن المهلة التي تقرّرها القواعد التنظيمية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 18"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.86, "reasoning_note": "Article 18 expressly conditions the duty on what the authority requests: “تسليم ما تستدعيه من معلومات ووثائق”. It also requires coordination with the ministerial authority to enable it to perform its tasks. This directly satisfies the ‘on request’ cooperation requirement of GDPR Art. 31 for processors.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-312", "gdpr_article": 31, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 12, "total": 24}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 27}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provision does not explicitly state that cooperation is 'on request' by the supervisory authority.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf", "span": "تسليم ما تستدعيه من معلومات ووثائق وتقدّره ضرورياً", "why": "The provision implies a request but does not explicitly state it is from the supervisory authority."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provision does not explicitly state that cooperation is required to be 'on request' by the supervisory authority.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf", "span": "يتعيّن على المسؤول عن تحديد المقاصد ووسائل التعامل مع المعلومات والمشغّل لصالحه إجراء التنسيق مع السلطة الوزارية، وتسليم ما تستدعيه من معلومات ووثائق وتقدّره ضرورياً لتمكينها من أداء مهامها بمقتضى نصوص التشريع النافذ", "why": "The provision requires cooperation, but it is not clear that it is 'on request' by the supervisory authority."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "40626451a5025d77cff5", "79ac84c7165bc6aa1c06", "3f916831456908af27d8", "487015f110e7b88b5c03", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "4cae06662b03e16ab229", "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "6ada991a77a31372fb4c", "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 319.65, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "7b692b8a75fa3a1651ba", "mutation_id": "26d8a296c5d02619e2f3", "mtype": "paraphrase", "required": "C1", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["f8f94d8d9d379713d656", "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "a7597ada8323b333cc94", "reason": "Substantive collection principles (purpose relation, data minimisation); not about maintaining records of processing."}, {"id": "1fc3063dbbcf8d500da0", "reason": "Security and safeguarding obligations; not about maintaining records of processing."}, {"id": "d31b8876d3426a7c919a", "reason": "Data protection impact assessment; not about maintaining records of processing."}, {"id": "cf114b62f7d3612bb117", "reason": "Complaints handling; not about maintaining records of processing."}, {"id": "4de7a5d9d6e42dc170c3", "reason": "National register of controllers; not the controller’s internal record of processing activities."}, {"id": "0ec82f88effbafd6a911", "reason": "Health data-specific safeguards; not about maintaining records of processing."}, {"id": "d9a05a425b46428120ee", "reason": "General supervisory powers; does not impose/define the controller’s record-keeping duty itself."}, {"id": "21847c9e87d6df45a9a7", "reason": "Accuracy obligation; not about maintaining records of processing."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "جهة التحكم", "article": "Article 33(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "على جهة التحكم", "article": "Article 33(1)"}, "action": {"span": "الاحتفاظ بسجل أنشطة معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 33(1)"}, "scope": {"span": "سجلات أنشطة معالجة البيانات الشخصية المتصلة بأعمال جهة التحكم", "article": "Article 33(1); Article 31"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "أثناء فترة استمرار عمليات معالجة البيانات الشخصية، إضافة إلى خمس سنوات تبدأ من تاريخ انتهاء نشاط معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 33(1)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "جهة التحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 33(1)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation (shall)", "target_value": "على جهة التحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 33(1)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "maintain a record of processing activities", "target_value": "الاحتفاظ بسجل أنشطة معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 33(1)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "processing activities under the controller's responsibility", "target_value": "سجلات أنشطة معالجة البيانات الشخصية المتصلة بأعمال جهة التحكم", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 33(1); Article 31"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "Exemption for organisations with fewer than 250 employees unless risk, not occasional, or special-category processing", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 33(1) (unqualified obligation; no size-based exception stated)"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "أثناء فترة استمرار عمليات المعالجة + خمس سنوات بعد انتهاء نشاط المعالجة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 33(1)"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.86, "reasoning_note": "The KSA text imposes an obligation on controllers to keep a record of processing activities and specifies content and availability, thereby covering the GDPR unit’s core requirement. On duration, GDPR RU-253 specifies no temporal element, whereas KSA Article 33(1) expressly requires retention during processing plus five years after its end; Article 31’s open reference to a period set by executive rules is concretised by Article 33(1). The KSA text has no micro‑enterprise exception, making it broader in scope than GDPR.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-253", "gdpr_article": 30, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 20}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 24}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The duration of record-keeping is not explicitly stated to be the same as the GDPR requirement unit", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "f8f94d8d9d379713d656", "span": "أثناء فترة استمرار عمليات معالجة البيانات الشخصية، إضافة إلى خمس سنوات تبدأ من تاريخ انتهاء نشاط معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "why": "The provision specifies a time limit for record-keeping, which may not be the same as the GDPR requirement unit"}, {"id": "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "span": "لفترة تعينها القواعد التنفيذية المرتبطة بأعماله", "why": "The provision implies that the duration of record-keeping is determined by the executive regulations, which may not be the same as the GDPR requirement unit"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "a7597ada8323b333cc94", "1fc3063dbbcf8d500da0", "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "d31b8876d3426a7c919a", "cf114b62f7d3612bb117", "4de7a5d9d6e42dc170c3", "0ec82f88effbafd6a911", "d9a05a425b46428120ee", "f8f94d8d9d379713d656", "21847c9e87d6df45a9a7"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 245.4, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "c0faf6d0395ca8f26ac3", "mutation_id": "5d131231124e9d71af3a", "mtype": "paraphrase", "required": "C1", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["4a1a7742c2a181be0640"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Portability right; unrelated to objection to direct marketing."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Rectification/erasure; not the right to object to direct marketing."}, {"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Right to information about procedures (including objection) but does not establish the marketing-objection right itself."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated decision-making objection; not tied to direct marketing."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "General processing principles; no right to object to direct marketing."}, {"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "Scope of law; no substantive right to object to marketing."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Right to restriction; distinct from objection to direct marketing."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification; unrelated to objection rights."}, {"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "reason": "Controller contact methods; procedural, not the substantive right."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Complaint to authority; does not grant objection to direct marketing."}, {"id": "fdfffc71ce002ff82134", "reason": "DPIA obligations; unrelated to data subject's right to object to marketing."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يُخوَّل الشخص المعني بالمعلومات", "article": "Article 17"}, "modality": {"span": "يُخوَّل ... أن يمانع", "article": "Article 17"}, "action": {"span": "أن يمانع في القيام بعمليات على معلوماته الفردية", "article": "Article 17"}, "scope": {"span": "حين تكون العمليات مخصصة للدعاية الموجَّهة، ويشمل ذلك إعداد ملفات سلوكية متصلة بتلك الدعاية الموجَّهة", "article": "Article 17"}, "condition": {"span": "يُعلَّق تنفيذها ضمن الأوضاع التالية: 1. حين تكون العمليات مخصصة للدعاية الموجَّهة", "article": "Article 17"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": "ويُعلَّق تنفيذها", "article": "Article 17"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "الشخص المعني بالمعلومات (data subject)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17: \"يُخوَّل الشخص المعني بالمعلومات\""}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "empowered to object (يُخوَّل ... أن يمانع)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17: \"يُخوَّل ... أن يمانع\""}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "object to processing of personal data for direct marketing", "target_value": "object to operations on his personal information", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17: \"أن يمانع في القيام بعمليات على معلوماته الفردية\""}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "processing for direct marketing purposes, including profiling related to such direct marketing", "target_value": "operations for targeted advertising, including profiling related to that advertising", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 17: \"مخصصة للدعاية الموجَّهة، ويشمل ذلك إعداد ملفات سلوكية متصلة بتلك الدعاية\""}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "where personal data are processed for direct marketing purposes", "target_value": "when operations are for targeted advertising", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 17: \"حين تكون العمليات مخصصة للدعاية الموجَّهة\""}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No exception stated for objection to targeted advertising", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17 (no carve-out stated for advertising objection)"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "at any time", "target_value": "No temporal qualifier stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 17 (no phrase like \"في أي وقت\")"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "execution of the operations is suspended upon objection", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 17: \"ويُعلَّق تنفيذها\""}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.73, "reasoning_note": "Article 17 directly grants a right to object to targeted advertising, including related profiling, which functionally addresses the core of GDPR Art. 21(2). However, it narrows the scope to targeted advertising (not all direct marketing) and does not state the temporal qualifier “at any time,” so that slot is uncovered as the reviewer notes.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-180", "gdpr_article": 21, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 9, "total": 9}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 12}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 15}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE jurisdiction does not explicitly provide a counterpart to the GDPR requirement regarding the right to object to processing of personal data for direct marketing purposes at any time.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "span": "يُخوَّل الشخص المعني بالمعلومات أن يمانع في القيام بعمليات على معلوماته الفردية", "why": "Article 17 does not specify that the right to object can be exercised at any time."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE provision does not explicitly state that the data subject has the right to object to processing for direct marketing purposes 'at any time'", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "span": "يُخوَّل الشخص المعني بالمعلومات أن يمانع في القيام بعمليات على معلوماته الفردية", "why": "The provision grants the right to object, but does not specify 'at any time'"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "877fafe0080725188d05", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "c34922f387019af45e42", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "fdfffc71ce002ff82134"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 320.41, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "c35f9d9df41d59336b16", "mutation_id": "e7305aec61a5631d2ee2", "mtype": "paraphrase", "required": "C1", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["5df1b1c5bce760454262", "33d22a1a65039b5be3f9"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "08b4c74d887bbe3b2039", "reason": "Credit-data specific procedural safeguards (consent verification, notification); does not address pseudonymisation or research/statistical safeguards."}, {"id": "557230873031d6e5cb2c", "reason": "Marketing-purpose processing; no relevance to safeguards or pseudonymisation for research/archiving contexts."}, {"id": "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "reason": "Record-keeping of processing activities; does not regulate inclusion of pseudonymisation as a safeguard."}, {"id": "37d872c258760ad10ae9", "reason": "Anonymisation (irreversible) obligations; different concept from pseudonymisation and no link to the research/statistical safeguard in issue."}, {"id": "a7597ada8323b333cc94", "reason": "General data minimisation; does not specifically permit/require pseudonymisation for research/statistical/archiving safeguards."}, {"id": "1fc3063dbbcf8d500da0", "reason": "General security measures obligation; does not speak to pseudonymisation as a safeguard for research/statistical purposes."}, {"id": "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "reason": "DPO designation and duties; no bearing on pseudonymisation safeguards."}, {"id": "772962994f8e191e84a3", "reason": "Sets when research/statistical processing may occur without consent, but does not mention pseudonymisation as a safeguard."}, {"id": "d31b8876d3426a7c919a", "reason": "DPIA requirement; no mention of pseudonymisation for the specific safeguarded purposes."}, {"id": "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "reason": "Public interest processing safeguards (necessity, minimisation) but no specific reference to pseudonymisation."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "الكيان المتولي تقرير الوسائل والمقاصد", "article": "5df1b1c5bce760454262 (البند 30، الديباجة)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب", "article": "5df1b1c5bce760454262 (البند 30، الديباجة)"}, "action": {"span": "إسناد شفرات مستعارة للمعلومات الفردية محل العمليات", "article": "5df1b1c5bce760454262 (البند 30، فقرة 3)"}, "scope": {"span": "لغايات أكاديمية أو استقصائية أو تعدادية ... عند تحصيل أو تنفيذ عمليات على المعلومات ذات الطابع الفردي لتلك الغايات من غير إذن المعني بها", "article": "5df1b1c5bce760454262 (البند 30، العنوان والديباجة)"}, "condition": {"span": "متى لم يخل ذلك ببلوغ المقصد من تلك العمليات", "article": "5df1b1c5bce760454262 (البند 30، فقرة 3)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controllers", "target_value": "الكيان المتولي تقرير الوسائل والمقاصد", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "5df1b1c5bce760454262 (البند 30)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "permission", "target_value": "يجب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "5df1b1c5bce760454262 (البند 30)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "include pseudonymisation among the technical and organisational measures", "target_value": "إسناد شفرات مستعارة للمعلومات الفردية محل العمليات", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "5df1b1c5bce760454262 (البند 30، فقرة 3); 33d22a1a65039b5be3f9 (المادة 1، تعريف الترميز)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "measures implemented under the safeguards to ensure data minimisation", "target_value": "لغايات أكاديمية أو استقصائية أو تعدادية ... من غير إذن المعني بها", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "5df1b1c5bce760454262 (البند 30)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "provided that the archiving in the public interest, scientific or historical research, or statistical purposes can be fulfilled in that manner", "target_value": "متى لم يخل ذلك ببلوغ المقصد من تلك العمليات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "5df1b1c5bce760454262 (البند 30، فقرة 3)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.62, "reasoning_note": "KSA Article 30 requires assigning pseudonymised codes when processing for academic/investigative/statistical purposes without consent, and only when doing so does not frustrate the objective—functionally mirroring GDPR’s safeguard and condition. However, it does not extend to archiving in the public interest or expressly to historical research, and it is limited to a specific context, so the counterpart is narrower overall. The counter-evidence is correct that KSA mentions pseudonymisation only in that limited setting.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-966", "gdpr_article": 89, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 15, "total": 27}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 31}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict relies on a provision (Article 30) that is specifically concerned with academic, investigative, or statistical purposes, and does not explicitly state that pseudonymisation is a technical and organisational measure that controllers may include. Furthermore, the definition of 'الترميز' in Article 1(7) does not necessarily imply that controllers may include pseudonymisation among their technical and organisational measures.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "5df1b1c5bce760454262", "span": "تحصيل وتنفيذ عمليات على المعلومات لغايات أكاديمية أو استقصائية أو تعدادية", "why": "This provision is specifically concerned with academic, investigative, or statistical purposes and does not explicitly state that pseudonymisation is a technical and organisational measure that controllers may include."}, {"id": "33d22a1a65039b5be3f9", "span": "الترميز: تحويل المعرفات الرئيسية التي تدل على هوية صاحب البيانات الشخصية إلى رموز تجعل من المتعذر تحديد هوية صاحب البيانات الشخصية بشكل مباشر دون استخدام بيانات أو معلومات إضافية", "why": "This definition is related to pseudonymisation but does not necessarily imply that controllers may include pseudonymisation among their technical and organisational measures."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is not fully supported by the provisions supplied, and the KSA jurisdiction may not have a complete counterpart to the GDPR requirement unit [RU-966].", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "5df1b1c5bce760454262", "span": "إسناد شفرات مستعارة للمعلومات الفردية", "why": "This provision only mentions pseudonymisation in the context of processing personal data for academic, research, or statistical purposes, whereas the GDPR requirement unit [RU-966] is more general."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["08b4c74d887bbe3b2039", "557230873031d6e5cb2c", "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "5df1b1c5bce760454262", "33d22a1a65039b5be3f9", "37d872c258760ad10ae9", "a7597ada8323b333cc94", "1fc3063dbbcf8d500da0", "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "772962994f8e191e84a3", "d31b8876d3426a7c919a", "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 359.32, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "f2b47600c2026aea7542", "mutation_id": "c28ce302cc8795593ddf", "mtype": "paraphrase", "required": "C1", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "498c9cb637b86367567b", "db1b46495b01511abeef"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "3f916831456908af27d8", "reason": "Ministry enforcement/remedial powers; not a controller duty to implement policies."}, {"id": "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "reason": "General duty to follow ministerial controls; does not specifically require data-protection policies."}, {"id": "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "reason": "DPO qualification criteria; not about implementing policies."}, {"id": "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf", "reason": "Cooperation with the ministry; not about implementing policies."}, {"id": "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "reason": "Obligation to appoint a DPO; not about implementing policies."}, {"id": "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "reason": "Breach-response guidance; not about implementing policies."}, {"id": "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "reason": "External auditor appointment; ancillary to compliance and does not impose/define policy-implementation duty."}, {"id": "40626451a5025d77cff5", "reason": "Transparency notice to data subjects; distinct from internal data-protection policies required by RU-207."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "الجهة التي تقرر الغايات والوسائل للتعاطي مع المعطيات الفردية", "article": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e Art.13"}, "modality": {"span": "يتعين", "article": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e Art.13"}, "action": {"span": "إعداد سياسات وآليات مفروضة الاتباع أثناء التعامل مع تلك المعطيات", "article": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e Art.13"}, "scope": {"span": "وسائل تقنية وتنظيمية تكفل القيام بذلك التعاطي على نحو منسجم مع نصوص هذا التشريع", "article": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e Art.13(ج)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "أثناء التعامل مع تلك المعطيات", "article": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e Art.13"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "الجهة التي تقرر الغايات والوسائل للتعاطي مع المعطيات الفردية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ["a0a0194dd91481c29c6e Art.13"], "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يتعين", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ["a0a0194dd91481c29c6e Art.13"], "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "implement appropriate data protection policies as part of the measures referred to in Article 24(1)", "target_value": "إعداد سياسات وآليات مفروضة الاتباع أثناء التعامل مع تلك المعطيات", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ["a0a0194dd91481c29c6e Art.13", "db1b46495b01511abeef Art.35(2)"], "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "measures established under Article 24(1)", "target_value": "وسائل تقنية وتنظيمية تكفل القيام بذلك التعاطي على نحو منسجم مع نصوص هذا التشريع", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ["a0a0194dd91481c29c6e Art.13(ج)"], "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "where proportionate in relation to processing activities", "target_value": "No proportionality qualifier for the controller’s policy duty; Art. 7’s ‘necessary safeguards and measures’ addresses the ministry’s rulemaking, not a controller-level condition.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "broader", "citation": ["a0a0194dd91481c29c6e Art.13", "498c9cb637b86367567b Art.7"], "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": [], "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "أثناء التعامل مع تلك المعطيات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ["a0a0194dd91481c29c6e Art.13"], "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": [], "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.78, "reasoning_note": "Article 13 imposes a categorical duty on the controller to prepare mandatory policies and mechanisms, and identifies them as part of broader technical and organizational measures. Article 35 confirms these policies are meant to be implemented in practice. Article 7’s ‘necessary safeguards and measures’ guides the ministry’s standard-setting and does not function as a proportionality qualifier on the controller’s duty, so the target text is broader than GDPR on the condition slot.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-207", "gdpr_article": 24, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 18}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 18}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's reasoning for the 'condition' slot is flawed, as proportionality is not explicitly mentioned in the OMN jurisdiction.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "span": "وسائل تقنية وتنظيمية تكفل القيام بذلك التعاطي على نحو منسجم مع نصوص هذا التشريع", "why": "This provision seems to cover the concept of proportionality, but it is not explicitly mentioned in the OMN jurisdiction."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The condition 'where proportionate in relation to processing activities' may have a counterpart in Article 7", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "498c9cb637b86367567b", "span": "إعداد واعتماد الضوابط والإجراءات المتعلقة بحماية البيانات الشخصية بما في ذلك تحديد الضمانات الضرورية والتدابير اللازمة وقواعد السلوك المتعلقة بحماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This article implies a proportionality requirement, as the entity is required to determine the necessary guarantees and measures, which could be seen as proportional to the processing activities"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "3f916831456908af27d8", "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "498c9cb637b86367567b", "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf", "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "db1b46495b01511abeef", "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "40626451a5025d77cff5"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 391.9, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "511b0ddef1c8cfaaf803", "mutation_id": "d75009187fb4addbe4a3", "mtype": "paraphrase", "required": "C1", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["593beb6b1fe15a8fda31"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "a7597ada8323b333cc94", "reason": "Regulates collection purpose, methods, and data minimization; does not address processor selection or engagement."}, {"id": "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "reason": "Transparency at collection from the data subject; not about selecting processors."}, {"id": "d29636711e8dc90e5e69", "reason": "Communication means for data subject rights requests; unrelated to processor selection."}, {"id": "62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "reason": "General security obligations on controllers; does not govern choosing processors."}, {"id": "ba8aef540689169aa848", "reason": "Processing when collecting from someone other than the data subject; not about processors."}, {"id": "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "reason": "Data protection officer designation and tasks; not about processor selection."}, {"id": "21847c9e87d6df45a9a7", "reason": "Accuracy obligations; not about processors."}, {"id": "08b4c74d887bbe3b2039", "reason": "Credit data sectoral rules; not about processor selection."}, {"id": "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "reason": "Public-interest processing by public bodies; not about selecting processors."}, {"id": "7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "reason": "Disclosure rules; not about processor selection."}, {"id": "0ec82f88effbafd6a911", "reason": "Health data sectoral rules; not about processor selection."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "جهة التحكم", "article": "Article 17(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "الالتزام", "article": "Article 17(1)"}, "action": {"span": "اختيار جهة معالجة تقدم ضمانات كافية لحماية البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 17(1)"}, "scope": {"span": "عند اختيار جهة المعالجة الالتزام باختيار جهة معالجة تقدم ضمانات كافية لحماية البيانات الشخصية، وأن يتضمن الاتفاق مع جهة المعالجة ما يلي:", "article": "Article 17(1)"}, "condition": {"span": "عند اختيار جهة المعالجة", "article": "Article 17(1)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "جهة التحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "[593beb6b1fe15a8fda31] Article 17(1)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "الالتزام", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "[593beb6b1fe15a8fda31] Article 17(1)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "use only processors that provide sufficient guarantees to implement appropriate technical and organisational measures so that processing meets this Regulation and protects data subjects' rights", "target_value": "اختيار جهة معالجة تقدم ضمانات كافية لحماية البيانات الشخصية + مسؤولة عن التحقق من التزام جهة المعالجة -بشكل دوري- بإجراء عمليات المعالجة وفقاً لأحكام النظام ولوائحه، وضمان استيفائها لكافة المتطلبات النظامية", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "[593beb6b1fe15a8fda31] Article 17(1), Article 17(3)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "selection and engagement of processors", "target_value": "عند اختيار جهة المعالجة ... وأن يتضمن الاتفاق مع جهة المعالجة ما يلي", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "[593beb6b1fe15a8fda31] Article 17(1)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "where processing is to be carried out on behalf of a controller", "target_value": "عند اختيار جهة المعالجة", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "[593beb6b1fe15a8fda31] Article 17(1)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed for breach of the selection duty", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.86, "reasoning_note": "Article 17(1) obliges the controller to select only a processor that provides sufficient guarantees to protect personal data, and Article 17(3) requires periodic verification of the processor’s compliance with the law. Together these functionally match the GDPR’s requirement to use only processors offering sufficient guarantees so processing meets the law and protects data subjects’ rights, despite not using the GDPR’s TOMs phrasing.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-224", "gdpr_article": 28, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 10, "total": 22}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 24}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["a7597ada8323b333cc94", "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31", "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "d29636711e8dc90e5e69", "62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "ba8aef540689169aa848", "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "21847c9e87d6df45a9a7", "08b4c74d887bbe3b2039", "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "0ec82f88effbafd6a911"], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 184.68, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "213a6d371a0c28d7c8b7", "mutation_id": "3d9af68b4881626de3b0", "mtype": "paraphrase", "required": "C1", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e", "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "reason": "Authority powers/roles; does not set controller-facing obligations on measures or demonstrability."}, {"id": "601ddc5fd8dcb81306cb", "reason": "Internal governance of the authority; no substantive controller duties on measures or demonstrability."}, {"id": "8e585010f3f5f3f24dbb", "reason": "Inspection of DPOs; not a controller obligation to implement measures or demonstrate compliance."}, {"id": "0c872442bf005518c094", "reason": "Registration conditions for internal DPOs; not about controller measures or demonstrability."}, {"id": "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "reason": "Cross-border transfer contract terms; tangential and not the general Art. 24-style obligation."}, {"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "reason": "Data subject rectification/block/erasure rights; not about controller organizational/technical measures."}, {"id": "283dfd2c6920adf8c103", "reason": "Registration conditions for external DPOs; not about controller measures or demonstrability."}, {"id": "34ea02d93464e8e2fa05", "reason": "Definitions; supportive context but not an operative obligation matching the requirement."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "تقع على عاتق المسؤول عن المعطيات مسؤولية إنشاء ترتيبات تكنولوجية وإدارية", "article": "Article 8(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "على مدير البيانات الالتزام بالتدابير الفنية والتنظيمية التالية", "article": "Article 2 (Decision)"}, "action": {"span": "تقع على عاتق المسؤول عن المعطيات مسؤولية إنشاء ترتيبات تكنولوجية وإدارية ... كما تُوثَّق هذه الترتيبات وتُجعل صالحة للمعاينة من أصحاب المصلحة، والجهة المختصة، والمسؤول عن المعطيات، والقائم بالتشغيل.", "article": "Article 8(1)"}, "scope": {"span": "أثناء إجراء عمليات المعالجة", "article": "Article 2 (Decision)"}, "condition": {"span": "بناءً على طبيعة نطاق المعالجة أو سياقها أو أغراضها أو مخاطرها", "article": "Article 2 (Decision)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المسؤول عن المعطيات / مدير البيانات (data controller)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 8(1) [7e2914aa]; Article 2 (Decision) [0dfa8d20]"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "تقع مسؤولية الإنشاء على عاتق المسؤول عن المعطيات / على مدير البيانات الالتزام", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 8(1) [7e2914aa]; Article 2 (Decision) [0dfa8d20]"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to ensure and to be able to demonstrate that processing is performed in accordance with this Regulation", "target_value": "إنشاء ترتيبات/تدابير تكنولوجية وإدارية، توثيقها وجعلها صالحة للمعاينة؛ والالتزام بتدابير فنية وتنظيمية أثناء المعالجة بما يكفل الامتثال للقانون", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 8(1) (توثيق وإتاحة للمعاينة) [7e2914aa]; Article 2 (Decision) (الالتزام بالتدابير أثناء المعالجة) [0dfa8d20]; Article 14(2)(هـ) (تمكين الهيئة من تقييم ملاءمة التدابير) [1d8fd3d4]; Article 10(1)(هـ) (سجل عمليات المعالجة وتزويد الهيئة بنسخة محدثة شهرياً) [74358e43]"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "processing under the controller’s responsibility", "target_value": "أثناء إجراء عمليات المعالجة من قبل مدير البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 2 (Decision) [0dfa8d20]; Article 8(1) [7e2914aa]"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "taking into account the nature, scope, context and purposes of processing and the risks of varying likelihood and severity for the rights and freedoms of natural persons", "target_value": "بالنظر/بناءً على: آخر ما استُحدث من حلول التأمين، كُلف الإعمال، خصائص البيانات، الأخطار المحتملة؛ وطبيعة نطاق المعالجة أو سياقها أو أغراضها أو مخاطرها", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 8(1) [7e2914aa]; Article 2 (Decision) [0dfa8d20]"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No exception expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No temporal qualifier expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No consequence expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.79, "reasoning_note": "Demonstrability is textually present: Article 8(1) requires documenting measures and making them fit for inspection; Article 14(2)(هـ) compels a submission enabling the authority to assess the adequacy of security measures; Article 10(1)(هـ) requires maintaining a processing record and sending an updated copy to the authority monthly. While the risk factors are framed generally (not explicitly tied to ‘rights and freedoms’), the core Art. 24 obligations are functionally covered.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-204", "gdpr_article": 24, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 17, "total": 29}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 34}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The BHR provisions do not fully capture the GDPR's requirement for demonstrating compliance through specific technical and organizational measures considering the nature, scope, context, purposes of processing, and risks to natural persons.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "span": "Article 8(1)", "why": "Does not explicitly mention consideration of the nature, scope, context, and purposes of processing, as well as the risks to the rights and freedoms of natural persons."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions do not explicitly mention the need to demonstrate compliance with the Regulation.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e", "span": "Article 2 (Decision)", "why": "The provision mentions the implementation of technical and organizational measures to ensure the security of personal data, but it does not explicitly mention the need to demonstrate compliance with the Regulation."}, {"id": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "span": "Article 8(1)", "why": "The provision mentions the responsibility of the data controller to ensure the security of personal data, but it does not provide clear guidance on how to demonstrate compliance."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "601ddc5fd8dcb81306cb", "8e585010f3f5f3f24dbb", "0c872442bf005518c094", "0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e", "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "283dfd2c6920adf8c103", "34ea02d93464e8e2fa05"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 374.87, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "b0c93f29a430bed60886", "mutation_id": "7679b12bd472510ee95a", "mtype": "paraphrase", "required": "C1", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["d4e35bf9645b0a055e79", "129b122a7d0386567e65", "291bfc570e191bcff109"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "601ddc5fd8dcb81306cb", "reason": "Board powers and governance; no standalone obligation to produce an annual report."}, {"id": "8e585010f3f5f3f24dbb", "reason": "Inspection/oversight of DPOs; unrelated to annual reporting by the authority."}, {"id": "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "reason": "General tasks/powers of the authority; does not impose an annual report duty."}, {"id": "cbcb4f73e9dfbf01c9bf", "reason": "Internal investigation rules for data managers; not about authority reporting."}, {"id": "0834eba911a2478f8604", "reason": "Budget and resources; mentions fiscal year but no reporting obligation."}, {"id": "d962cad99243b9952541", "reason": "Disposition of investigations; no relevance to annual reporting."}, {"id": "51a58b98a34fba9eb037", "reason": "Training requirements; unrelated to annual reporting."}, {"id": "c5a052ad50c05f144a02", "reason": "Fees for registration; no relevance to annual reporting."}, {"id": "1828db55e11b26ceda54", "reason": "General performance principles; does not address annual reporting."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "الجهة", "article": "Article 33(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "تُحرِّر", "article": "Article 33(1)"}, "action": {"span": "تُحرِّر الجهة حولية تُقَرّ من قِبَل مجموعة المديرين بشأن مهامها ومجريات تشغيلها", "article": "Article 33(1)"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "خلال السنة المالية السابقة", "article": "Article 44(1)(هـ)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "each supervisory authority", "target": "الجهة (هيئة حماية البيانات الشخصية)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 33(1); Art. 27(1)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "obligation", "target": "تُحرِّر / إعداد تقرير سنوي ... خلال ثلاثة أشهر", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Art. 33(1); Art. 44(1)(هـ)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "draw up an annual report on its activities", "target": "تُحرِّر الجهة حولية ... بشأن مهامها ومجريات تشغيلها", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 33(1)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "No special scope limitation stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "No conditions stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "No exceptions stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "annually", "target": "إبان الحول المحاسبي المنقضي / خلال السنة المالية السابقة + مهل نشر/عرض محددة", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 33(1)-(2); Art. 44(1)(هـ)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "No consequence specified", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "covered_with_weaker_modality", "confidence": 0.78, "reasoning_note": "Article 33 uses present-tense legislative drafting (تُحرّر) rather than an explicit ‘shall/يجب’, so I mark the modality as weaker. However, Article 44(1)(هـ) reinforces the normative character by assigning the CEO to prepare the annual report per Article 33 with fixed deadlines. The action and annual periodicity are directly and expressly covered.", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-697", "gdpr_article": 59, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 19}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 21}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The target jurisdiction does not have a direct counterpart to the GDPR requirement that each supervisory authority must draw up an annual report on its activities.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "d4e35bf9645b0a055e79", "span": "تُحرِّر الجهة حولية تُقَرّ من قِبَل مجموعة المديرين بشأن مهامها ومجريات تشغيلها إبان الحول المحاسبي المنقضي", "why": "This provision requires the authority to prepare an annual report, but it does not explicitly state that this report must be drawn up by each supervisory authority."}, {"id": "129b122a7d0386567e65", "span": "إعداد تقرير سنوي عن نشاط الهيئة، على النحو المنصوص عليه في المادة (33) من هذا القانون", "why": "This provision requires the President of the authority to prepare an annual report, but it does not explicitly state that this report must be drawn up by each supervisory authority."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The deontic modality claim (obligation) is not fully supported by the modal wording in Article 33(1).", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "d4e35bf9645b0a055e79", "span": "تُحرِّر الجهة حولية", "why": "The word 'تُحرِّر' (tuḥarrir) means 'to prepare' or 'to draw up,' but it does not necessarily convey a sense of obligation."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["d4e35bf9645b0a055e79", "601ddc5fd8dcb81306cb", "129b122a7d0386567e65", "8e585010f3f5f3f24dbb", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "cbcb4f73e9dfbf01c9bf", "0834eba911a2478f8604", "291bfc570e191bcff109", "d962cad99243b9952541", "51a58b98a34fba9eb037", "c5a052ad50c05f144a02", "1828db55e11b26ceda54"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 367.16, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "163ba70a7ed12c30a60f", "mutation_id": "1efe960e2c61bbaed40a", "mtype": "paraphrase", "required": "C1", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["8394f801a0a97e521f68", "14105f25ea49e7794aaa"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "33d22a1a65039b5be3f9", "reason": "Definitions; no operative duty for a DPO to advise on DPIA."}, {"id": "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "reason": "Lawful collection/processing bases; no DPO advisory function on DPIA."}, {"id": "7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "reason": "Disclosure rules; no DPO or DPIA‑advice obligation."}, {"id": "62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "reason": "Security measures; no DPO advisory role on DPIA."}, {"id": "ce107f77eb9119ba01b0", "reason": "Privacy policy content; no DPO or DPIA advice duty."}, {"id": "94fdbc8539498517eb98", "reason": "Complaints; no DPO advisory duty on DPIA."}, {"id": "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "reason": "Processor selection; no DPO advisory role on DPIA."}, {"id": "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "reason": "Public interest processing by public entities; no DPO advisory role."}, {"id": "06b918a4049719ed530f", "reason": "Licensing/accreditation and oversight; no DPO DPIA advice obligation."}, {"id": "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "reason": "Transparency at collection; no DPO DPIA advisory role."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المفوَّض بصيانة المعطيات ذات الطابع الفردي", "article": "Article 32(3) [8394f801a0a97e521f68]"}, "modality": {"span": "يضطلع المفوَّض بصيانة المعطيات لدى الكيان المُحدِّد ... ويقوم تحديداً بما يلي", "article": "Article 32(3) [8394f801a0a97e521f68]"}, "action": {"span": "الرقابة على مسارات تقدير التداعيات ... وتسجيل المآلات وتقديم المقترحات اللازمة لذلك", "article": "Article 32(3)(ب) [8394f801a0a97e521f68]"}, "scope": {"span": "مسارات تقدير التداعيات", "article": "Article 32(3)(ب) [8394f801a0a97e521f68]"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "data protection officer", "target_value": "المفوَّض بصيانة المعطيات ذات الطابع الفردي", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 32(3) [8394f801a0a97e521f68]", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يضطلع ... ويقوم تحديداً بما يلي", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 32(3) [8394f801a0a97e521f68]", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "provide advice as regards the data protection impact assessment", "target_value": "الرقابة على مسارات تقدير التداعيات ... وتقديم المقترحات اللازمة لذلك", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 32(3)(ب) [8394f801a0a97e521f68]", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "the data protection impact assessment (DPIA)", "target_value": "مسارات تقدير التداعيات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 32(3)(ب) [8394f801a0a97e521f68]", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "where requested", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "broader", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "broader", "confidence": 0.69, "reasoning_note": "Art. 32(3)(b) assigns the DPO to oversee impact assessment processes and provide necessary proposals, which functions as advice on DPIAs. The trigger “where requested” is not stated; the target imposes an unconditional, and thus broader, advisory/oversight role. Art. 25 confirms the DPIA concept exists in the system.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-477", "gdpr_article": 39, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 13, "total": 25}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 29}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's citation does not provide sufficient evidence to support the claim that the data protection officer is obliged to provide advice as regards the data protection impact assessment.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "span": "تقديم المقترحات اللازمة لذلك (في سياق الرقابة على مسارات تقدير التداعيات)", "why": "The provision does not explicitly state that the data protection officer is obliged to provide advice on the data protection impact assessment."}, {"id": "14105f25ea49e7794aaa", "span": "تقويم الأثر", "why": "This article explicitly mentions impact assessment, but does not mention the data protection officer's role in providing advice on the impact assessment."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The condition 'where requested' is not explicitly stated in the target jurisdiction's provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "span": "يضطلع ... ويقوم تحديداً بما يلي", "why": "The Data Protection Officer's responsibilities are mentioned, but the condition 'where requested' is not explicitly stated."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["33d22a1a65039b5be3f9", "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "ce107f77eb9119ba01b0", "94fdbc8539498517eb98", "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "06b918a4049719ed530f", "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "14105f25ea49e7794aaa"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 372.44, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "67ab28b4072124b67681", "mutation_id": "7588c31687ad7c77f0da", "mtype": "paraphrase", "required": "C1", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["674524dee00496cb5de7"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "fdfffc71ce002ff82134", "reason": "DPIA obligation; does not address maintaining a record of processing activities."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification and documentation of breaches; not a general record of processing activities."}, {"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "reason": "DPO roles (including documenting assessments); not a controller ROPA duty."}, {"id": "57844ac856d11c289650", "reason": "Lawful bases for processing; unrelated to controller record-keeping."}, {"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "reason": "Information security measures; does not establish a ROPA."}, {"id": "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "reason": "Processor must keep a record for processing on behalf of the controller; does not impose a controller ROPA."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "Controller/processor duties toward DPO; not a ROPA."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment triggers; not a ROPA."}, {"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "Scope of the law; no ROPA obligation."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "Processing principles; no ROPA obligation."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Complaint mechanism; unrelated to ROPA."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "من يحدد مقاصد وأدوات التعامل مع المعطيات المُعرِّفة للأفراد", "article": "674524dee00496cb5de7"}, "modality": {"span": "يلتزم القائم بذلك بما يلي:", "article": "674524dee00496cb5de7"}, "action": {"span": "إعداد دفتر توثيق مخصص للمعطيات المُعرِّفة للأفراد ... على أن يضع المكلف ذلك الدفتر تحت تصرف الهيئة عند استدعائها له.", "article": "674524dee00496cb5de7"}, "scope": {"span": "للمعطيات المُعرِّفة للأفراد ... وتوصيف تصنيفات المعطيات لدى الطرف ... أو تشغيلها لدى المكلف", "article": "674524dee00496cb5de7"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "عند استدعائها له", "article": "674524dee00496cb5de7"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "controller", "target": "Person who determines the purposes and means of processing (controller-equivalent)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "obligation (shall)", "target": "يلتزم (is obliged)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "maintain a record of processing activities", "target": "إعداد دفتر توثيق مخصص للمعطيات المُعرِّفة للأفراد مع تفاصيل عمليات المعالجة، وإتاحته للهيئة عند الطلب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "processing activities under the controller's responsibility", "target": "يشمل التفاصيل المتعلقة ببيانات ومعالجات الجهة نفسها (لدى الطرف/لدى المكلف)", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "None stated for maintaining the record", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "Exemption for enterprises with fewer than 250 employees unless certain conditions apply", "target": "No exemption stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "Make the record available upon the Authority's request (عند استدعائها له)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "No explicit consequence in the cited provision", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.77, "reasoning_note": "Article 7(4) explicitly imposes on “من يحدد مقاصد وأدوات التعامل” (i.e., the controller) the duty to “إعداد دفتر توثيق مخصص” and to provide it to the Authority upon request, which is a functional equivalent of a ROPA duty. This directly assigns the responsibility to the controller-equivalent actor. Unlike GDPR Art. 30, the UAE text here contains no SME-size exemption, making it broader on that slot.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-253", "gdpr_article": 30, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 7, "total": 7}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 15}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 16}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The citation provided for the 'action' and 'scope' slot verdicts does not fully support the claim made.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "span": "إعداد دفتر توثيق مخصص للمعطيات المُعرِّفة للأفراد", "why": "The text does not explicitly state that it is a record of processing activities under the controller's responsibility."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The cited provision does not explicitly mention the controller's responsibility in maintaining the record of processing activities.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "span": "يلتزم القائم بذلك بما يلي: ... إعداد دفتر توثيق مخصص", "why": "The provision focuses on documentation and record-keeping but does not explicitly state the controller's responsibility."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["fdfffc71ce002ff82134", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "57844ac856d11c289650", "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "5d949837d7aab073cd67"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 399.76, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "3879a4ee1f6a240d7910", "mutation_id": "2d6ea2e364c90dae92bf", "mtype": "paraphrase", "required": "C1", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["fcbd13532c69b340214e"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "6c76988b817262e3e312", "reason": "Obligations are imposed on the controller (المراقب) regarding governance and oversight; it does not create a processor duty to implement security measures."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "Addresses controller duties to take precautions; does not set the processor’s obligation to implement security measures."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Concerns conditions for the controller when disclosing/transferring data to the processor; not the processor’s security obligations."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification by the controller; not the processor’s obligation to implement security measures."}, {"id": "455aae046cacf7979576", "reason": "Data quality and retention obligations on the controller; not security measures by the processor."}, {"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "reason": "Regulator’s powers and activities; not operative security obligations for processors."}, {"id": "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "reason": "Information duties before processing; not the processor’s implementation of security measures."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "الطرفان، وهما مُحدِّد الغايات والجهة المنفِّذة", "article": "Article 13"}, "modality": {"span": "يلتزم", "article": "Article 13"}, "action": {"span": "باعتماد وسائل أمان كفيلة بصون المعلومات ذات الصلة بشخص معيّن من الفقد أو التخريب أو التغيير أو الكشف، أو الاطلاع عليها، أو استعمالها بطريق الخطأ أو بالمخالفة للقانون", "article": "Article 13"}, "scope": {"span": "المعلومات ذات الصلة بشخص معيّن", "article": "Article 13"}, "condition": {"span": "تُراعى ملاءمة هذه الوسائل لخصائص وقيمة المعلومات المطلوب صونها", "article": "Article 13"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "processor", "target": "الجهة المنفِّذة (processor) ضمن \"الطرفان، وهما مُحدِّد الغايات والجهة المنفِّذة\"", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 13", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "obligation", "target": "يلتزم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 13", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to ensure a level of security appropriate to the risk", "target": "اعتماد وسائل أمان كفيلة بصون المعلومات من الفقد/التخريب/التغيير/الكشف/الاطلاع/الاستعمال غير المشروع أو بالخطأ", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 13", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "processing of personal data", "target": "المعلومات ذات الصلة بشخص معيّن (بيانات شخصية)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 13", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "taking into account the state of the art, implementation costs, and the nature, scope, context and purposes of processing, as well as risks of varying likelihood and severity to the rights and freedoms of natural persons", "target": "تُراعى ملاءمة الوسائل لخصائص وقيمة المعلومات المطلوب صونها", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 13", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "No time qualifier for implementing measures (only breach notice is \"دون إبطاء\" but pertains to notification, not implementation)", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "narrower", "confidence": 0.71, "reasoning_note": "Article 13 directly obliges the processor to adopt security measures to protect personal data. However, it only requires considering the “characteristics and value” of the information, and does not enumerate GDPR’s broader risk-based factors (state of the art, costs, nature/scope/context/purposes, or likelihood/severity to rights and freedoms). Thus the factor-taking condition is narrower, aligning with the reviewer’s objection.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-316", "gdpr_article": 32, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 8, "total": 8}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 8}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The Qatari law might not fully cover the GDPR requirement of implementing appropriate technical and organizational measures to ensure a level of security appropriate to the risk, as it does not explicitly mention all the factors to be taken into account.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "span": "تُراعى ملاءمة هذه الوسائل لخصائص وقيمة المعلومات المطلوب صونها.", "why": "This provision only mentions considering the characteristics and value of the information to be protected, but does not explicitly cover all the factors mentioned in the GDPR."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "span": "اتخاذ الاحتياطات الإدارية والفنية والمادية المناسبة لحماية البيانات الشخصية، وفقاً لما تحدده الإدارة المختصة.", "why": "This provision mentions taking administrative, technical, and material measures to protect personal data, but does not provide a detailed list of factors to be considered."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The Qatari law does not fully cover the GDPR requirement unit (RU-316) because it does not explicitly mention the factors that should be taken into account when implementing security measures.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "[fcbd13532c69b340214e] Article 13", "span": "تُراعى ملاءمة هذه الوسائل لخصائص وقيمة المعلومات المطلوب صونها", "why": "This article does not explicitly mention the factors that should be taken into account when implementing security measures, such as the state of the art, implementation costs, and the nature, scope, context, and purposes of processing."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 8, "candidate_ids": ["fcbd13532c69b340214e", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "f5c366135483fe580381", "455aae046cacf7979576", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "89d1bb9a58e65b732117"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 346.6, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "242d22a1b18bd0fbedbd", "mutation_id": "e580e696f5632fdbd8b9", "mtype": "paraphrase", "required": "C1", "condition": "mutation"}
