, but it does not textually confer a right to obtain restriction; the controller is only obliged generally to respond to rights-requests (Article 21). It also conditions the request on actual inaccuracy rather than mere contestation and introduces an explicit exception where providing the data would conflict with law or the regulations. The temporal element aligns closely with GDPR (restriction lasts for a period enabling verification).", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-166", "gdpr_article": 18, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 13, "total": 25}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 30}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The modality of the right to obtain the restriction of processing may be weaker in the target jurisdiction, and the condition for exercising this right may be narrower.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "085e0379de48628139e3", "span": "الحق في طلب تصحيح البيانات الشخصية 1- يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية في حال عدم صحة بياناته الشخصية المتوافرة لدى جهة التحكم أن يطلب تقييد معالجة بياناته لمدة يمكن لجهة التحكم خلالها التحقق من صحة البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision supports the analyst's claim, but with some nuances regarding the modality and condition."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is based on an incomplete understanding of Article 7(1), and the provision does not fully align with the GDPR requirement unit [RU-166].", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "085e0379de48628139e3", "span": "الحق في طلب تصحيح البيانات الشخصية 1- يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية في حال عدم صحة بياناته الشخصية المتوافرة لدى جهة التحكم أن يطلب تقييد معالجة بياناته لمدة يمكن لجهة التحكم خلالها التحقق من صحة البيانات الشخصية", "why": "The provision provides a right to request correction of personal data, but the restriction of processing is only mentioned as a means to achieve this correction, and the temporal slot is not fully aligned with the GDPR requirement."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["21847c9e87d6df45a9a7", "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "90da7bc2380e8f3f2fb8", "085e0379de48628139e3", "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "7780dca28ee02b6e0f07", "14105f25ea49e7794aaa", "a79606d0fb564d3b2b5d", "59abf8ad06d6b694538c"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 356.33, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "9bf5380f30b5f8814ca7", "mutation_id": "5d365d3a9669797179f6", "mtype": "modal_down", "required": "C3", "condition": "mutation"}
