, "gdpr_value": "power", "target_value": "يجوز للوزارة ... ولها على الأخص الآتي", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 7"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "be competent for the performance of the tasks assigned to it", "target_value": "تولي مسؤولية تطبيق أحكام هذا القانون + صلاحيات وإجراءات رقابية/تنفيذية", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 7; Article 8; Article 9; Article 16"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "on the territory of its own Member State", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "in accordance with this Regulation", "target_value": "تطبيق أحكام هذا القانون", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 7"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "مع عدم الإخلال بالاختصاصات المقررة لمركز الدفاع الإلكتروني", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 7"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.64, "reasoning_note": "I mapped the supervisory authority functionally to the Ministry based on explicit powers to apply and enforce the law (Arts. 7–9, 16). I did not infer territorial competence: no candidate text states the Ministry’s competence is limited to Oman’s territory, and Article 38’s reference to transfers “outside the borders of the Sultanate” regulates controllers, not the authority’s jurisdiction. Because an express carve-out for the Cyber Defense Center exists, the target is also narrower than GDPR on exceptions.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-649", "gdpr_article": 55, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 17}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 21}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict for the scope slot might be too absolute, as Article 38 implies a territorial limitation.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "1f1d8b7b23195c0f44fc", "span": "outside the borders of the Sultanate of Oman", "why": "This provision implies a territorial limitation, suggesting that the OMN has considerations for data protection within its borders."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential discrepancies in scope interpretation and terminology", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 38", "span": "خارج حدود سلطنة عمان", "why": "Implies external territorial focus rather than internal jurisdiction"}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["498c9cb637b86367567b", "3f916831456908af27d8", "3ebf8596bc5a77b0eeea", "6e8de83975a220288296", "1f1d8b7b23195c0f44fc", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "caad155111190c1aa274", "c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa", "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 345.62, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "ed31b64fca6a2a8b34d7", "mutation_id": "9526d38e1050c4b05287", "mtype": "modal_down", "required": "C3", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["674524dee00496cb5de7", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "Scope of application; does not address cooperation with the supervisory authority."}, {"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Data subject information rights; not about controller–authority cooperation."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "Processing principles; no cooperation-on-request rule."}, {"id": "57844ac856d11c289650", "reason": "Legal bases for processing; not about cooperation with the authority."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification duty is ex officio (not on request); different requirement."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Data subject rectification/erasure rights; unrelated to authority cooperation."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "Duties toward DPO; not a cooperation-on-request obligation."}, {"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "reason": "Controller contact methods for data subjects; not about supervisory authority."}, {"id": "1f0de28c69e3ad65d235", "reason": "Delegation of powers; does not impose cooperation on controllers."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment/notification; not an on-request cooperation duty."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المتحكم", "article": "Article 7 (عنوان: الالتزامات العامة للمتحكم)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجوز للمتحكم الالتزام بما يأتي", "article": "Article 7 (ديباجة المادة)"}, "action": {"span": "تزويد المكتب ... بأي معلومات يطلبها", "article": "Article 7(6)"}, "scope": {"span": "تنفيذاً لاختصاصاته الواردة في هذا المرسوم بقانون ولائحته التنفيذية", "article": "Article 7(6)"}, "condition": {"span": "وبناءً على قرار من الجهة القضائية المختصة", "article": "Article 7(6)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 7 (الالتزامات العامة للمتحكم)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation (shall)", "target_value": "يجوز للمتحكم الالتزام بما يأتي (صياغة إباحة/جواز)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Article 7 (ديباجة المادة)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "cooperate with the supervisory authority", "target_value": "تزويد المكتب بأي معلومات يطلبها (وتوفير السجل عند الطلب)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 7(6); Article 7(4)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "in the performance of the supervisory authority's tasks", "target_value": "تنفيذاً لاختصاصات المكتب الواردة في المرسوم بقانون ولائحته التنفيذية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 7(6)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "on request by the supervisory authority", "target_value": "على الطلب (يطلبها) ولكن وبناءً على قرار من الجهة القضائية المختصة", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 7(6): \"... بأي معلومات يطلبها ... وبناءً على قرار من الجهة القضائية المختصة\"; Article 7(4): \"... توفير هذا السجل للمكتب متى ما طلب منه ذلك\""}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.66, "reasoning_note": "UAE law contains a functional counterpart: Article 7(6) requires providing the Office with requested information to execute its competences, but only upon a competent judicial decision (narrower condition). The chapeau of Article 7 uses permissive language (weaker modality), while Article 7(4) obliges provision of the processing record on request, albeit limited in scope. Together these provisions only partially match GDPR Art. 31’s general, mandatory duty to cooperate on request.", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-311", "gdpr_article": 31, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 7, "total": 7}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 9, "total": 16}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 17}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The conditional phrase in Article 7(6) may weaken the modality of the obligation, which could be considered a defect in the analyst's verdict.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 7(6)", "span": "تزويد المكتب، وبناءً على قرار من الجهة القضائية المختصة، بأي معلومات يطلبها تنفيذاً لاختصاصاته الواردة في هذا المرسوم بقانون ولائحته التنفيذية", "why": "The conditional phrase may weaken the modality of the obligation."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is partially correct, but also partially incorrect. The UAE jurisdiction does have a counterpart to the GDPR requirement, but it has a different modality and scope.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 7(6)", "span": "تزويد المكتب، وبناءً على قرار من الجهة القضائية المختصة، بأي معلومات يطلبها تنفيذاً لاختصاصاته الواردة في هذا المرسوم بقانون ولائحته التنفيذية", "why": "This provision suggests that the controller is required to provide information to the supervisory authority upon request, but only based on a decision from the competent judicial authority."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "57844ac856d11c289650", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "877fafe0080725188d05", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "1f0de28c69e3ad65d235", "9630e6d967b64e07d339"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 410.17, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "d94876b41ddf93cdb6a0", "mutation_id": "ea7e5720fe9b94b1fa98", "mtype": "modal_down", "required": "C3", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "93fde8c87940ae524c86", "1fdf77ac047fc519d30b"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "reason": "Access/notice right; does not grant or regulate rectification."}, {"id": "98fa9fe9b0650c71a971", "reason": "Direct-marketing objection; unrelated to rectification."}, {"id": "88af48316f67d59351aa", "reason": "General objection to harmful processing; not a rectification right."}, {"id": "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "reason": "Cross-border contractual clauses; context-specific and not a general rectification right or timeline."}, {"id": "14fe9b230c7ba11703d5", "reason": "Penalties; does not define the rectification right."}, {"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "reason": "DPO duties; not rectification."}, {"id": "762372b7329c44286e43", "reason": "Lawful bases for processing; not rectification."}, {"id": "5e5fa8a4888b88a04311", "reason": "Compensation; remedial damages, not the rectification right."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "كل صاحب بيانات", "article": "Art. 23(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجوز لكل صاحب بيانات أن يتقدم إلى مدير البيانات بطلب", "article": "Art. 23(1)"}, "action": {"span": "أن يتقدم إلى مدير البيانات بطلب ... لتصحيح ... البيانات الشخصية الخاصة به", "article": "Art. 23(1)"}, "scope": {"span": "البيانات الشخصية الخاصة به ... إذا كانت البيانات غير صحيحة أو ناقصة أو غير محدَّثة", "article": "Art. 23(1)"}, "condition": {"span": "إذا كانت معالجتها تتم بالمخالفة لأحكام القانون ... أو إذا كانت معالجتها غير مشروعة", "article": "Art. 23(1)"}, "exception": {"span": "لا يسري حكم البند (1) ... على أيّ سجل متاح للجمهور الاطلاع عليه، إذا تطلَّب القانون المنشئ للسجل إجراءات معينة للتصحيح أو الحَجْب أو المسح", "article": "Art. 23(2)"}, "temporal": {"span": "خلال عشرة أيام عمل من تاريخ تسلُّم الطلب", "article": "Art. 23(1)"}, "consequence": {"span": "تسري أحكام البند (2) من المادة (20) ... وفي حالة عدم قبول صاحب البيانات بما أخطره به مدير البيانات ... يكون لصاحب البيانات تقديم شكوى إلى الهيئة ضد مدير البيانات", "article": "Art. 23(4) by reference to Art. 20(2)"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "data subject", "target": "كل صاحب بيانات (data subject)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 23(1)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "right", "target": "Described as a right in title, but operative text gives permission to submit a request; controller \"may\" respond", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Art. 23 (title) and Art. 23(1); see also Art. 17(1)(ج)(3)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "obtain from the controller the rectification", "target": "submit a request to the controller to correct; controller may respond", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 23(1)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "inaccurate personal data concerning the data subject", "target": "personal data concerning the subject that are incorrect, incomplete, or not updated", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 23(1)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "processing contrary to the law (including where data are incorrect/incomplete/not updated, or processing is unlawful)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 23(1)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "public registers subject to special statutory procedures are excluded", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 23(2)", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "without undue delay", "target": "Controller may respond within 10 working days; mandatory 10-day notification of outcome via Art. 23(4) + 20(2); no duty to rectify \"without undue delay\"", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Art. 23(1) and Art. 23(4) by reference to Art. 20(2)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "Right to lodge a complaint with the authority if refusal/inaction; controller must notify acceptance/partial/refusal within 10 working days", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 23(4) and Art. 20(2)", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.67, "reasoning_note": "Bahrain law recognizes a right to seek rectification but structures it as a right to request, with added conditions and exceptions. It does not impose a duty to rectify without undue delay; instead, it provides an optional 10‑day response and a mandatory 10‑day notification of outcome. This addresses the reviewer’s objection: the specific ‘without undue delay’ standard is not present in the target text.", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-140", "gdpr_article": 16, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": "broader", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 20}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 21}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict does not account for the conditions and limitations attached to the data subject's right to rectification in Article 23(1) of the BHR law.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "span": "يجوز لكل صاحب بيانات أن يتقدم إلى مدير البيانات بطلب، مشفوع بما يثبت هويته، لتصحيح أو حَجْب أو مسح البيانات الشخصية الخاصة به بحسب الأحوال، إذا كانت معالجتها تتم بالمخالفة لأحكام القانون، وعلى الأخص إذا كانت البيانات غير صحيحة أو ناقصة أو غير محدَّثة...", "why": "This provision indicates that the data subject's right to rectification is subject to certain conditions, which are not fully accounted for in the analyst's verdict."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provision does not support the claim that the rectification must be done 'without undue delay'", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "span": "يجوز لكل صاحب بيانات أن يتقدم إلى مدير البيانات بطلب، مشفوع بما يثبت هويته، لتصحيح أو حَجْب أو مسح البيانات الشخصية الخاصة به بحسب الأحوال", "why": "The provision does not mention 'without undue delay'"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "98fa9fe9b0650c71a971", "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "93fde8c87940ae524c86", "5bd7541a2690632a7c77", "88af48316f67d59351aa", "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "14fe9b230c7ba11703d5", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "1fdf77ac047fc519d30b", "762372b7329c44286e43", "5e5fa8a4888b88a04311"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 403.16, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "c45d677edff4f3dd06d8", "mutation_id": "714e7c4b0d7922a5a998", "mtype": "modal_down", "required": "C3", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["5a79146e04b73c99685c", "93fde8c87940ae524c86"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "reason": "Concerns duties/registration of Data Protection Officer; does not address informing data subjects about recipients upon request."}, {"id": "1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3", "reason": "Breach notification to data subjects/authority; not about informing on recipients of disclosures upon request."}, {"id": "88af48316f67d59351aa", "reason": "Right to object to harmful processing; unrelated to informing about recipients."}, {"id": "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "reason": "Rules for sensitive data processing; no provision on informing data subjects about recipients upon request."}, {"id": "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "reason": "Cross-border transfer contractual requirements; not about data subject information rights re recipients."}, {"id": "eb633917dcbabe34df47", "reason": "Automated decision-making objections; not about informing data subjects of recipients."}, {"id": "762372b7329c44286e43", "reason": "Lawful bases for processing; no operative rule on informing about recipients upon request."}, {"id": "98fa9fe9b0650c71a971", "reason": "Duty to inform of right to object to direct marketing; different subject matter."}, {"id": "23f5fda398d01b0f5865", "reason": "Obligations of DPOs; no rule on informing data subjects about recipients."}, {"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "reason": "Requires notifying third parties of rectification/erasure/blocking; does not grant the data subject a right to be informed about recipients upon request."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "مدير البيانات", "article": "Article 18(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجوز لمدير البيانات ... إخطار مقدِّم الطلب", "article": "Article 18(1)"}, "action": {"span": "إخطار ... بأسماء متسلِّمي البيانات أو فئاتهم", "article": "Article 18(1)(د)"}, "scope": {"span": "بيانات شخصية خاصة بصاحب الطلب", "article": "Article 18(1)"}, "condition": {"span": "بناءً على طلب من صاحب البيانات مشفوع بما يثبت هويته، وفي حالة وجود معالَجة", "article": "Article 18(1)"}, "exception": {"span": "لمدير البيانات عدم قبول الطلب ... إذا لم يكن مستوفياً... وله رفْضُه إذا تضمَّن تعسُّفاً لاستعمال صاحب البيانات لحقه في المعرفة", "article": "Article 18(3)"}, "temporal": {"span": "خلال ميعاد أقصاه خمسة عشر يوم عمل من تاريخ الطلب", "article": "Article 18(1)"}, "consequence": {"span": "يكون لصاحب البيانات تقديم شكوى إلى الهيئة", "article": "Article 18(4)"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "controller", "target": "مدير البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 18(1)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "obligation", "target": "يجوز لمدير البيانات ... إخطار مقدِّم الطلب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Article 18(1)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "inform the data subject about the recipients to whom the personal data have been disclosed", "target": "إخطار ... بأسماء متسلِّمي البيانات أو فئاتهم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 18(1)(د)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "None", "target": "بيانات شخصية خاصة بصاحب الطلب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 18(1)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "if the data subject requests it", "target": "بناءً على طلب من صاحب البيانات مشفوع بما يثبت هويته، وفي حالة وجود معالجة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 18(1)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": "عدم قبول الطلب إذا لم يكن مستوفياً، ورفضه إذا تضمَّن تعسفاً", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 18(3)"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "None", "target": "خلال ميعاد أقصاه خمسة عشر يوم عمل من تاريخ الطلب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 18(1)"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": "لصاحب البيانات تقديم شكوى إلى الهيئة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 18(4)"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.67, "reasoning_note": "Article 18 provides a request-based mechanism to inform the data subject of the names or categories of data recipients, but it is framed permissively (may inform) rather than as a duty, and includes refusal grounds. This makes the Bahraini provision weaker in modality and narrower in availability compared to the unconditional GDPR obligation in RU-173. The reviewer’s concern is valid on these two points.", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-173", "gdpr_article": 19, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 11, "total": 23}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 25}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The target jurisdiction has a counterpart to the GDPR requirement, but with some differences in wording and scope.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "span": "Article 18(1)", "why": "The article provides for the controller to inform the data subject about the recipients of their personal data if requested."}, {"id": "93fde8c87940ae524c86", "span": "Article 17(1)", "why": "The article requires the controller to inform the data subject about the recipients of their personal data when collecting their personal data directly from them."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The target jurisdiction's provisions may not fully align with the GDPR requirement unit [RU-173], as the controller's obligation to inform the data subject is not explicitly stated, and the conditions for refusing the request may be narrower than those in the GDPR.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 18(1)", "span": "يجوز لمدير البيانات، بناءً على طلب من صاحب البيانات مشفوع بما يثبت هويته، إخطار مقدِّم الطلب دون مقابل خلال ميعاد أقصاه خمسة عشر يوم عمل من تاريخ الطلب", "why": "The controller 'may' inform the data subject, which implies a permission rather than an obligation."}, {"id": "Article 18(3)", "span": "لمدير البيانات عدم قبول الطلب المشار إليه في البند (1) من هذه المادة، إذا لم يكن مستوفياً، بشرط الالتزام بمتطلبات البند (2) من هذه المادة وفوات مدة الإعذار", "why": "The controller may refuse the request if it is deemed frivolous or if the data subject has already been informed of the processing, which could be seen as a narrower condition than the GDPR requirement unit [RU-173]."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3", "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "88af48316f67d59351aa", "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "93fde8c87940ae524c86", "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "eb633917dcbabe34df47", "762372b7329c44286e43", "98fa9fe9b0650c71a971", "23f5fda398d01b0f5865", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 401.34, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "136d4076c9baeab52605", "mutation_id": "d46b98f9116d629227c1", "mtype": "modal_down", "required": "C3", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["9f3112d28a1b850ba61f"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "reason": "Defines when collection/processing is lawful, but does not create or condition a right to restrict processing nor tie unlawfulness to a restriction request."}, {"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "reason": "Security and governance obligations (records, breach notice, complaint handling); no provision granting or conditioning a right to restrict processing."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "الوسائل التكنولوجية المناسبة التي تمكن المستخدمين من ممارسة حقهم في الوصول إلى البيانات الشخصية ومراجعتها وتصحيحها", "article": "Article 4(6)"}, "modality": {"span": "حقهم في الوصول إلى البيانات الشخصية ومراجعتها وتصحيحها", "article": "Article 4(6)"}, "action": {"span": "تحديد آلية الحصول على أو تصحيح أو إزالة البيانات الشخصية أو تقييد الوصول إليها أو معالجتها", "article": "Article 4(8)"}, "scope": {"span": "البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 4(1)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "المستخدمين (users) are referenced as holders of certain data rights", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 4(6)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "Right is expressly stated for access/review/correction, not expressly for restriction", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Art. 4(6), 4(8)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "obtain from the controller the restriction of processing", "target_value": "Mechanism to restrict access to or processing of personal data", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 4(8)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "processing of the data subject's personal data", "target_value": "البيانات الشخصية (personal data) processing context", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 4(1)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "processing is unlawful and the data subject opposes erasure and requests restriction instead", "target_value": "No condition stated for restriction", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No exception stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No temporal element stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No consequence stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.64, "reasoning_note": "Article 4(8) recognizes a mechanism to restrict access/processing, but the text does not articulate a data-subject right to obtain restriction nor the GDPR-specific condition (unlawful processing with erasure opposed). This addresses the objection: the condition is indeed not stated; Art. 3 concerns lawfulness generally and does not supply a restriction trigger, and Art. 4(8) is mechanism-only.", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-167", "gdpr_article": 18, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 1, "total": 1}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 3}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 3}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict of 'uncovered' for the condition slot is not entirely accurate, as there is some counter-evidence to suggest that the target jurisdiction provides some basis for restricting processing of personal data under certain conditions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "span": "المادة الثالثة: مشروعية جمع ومعالجة البيانات", "why": "This article provides a framework for determining the lawfulness of data processing, which could be related to the GDPR requirement."}, {"id": "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "span": "تقييد الوصول إليها أو معالجتها", "why": "This provision is related to restricting access to or processing of personal data, which is similar to the GDPR requirement."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The condition for restricting processing is not clearly stated in the target jurisdiction, and the analyst's citation does not provide sufficient support for the claim.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "span": "المادة الثالثة: مشروعية جمع ومعالجة البيانات لا تكون جمع ومعالجة البيانات مشروعة وقانونية إلا في حال توافر إحدى الحالات التالية:", "why": "Article 3 discusses the lawfulness of collecting and processing data, but does not provide a clear condition for restricting processing."}, {"id": "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "span": "8. تحديد آلية الحصول على أو تصحيح أو إزالة البيانات الشخصية أو تقييد الوصول إليها أو معالجتها، أو الاعتراض على معالجتها أو طلب نقل البيانات الشخصية.", "why": "Article 4(8) mentions the mechanism for restricting access or processing, but does not explicitly state the condition for doing so."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 3, "candidate_ids": ["b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 340.07, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "18e6e3228684ee115172", "mutation_id": "dd0c2dd3fca8c2099edb", "mtype": "modal_down", "required": "C3", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e", "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "063ab5d9ef023666aed7"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "reason": "Supervisory authority tasks; does not impose controller-level measures or demonstrability duties."}, {"id": "601ddc5fd8dcb81306cb", "reason": "Board powers/administration; no operative rule on controllers’ measures or accountability."}, {"id": "8e585010f3f5f3f24dbb", "reason": "Oversight of DPOs; not an obligation on controllers to implement measures or demonstrate compliance."}, {"id": "10e6e0e9f2f36b4c7b42", "reason": "Rules for public registers; unrelated to controller accountability measures."}, {"id": "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "reason": "Cross-border transfer contract clauses; context-specific and not a general duty to implement measures/demonstrate compliance."}, {"id": "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "reason": "Sensitive data processing bases; no requirement to implement accountability measures."}, {"id": "3bf5db493f62912c0a15", "reason": "External DPO disclosure duty; not about controller implementing measures or demonstrability."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على مدير البيانات", "article": "Article 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)"}, "modality": {"span": "على مدير البيانات الالتزام بالتدابير الفنية والتنظيمية التالية وتطبيقها", "article": "Article 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)"}, "action": {"span": "الالتزام بالتدابير الفنية والتنظيمية التالية وتطبيقها كلها أو بعضها", "article": "Article 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)"}, "scope": {"span": "عند معالجة البيانات", "article": "Article 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)"}, "condition": {"span": "وذلك بناءً على طبيعة نطاق المعالجة أو سياقها أو أغراضها أو مخاطرها", "article": "Article 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "مدير البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "على مدير البيانات الالتزام ... وتطبيقها", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to ensure and to be able to demonstrate compliance", "target_value": "Implement and apply technical and organisational measures; establish privacy frameworks and staff instructions aimed at compliance; keep/process records/notifications enabling assessment (but no explicit general duty to ‘demonstrate compliance’).", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e); Art. 10(1)(هـ) (74358e437cd9e85fdabb); Art. 14(2)(هـ) (1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68); Art. 8(1) last sent. (7e2914aa34ab2739dafd)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "processing under the controller’s responsibility", "target_value": "Measures required “عند معالجة البيانات” by the controller; also organisational duties for joint controllers.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e); Art. 7 (063ab5d9ef023666aed7)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "taking into account nature, scope, context, purposes, and risks to rights and freedoms", "target_value": "based on “طبيعة نطاق المعالجة أو سياقها أو أغراضها أو مخاطرها” (risks not expressly tied to rights and freedoms nor to likelihood/severity).", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No exception expressed for the measures duty.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No temporal qualifier stated.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No specific consequence stated for failure to implement/account for measures in Article 2/8/10.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.68, "reasoning_note": "Bahrain law imposes an obligation on controllers to implement technical and organisational measures with factors closely mirroring GDPR’s (Art. 2), and it creates some demonstrability mechanisms (notification content, processing records), but it does not explicitly state a general duty to be able to demonstrate compliance with the whole law. No express consequence is tied to failing the measures duty; the stop-processing consequence in Art. 14(4) concerns incomplete notifications only. This addresses the objection: demonstrability is partial and consequences are not articulated for this RU.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-204", "gdpr_article": 24, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 11, "total": 23}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 31}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The BHR jurisdiction does not have a clear counterpart to the GDPR requirement of demonstrating compliance with the Regulation.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e", "span": "Article 2", "why": "Does not explicitly mention the need to demonstrate compliance with the Regulation."}, {"id": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "span": "Article 8", "why": "Does not provide clear guidance on how to demonstrate compliance with the Regulation."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions do not explicitly mention the controller's obligation to demonstrate compliance with the Regulation, and do not provide clear guidance on the consequences of non-compliance.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e", "span": "Article 2", "why": "The article mentions the controller's obligation to implement technical and organizational measures, but does not explicitly mention the obligation to demonstrate compliance."}, {"id": "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "span": "Article 14", "why": "The article mentions the notification requirements, but does not provide clear guidance on the consequences of non-compliance."}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "3bf5db493f62912c0a15", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "601ddc5fd8dcb81306cb", "8e585010f3f5f3f24dbb", "10e6e0e9f2f36b4c7b42", "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e", "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "063ab5d9ef023666aed7"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 399.4, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "0c3b5a1f06241f978328", "mutation_id": "a313b7e821bf8e199a57", "mtype": "modal_down", "required": "C3", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["9c38ab11b550755816f5"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "Addresses when to appoint a DPO; does not require ensuring the DPO’s involvement in issues."}, {"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "reason": "Defines DPO roles and tasks; does not impose on the processor to ensure involvement."}, {"id": "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "reason": "General processor obligations; no requirement to ensure DPO involvement."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "General processing principles; no DPO involvement requirement."}, {"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "reason": "Controller obligations; does not address ensuring DPO involvement by the processor."}, {"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "reason": "Security measures; no DPO involvement requirement."}, {"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Data subject right to information; not about DPO involvement."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification; no rule on ensuring DPO involvement."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Right to restriction; not about DPO involvement."}, {"id": "fdfffc71ce002ff82134", "reason": "DPIA coordination duty on the controller; not a processor obligation and limited to DPIA context."}, {"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "Scope of the law; not about DPO involvement."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المتحكم والمعالج", "article": "المادة (12)(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجوز للمتحكم والمعالج توفير كافة السبل", "article": "المادة (12)(1)"}, "action": {"span": "ضمان إشراكه بشكل مناسب", "article": "المادة (12)(1)(أ)"}, "scope": {"span": "في كافة المسائل المتعلقة بحماية البيانات الشخصية", "article": "المادة (12)(1)(أ)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "وفي الوقت الملائم", "article": "المادة (12)(1)(أ)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "processor", "target_value": "المتحكم والمعالج", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "المادة (12)(1)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يجوز (may/permissive)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "المادة (12)(1)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "ensure that the data protection officer is properly involved", "target_value": "ضمان إشراكه بشكل مناسب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "المادة (12)(1)(أ)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "all issues relating to the protection of personal data", "target_value": "في كافة المسائل المتعلقة بحماية البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "المادة (12)(1)(أ)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "in a timely manner", "target_value": "وفي الوقت الملائم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "المادة (12)(1)(أ)"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "weaker_modality", "confidence": 0.79, "reasoning_note": "Article 12(1) uses the permissive term “يجوز” (may), and subparagraph (a) on ensuring proper and timely involvement sits under that permissive chapeau, so the processor’s duty is not mandated as in the GDPR. Article 11 describes the DPO’s role but does not convert the processor’s involvement duty into a mandatory obligation. Assessment is limited strictly to the text provided.", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-455", "gdpr_article": 38, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": "broader", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 10, "total": 10}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 13}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 13}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The modality claim of 'obligation' is not supported by the modal wording in Article 12(1), which uses the word 'يجوز' (may/permitted) instead of a word that indicates obligation.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "span": "يجوز للمتحكم والمعالج توفير كافة السبل لضمان أداء مسؤول حماية البيانات الأدوار والمهام الموكلة إليه", "why": "The word 'يجوز' (may/permitted) indicates a permission or possibility, rather than an obligation."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict regarding the modality is incorrect. The UAE law imposes an obligation on the controller and processor to ensure the data protection officer's involvement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "span": "المادة (12) واجبات المتحكم والمعالج تجاه مسؤول حماية البيانات 1. يجوز للمتحكم والمعالج توفير كافة السبل لضمان أداء مسؤول حماية البيانات الأدوار والمهام الموكلة إليه", "why": "This provision suggests that the data protection officer's involvement is mandatory, not just permissive."}, {"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "span": "المادة (11) أدوار مسؤول حماية البيانات 1. يتولى مسؤول حماية البيانات التأكد من مدى امتثال المتحكم أو المعالج بتنفيذ أحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون", "why": "This provision implies that the data protection officer has a critical role in protecting personal data."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["9630e6d967b64e07d339", "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "fdfffc71ce002ff82134", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 322.53, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "c1ba0228dc41c2fac42e", "mutation_id": "e9d9f5ee0598d95d2f9b", "mtype": "modal_down", "required": "C3", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "0c872442bf005518c094", "reason": "Conditions for registering an internal Data Protection Officer; no rule on selecting or engaging processors or requiring guarantees."}, {"id": "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "reason": "Regulates sensitive data processing exceptions; does not address controller use of processors or their guarantees."}, {"id": "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "reason": "Criminal proceedings data processing; no provisions on processor selection or assurances."}, {"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "reason": "Data subject rights to rectification/blocking/erasure; unrelated to processor due diligence."}, {"id": "b334fb41dcb796c50b6b", "reason": "Urgent measures by the authority; enforcement context, not controller selection of processors."}, {"id": "34ea02d93464e8e2fa05", "reason": "Definitions (incl. Privacy by Design); contains no obligation about using only processors with sufficient guarantees."}, {"id": "1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3", "reason": "Breach notification duties; no requirement concerning processor guarantees or selection."}, {"id": "7448a27e7806f2c0c143", "reason": "Data quality principles; does not regulate controller’s choice of processors."}, {"id": "bd5a2bbf9e9652a21d70", "reason": "Inspection powers; procedural/enforcement, not processor engagement criteria."}, {"id": "daaf1e5a7eedf0d7755e", "reason": "Investigation procedures; no substance on processor guarantees."}, {"id": "c9f5b5ef9189452960fe", "reason": "Obligation to register DPOs; unrelated to processors."}, {"id": "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "reason": "Referral of DPO to investigation; no content on processors."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "controller", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "obligation", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "use only processors that provide sufficient guarantees to implement appropriate technical and organisational measures so that processing meets this Regulation and protects data subjects' rights", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "selection and engagement of processors", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "where processing is to be carried out on behalf of a controller", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.86, "reasoning_note": "None of the provided Bahraini provisions address a controller’s obligation to select only processors offering sufficient guarantees for technical/organizational measures. The texts cover DPO registration, data quality, special-category and criminal data processing, breach notification, and enforcement, but not processor selection or guarantees. Therefore the GDPR unit is not reflected in the supplied target text.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-224", "gdpr_article": 28, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 16, "total": 28}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 31}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["0c872442bf005518c094", "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "b334fb41dcb796c50b6b", "34ea02d93464e8e2fa05", "1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3", "7448a27e7806f2c0c143", "bd5a2bbf9e9652a21d70", "daaf1e5a7eedf0d7755e", "c9f5b5ef9189452960fe", "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc"], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 166.56, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "2c0794de528127bdf8e8", "mutation_id": "8841b953684ae902ef60", "mtype": "modal_down", "required": "C3", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "4ddc7494f19d84324dd8", "40626451a5025d77cff5"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "4f65c1f467f9e61b2f46", "reason": "General applicability clause; does not create or describe a data-subject access right."}, {"id": "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "reason": "Erasure-specific right and refusal grounds; does not address access."}, {"id": "a4136d70ee84d058ef85", "reason": "Right to contact the DPO; not an access right."}, {"id": "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "reason": "Requires a policy and procedures for exercising rights; procedural, does not itself grant or frame the access right."}, {"id": "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "reason": "Controller licensing/notification content; unrelated to data-subject access."}, {"id": "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "reason": "Confidentiality/disclosure limits; not an access right."}, {"id": "79ac84c7165bc6aa1c06", "reason": "Record of processing obligations; not an access right."}, {"id": "c62011bb3dda1c9374e5", "reason": "General protection statement; no access right."}, {"id": "2712fe4ebdba355a134b", "reason": "Consent/processing conditions; not an access right."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "لصاحب البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 11"}, "modality": {"span": "يكون لصاحب البيانات الشخصية الحق", "article": "Article 11"}, "action": {"span": "حق الوصول إلى البيانات", "article": "Article 14"}, "scope": {"span": "بياناته الشخصية المعالجة", "article": "Article 11"}, "condition": {"span": "شريطة التأكد من خلو النسخة التي قدمها من أي بيانات شخصية تحدد هوية شخص آخر", "article": "Article 19"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "صاحب البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 11 (b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "الحق", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 11 (b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "obtain access to personal data concerning the data subject", "target_value": "حق الوصول إلى البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 14(e) (40626451a5025d77cff5)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "personal data concerning the data subject", "target_value": "بياناته الشخصية المعالجة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 11 (b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "where the personal data concerning the data subject are being processed", "target_value": "بياناته الشخصية المعالجة + شريطة التأكد من خلو النسخة من أي بيانات تحدد هوية شخص آخر", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 11 (b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f); Article 19 (4ddc7494f19d84324dd8)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "No exception identified in selected provisions"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "No temporal condition identified in selected provisions"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "No consequence specified in selected provisions"}], "holistic_label": "narrower", "confidence": 0.74, "reasoning_note": "Action citation corrected to Article 14 (“حق الوصول إلى البيانات”). OMN text grants a right to obtain a copy/access to processed personal data but additionally conditions the copy on removing third parties’ identifiers (Art. 19), which is an extra limitation not present in RU-123; thus narrower overall.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-123", "gdpr_article": 15, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 18}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 21}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The OMN law has a narrower scope than the GDPR requirement unit, and the analyst's citation for the 'action' slot is incorrect.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "4ddc7494f19d84324dd8", "span": "شريطة التأكد من خلو النسخة التي قدمها من أي بيانات شخصية تحدد هوية شخص آخر", "why": "This condition is not present in the GDPR requirement unit [RU-123]."}, {"id": "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "span": "يكون لصاحب البيانات الشخصية الحق في الآتي: أ- إلغاء موافقته على معالجة بياناته الشخصية، وذلك مع عدم الإخلال بالمعالجات التي تمت قبل الإلغاء.", "why": "The analyst's citation for the 'action' slot is incorrect, as Article 11(c) does not exist."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["4f65c1f467f9e61b2f46", "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "a4136d70ee84d058ef85", "4ddc7494f19d84324dd8", "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "2712fe4ebdba355a134b", "c62011bb3dda1c9374e5", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "79ac84c7165bc6aa1c06", "40626451a5025d77cff5"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 270.08, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "225d26d30dff8a50cff3", "mutation_id": "72517561a4916a14f44c", "mtype": "modal_down", "required": "C3", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["c34922f387019af45e42", "80f95c322bb3204c7f65"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "reason": "Addresses a general right to stop processing (e.g., direct marketing, statistics), not decisions based on automated processing with legal or similarly significant effects."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Concerns restriction of processing in certain circumstances; does not regulate automated decision-making rights."}, {"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Provides an information right about decisions taken based on automated processing, but not a right to avoid such decisions."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Right to rectification/erasure; not about automated decision-making."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability; not about automated decision-making."}, {"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "Scope of the law; not an operative right concerning automated decision-making."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "General processing principles; no specific right concerning automated decision-making outcomes."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "DPO-related duties; not about automated decision-making rights."}, {"id": "6201d16404c0d4b9f63d", "reason": "Cross-border transfer; unrelated to automated decision-making rights."}, {"id": "ffb151edc5703b569765", "reason": "Administrative appeal of regulator decisions; not about automated decision-making."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "صاحب البيانات", "article": "Article 18(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "يحق", "article": "Article 18(1)"}, "action": {"span": "الاعتراض على القرارات التي تصدر عن المعالجة المؤتمتة للبيانات الشخصية الحساسة وتكون لها تبعات قانونية أو تؤثر بشكل جسيم على صاحب البيانات، بما فيها التنميط", "article": "Article 18(1)"}, "scope": {"span": "البيانات الشخصية الحساسة", "article": "Article 18(1)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": "لا يجوز لصاحب البيانات الاعتراض على القرارات التي تصدر عن المعالجة المؤتمتة للبيانات الشخصية الحساسة في الحالات الآتية: أ. إذا كانت المعالجة المؤتمتة للبيانات الشخصية الحساسة ضمن شروط التعاقد بين صاحب البيانات والمتحكم. ب. إذا كانت المعالجة المؤتمتة للبيانات الشخصية الحساسة ضرورية وفق تشريعات أخرى نافذة في الدولة. ج. إذا تمت الموافقة المسبقة من صاحب البيانات على المعالجة المؤتمتة للبيانات الشخصية الحساسة وفق الشروط المحددة في المادة (6) من هذا المرسوم بقانون.", "article": "Article 18(2); cross-ref Article 6"}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "صاحب البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 18(1)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "يحق (a right to object)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 18(1)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "not be subject to a decision based solely on automated processing, including profiling, that produces legal or similarly significant effects", "target_value": "right to object to decisions issued by automated processing of sensitive personal data that have legal consequences or significantly affect the data subject, including profiling", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 18(1)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "None (applies to all personal data; not limited to special categories)", "target_value": "limited to sensitive personal data", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 18(1)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "contract necessity; authorised by law laying down suitable safeguards; explicit consent of the data subject", "target_value": "contractual conditions; necessity under other UAE legislation; prior approval (consent) under Article 6; with controller measures to protect privacy/confidentiality in such cases", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 18(2)-(3); Article 6"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.79, "reasoning_note": "Article 18 grants a right to object (not a right not to be subject) and limits it to sensitive personal data. Exceptions broadly mirror GDPR (contract, law, consent), but consent need not be explicit and the law’s safeguards are less specific; thus the coverage is partial and overall narrower/weaker than GDPR Art. 22.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-187", "gdpr_article": 22, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 19}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 21}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE law provides some safeguards against solely automated decision-making, but the scope and conditions differ from those in the GDPR.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "span": "Article 18(1) and (3)", "why": "The UAE law addresses the right to object to decisions issued by automated processing of sensitive personal data and provides safeguards against solely automated decision-making."}, {"id": "80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "span": "Article 6", "why": "The UAE law deals with the conditions for consent, but does not explicitly require explicit consent for automated decision-making."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE law provides a right to object to automated processing, but with more limitations than the GDPR provision, including limitations to sensitive personal data and no requirement for explicit consent.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "span": "Article 18(1)", "why": "The UAE law limits the right to object to decisions based on automated processing of sensitive personal data, whereas the GDPR provision applies to all personal data."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "span": "Article 18(2)", "why": "The UAE law provides exceptions to the right to object, including cases where the decision is necessary for a contract or authorized by UAE law, without requiring explicit consent."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["c34922f387019af45e42", "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "877fafe0080725188d05", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "6201d16404c0d4b9f63d", "ffb151edc5703b569765"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 351.4, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "4796f073617885a1d0bc", "mutation_id": "1b5132093b60d51c7e6e", "mtype": "narrow", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
