pr_value": "Where processing is based on consent", "target_value": "وفي جميع الأحوال (غير مشروطة بأن يكون الأساس هو الموافقة)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 3 (b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.73, "reasoning_note": "Article 3 imposes an obligation to be able to prove the data subject’s consent but does so “in all cases,” not only where consent is the lawful basis. This makes the KWT rule broader on condition/scope while the addressee is narrower (online service providers). The core demonstration-of-consent obligation is textually covered.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-017", "gdpr_article": 7, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": "broader", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 2, "total": 2}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 2}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is not entirely accurate, as the target jurisdiction has a provision that requires the controller to demonstrate consent.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "span": "يجب أن يكون لمقدم الخدمة عبر الإنترنت القدرة على إثبات موافقة صاحب البيانات على معالجة البيانات", "why": "This phrase implies that the controller has an obligation to demonstrate consent, which is similar to the GDPR requirement."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The KWT provision 'معالجة البيانات (بما يخص إثبات موافقة صاحب البيانات على المعالجة)' is not entirely equivalent to the GDPR requirement 'processing of personal data based on consent'", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "span": "المادة الثالثة: مشروعية جمع ومعالجة البيانات لا تكون جمع ومعالجة البيانات مشروعة وقانونية إلا في حال توافر إحدى الحالات التالية: ...  وفي جميع الأحوال يجب أن يكون لمقدم الخدمة عبر الإنترنت القدرة على إثبات موافقة صاحب البيانات على معالجة البيانات", "why": "The KWT provision is broader than the GDPR requirement and does not specifically focus on processing based on consent"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 2, "candidate_ids": ["b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 241.11, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "d7c7580f78ec6c82dd67", "mutation_id": "1a1755b5131f706e7b92", "mtype": "narrow", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
