n explicit exception where the right does not apply, making the KSA provision narrower than GDPR Art. 18 in scope and effect. This addresses the reviewer’s point about the sensitive/non-sensitive distinction.", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-166", "gdpr_article": 18, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 12, "total": 24}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 27}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The KSA provision may not cover all personal data, and the scope of the provision is unclear.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "085e0379de48628139e3", "span": "بيانات شخصية غير حساسة", "why": "The KSA provision only applies to non-sensitive personal data, which may not be equivalent to the GDPR requirement."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The KSA regulation might have a narrower scope due to the distinction between sensitive and non-sensitive personal data.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "085e0379de48628139e3", "span": "بيانات شخصية غير حساسة", "why": "The provision specifically mentions non-sensitive personal data, potentially limiting the scope of the right to restriction of processing compared to the GDPR."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["21847c9e87d6df45a9a7", "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "90da7bc2380e8f3f2fb8", "085e0379de48628139e3", "a79606d0fb564d3b2b5d", "ba8aef540689169aa848", "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "9cfd6fbae8182dbc0028", "a7597ada8323b333cc94"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 362.37, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "cfb50523120f639b5e30", "mutation_id": "cc9891e9bbfbc7ef9d33", "mtype": "narrow", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["395f05afbd09e73e9a41"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "reason": "Records of processing; not about objections or ceasing direct marketing."}, {"id": "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "reason": "Right to request destruction; not a rule to cease processing upon marketing objection."}, {"id": "17d4b446ea6ed7965d08", "reason": "General handling of rights requests (timelines/verification); not specific to direct marketing objections."}, {"id": "14105f25ea49e7794aaa", "reason": "DPIA requirements; unrelated to direct marketing objection/cessation."}, {"id": "9cfd6fbae8182dbc0028", "reason": "Right to be informed (including how to withdraw consent); does not impose a prohibition to continue processing after objection."}, {"id": "d29636711e8dc90e5e69", "reason": "Communication channels for rights requests; procedural, not a substantive rule to stop marketing processing."}, {"id": "ba8aef540689169aa848", "reason": "Processing when collected from others; not about direct marketing objection."}, {"id": "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "reason": "Legal bases and purpose limitation; no specific right to object to direct marketing or duty to cease."}, {"id": "f8f94d8d9d379713d656", "reason": "Record of processing activities; not about direct marketing objection."}, {"id": "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "reason": "Processing for a realized interest; not about direct marketing objection."}, {"id": "d31b8876d3426a7c919a", "reason": "DPIA for public products/services; not about direct marketing objection."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على جهة التحكم", "article": "Article 29(3)"}, "modality": {"span": "فيكون على جهة التحكم", "article": "Article 29(3)"}, "action": {"span": "التوقف دون تأخير غير مبرر عن توجيه المواد التسويقية إليه", "article": "Article 29(3)"}, "scope": {"span": "التسويق المباشر عبر الرسائل النصية القصيرة (SMS)", "article": "Article 29(3)"}, "condition": {"span": "في حال عدول صاحب البيانات الشخصية عن موافقته على التسويق المباشر عبر 