t is withdrawn, but it is limited to SMS and to stopping communications rather than all processing for marketing purposes. GDPR Art. 21(2)-(3) applies to any direct marketing processing upon objection, irrespective of channel or legal basis. Therefore the KSA provision is functionally similar but materially narrower.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-181", "gdpr_article": 21, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 15, "total": 27}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 32}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["395f05afbd09e73e9a41", "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "17d4b446ea6ed7965d08", "14105f25ea49e7794aaa", "9cfd6fbae8182dbc0028", "d29636711e8dc90e5e69", "ba8aef540689169aa848", "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "f8f94d8d9d379713d656", "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "d31b8876d3426a7c919a"], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 167.43, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "023fd370d114c27ed98d", "mutation_id": "b5029b59cd09e9a24ab2", "mtype": "narrow", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["674524dee00496cb5de7"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "General scope of application; no obligation to maintain records of processing."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "Sets processing principles; does not require controllers to maintain a record of processing."}, {"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "reason": "Defines DPO roles; no controller record-keeping duty."}, {"id": "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "reason": "Imposes record-keeping on processors (not controllers); RU-253 addresses controller records."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated decision-making rights; unrelated to controller record-keeping."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification; no controller record-keeping obligation."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability right; not a record-keeping obligation."}, {"id": "57844ac856d11c289650", "reason": "Lawful bases/consent exceptions; no record-keeping requirement."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "Duties toward DPO; no controller record-keeping obligation."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment triggers; not a controller record-keeping requirement."}, {"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "reason": "Controller contact mechanisms; not a record-keeping duty."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المتحكم الذي يعالج البيانات الشخصية الحساسة", "article": "Article 7"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب على المتحكم الالتزام بما يأتي", "article": "Article 7"}, "action": {"span": "مسك سجل خاص للبيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 7(4)"}, "scope": {"span": "على أن يتضمن هذا السجل ... المدد الزمنية للمعالجة وقيودها ونطاقها ... وآلية محو البيانات الشخصية أو تعديلها أو معالجتها لديه، والغرض من المعالجة، وأي بيانات متعلقة بحركة ومعالجة تلك البيانات عبر الحدود", "article": "Article 7(4)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المتحكم الذي يعالج البيانات الشخصية الحساسة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 7", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يجب على المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 7", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "maintain a record of processing activities under its responsibility", "target_value": "مسك سجل خاص للبيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 7(4)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "processing activities under the controller's responsibility", "target_value": "يشمل السجل تفاصيل المعالجة: \"المدد الزمنية للمعالجة وقيودها ونطاقها ... والغرض من المعالجة ... وحركة ومعالجة تلك البيانات عبر الحدود\"", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 7(4)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "shall not apply to organisations with fewer than 250 employees unless risk/non-occasional/includes special categories", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.74, "reasoning_note": "UAE PDPL Article 7(4) imposes a controller record-keeping duty only where the controller processes sensitive personal data. While Article 8(7) requires processors to keep a record, RU-253 concerns controller records generally. Because there is no general controller RoPA duty (with only a sensitive-data limitation) and no SME-style exception scheme, coverage is partial and narrower than the GDPR rule.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-253", "gdpr_article": 30, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 7, "total": 7}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 9, "total": 16}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 18}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE law may have a narrower scope and slightly different modality than the GDPR requirement", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "span": "المادة (7) الالتزامات العامة للمتحكم الذي يعالج البيانات الشخصية الحساسة", "why": "The UAE law only applies to controllers who process sensitive personal data, which may be a narrower scope than the GDPR requirement"}, {"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "span": "متى ما طلب منه ذلك", "why": "The UAE law requires the controller to provide the record to the authority upon request, but the modality may be slightly different than the GDPR requirement"}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict might be too narrow, as it only applies to sensitive personal data.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "span": "مسك سجل خاص للبيانات الشخصية", "why": "Article 7(4) limits the obligation to maintain a record to sensitive personal data."}, {"id": "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "span": "مسك سجل خاص للبيانات الشخصية التي تتم معالجتها نيابة عن المتحكم", "why": "Article 8(7) requires the processor to maintain a record of processing activities."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "c34922f387019af45e42", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "57844ac856d11c289650", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "dec351a1e477287e3b22"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 362.0, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "ae9e63d02ac568ed971b", "mutation_id": "4f0890df828f67349484", "mtype": "narrow", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["9630e6d967b64e07d339", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "9c38ab11b550755816f5"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "reason": "Right to object/stop processing; does not address appointing a representative/DPO or being addressable by authorities/data subjects."}, {"id": "0897840c01b58a706cd5", "reason": "Administrative sanctions framework; not about designation or contactability of a representative/DPO."}, {"id": "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "reason": "General processor obligations and record-keeping; any DPO contact details are incidental and do not establish representative/DPO addressability."}, {"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "reason": "Security measures; unrelated to representative/DPO being addressable."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification; unrelated to representative/DPO being addressable."}, {"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "reason": "General obligation to provide contact methods for the controller; not the distinct channel via a representative/DPO."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated decision-making; not about representative/DPO or addressability."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Complaint to the Office; does not speak to representative/DPO designation or being the addressee."}, {"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "Scope of application; does not create a representative/DPO contact point."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على المتحكم أو المعالج", "article": "Article 10(3)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب على المتحكم والمعالج", "article": "Article 10(1)"}, "action": {"span": "تحديد عنوان الاتصال بمسؤول حماية البيانات وإخطار المكتب بذلك", "article": "Article 10(3)"}, "scope": {"span": "بكل ما يتعلق ببياناته الشخصية ومعالجتها", "article": "Article 12(2)"}, "condition": {"span": "تعيين مسؤول لحماية البيانات ... وذلك في أي من الأحوال الآتية:", "article": "Article 10(1)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "Controller or processor that designates a representative", "target_value": "المتحكم أو المعالج (الملزمان بإتاحة قناة عبر مسؤول حماية البيانات)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 10(3)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "Obligation (shall)", "target_value": "يجب/على (صيغة إلزام)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 10(1); Art. 10(3)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "Mandate the representative to be addressable, in addition to or instead of the controller or processor, by supervisory authorities and data subjects on all issues related to processing for ensuring compliance", "target_value": "تحديد عنوان الاتصال بمسؤول حماية البيانات وإخطار المكتب؛ يعمل كحلقة وصل مع المكتب؛ لصاحب البيانات التواصل مباشرة مع مسؤول حماية البيانات وتلقي الطلبات والشكاوى", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 10(3); Art. 11(1)(د); Art. 12(2); Art. 11(1)(ب)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "All issues related to processing; for the purposes of ensuring compliance with the GDPR", "target_value": "بكل ما يتعلق ببياناته الشخصية ومعالجتها (للأفراد) وبشأن تطبيق أحكام معالجة البيانات الشخصية (مع المكتب)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 12(2); Art. 11(1)(د)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "When a representative is designated under Article 27(1)", "target_value": "عند تعيين مسؤول حماية البيانات وفق الأحوال المحددة", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 10(1)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No exception stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No temporal element stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No consequence stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.73, "reasoning_note": "UAE law does not create an EU-style ‘representative’, but the DPO regime functionally supplies an addressable point for both the supervisory authority and data subjects. The trigger (appointing a DPO) and the “in addition to or instead of” nuance differ from GDPR Art. 27, so mapping is conceptual/partial rather than full. The objection is valid that the condition is not uncovered because Art. 10 and 11 establish a parallel construct via the DPO.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-222", "gdpr_article": 27, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 9, "total": 9}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 16}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 19}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions cited by the analyst do not fully support the claim that the UAE jurisdiction has a counterpart to the GDPR requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "span": "Article 10(1)", "why": "This provision does not explicitly require the DPO to be addressable by supervisory authorities and data subjects."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "span": "Article 12(2)", "why": "This provision does not explicitly require the DPO to be addressable by supervisory authorities."}, {"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "span": "Article 11(1)(د)", "why": "This provision suggests that the DPO may have some role in communicating with supervisory authorities, but it does not explicitly require the DPO to be addressable by them."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim that the 'condition' slot is 'uncovered' is not entirely accurate, as Article 10(1) and Article 11(1)(د) of the UAE law provide similar concepts to designating a representative.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "span": "يجب على المتحكم والمعالج تعيين مسؤول لحماية البيانات", "why": "This provision requires the controller or processor to appoint a data protection officer, which could be seen as similar to designating a representative."}, {"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "span": "يعمل كحلقة وصل بين المتحكم أو المعالج حسب الأحوال والمكتب", "why": "This provision implies that the data protection officer has a role in communicating with the authorities and data subjects, similar to the representative in the GDPR."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "0897840c01b58a706cd5", "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "c34922f387019af45e42", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 463.52, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "53ae9d8d5c6fa9efab2d", "mutation_id": "cb09687204ce01801ebe", "mtype": "narrow", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "e8fe267db21063b1b45f"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "62dc9e8ad2aa962982ad", "reason": "Transparency/consent conditions before providing service; does not regulate records of processing or their contents."}, {"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "reason": "Legal bases for processing; no requirement about maintaining records or including controller identifiers."}, {"id": "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "reason": "Ongoing processing/transparency requirements; not about records of processing activities or mandated record fields."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على مقدم خدمة الاتصالات وتقنية المعلومات اتخاذ الآتي", "article": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a (المادة الخامسة)"}, "modality": {"span": "على ... اتخاذ الآتي", "article": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a (المادة الخامسة)"}, "action": {"span": "الاحتفاظ بسجلات أنشطة المعالجة، على أن تتضمن السجلات كافة المعلومات التالية: 4.1. اسم وبيانات الاتصال بمقدم الخدمة، وممثله إذا كان خارج دولة الكويت ومسؤول حماية البيانات.", "article": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a (المادة الخامسة، البند 4 و4.1)"}, "scope": {"span": "سجلات أنشطة المعالجة", "article": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a (المادة الخامسة، البند 4)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "مقدم خدمة الاتصالات وتقنية المعلومات", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a (Art. 5 chapeau); see also e8fe267db21063b1b45f (Art. 1) for scope limited to licensed service providers"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation (shall)", "target_value": "على ... اتخاذ الآتي", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a (Art. 5)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "include the name and contact details of the controller in the record", "target_value": "أن تتضمن السجلات ... اسم وبيانات الاتصال بمقدم الخدمة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a (Art. 5(4), 5(4.1))"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "the record of processing activities maintained under Article 30(1)", "target_value": "سجلات أنشطة المعالجة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a (Art. 5(4))"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.79, "reasoning_note": "While the term “controller” is not used, Art. 5 places an obligation on ICT service providers to keep processing records that include “اسم وبيانات الاتصال بمقدم الخدمة,” which functionally corresponds to the controller’s name and contact details. The addressee is narrower (licensed service providers) than GDPR’s general “controller.” The counter-evidence is addressed by the explicit inclusion of name and contact details in Art. 5(4.1).", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-255", "gdpr_article": 30, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 1, "total": 1}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 5}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 5}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The target jurisdiction's terminology and scope might be slightly different from the GDPR requirement unit (RU-255)", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "span": "Article 5(4.1): \"اسم وبيانات الاتصال بمقدم الخدمة\"", "why": "The term 'مقدم الخدمة' (service provider) might not be exactly equivalent to the GDPR term 'controller'"}, {"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "span": "Article 5(4): \"الاحتفاظ بسجلات أنشطة المعالجة\"", "why": "The provision requires the controller to maintain records of processing activities, but it does not explicitly state that the controller shall include the name and contact details in the record"}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The addressee slot is not entirely covered by the KWT law, as the provision cited by the analyst does not explicitly mention the controller.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "span": "المادة الخامسة: أمن وحماية البيانات الشخصية على مقدم خدمة الاتصالات وتقنية المعلومات اتخاذ الآتي", "why": "The provision does not explicitly mention the controller or the name and contact details of the controller."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 5, "candidate_ids": ["e8fe267db21063b1b45f", "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "62dc9e8ad2aa962982ad", "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 303.57, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "70554361f0a1263963a1", "mutation_id": "101c815bd9331342f6e3", "mtype": "narrow", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["d9a05a425b46428120ee"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "21847c9e87d6df45a9a7", "reason": "Data quality obligations; does not address cooperation with a supervisory authority."}, {"id": "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "reason": "Public interest processing by public authorities; not about controller–supervisory authority cooperation."}, {"id": "17d4b446ea6ed7965d08", "reason": "Procedures for responding to data subject rights; not cooperation with supervisory authority."}, {"id": "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "reason": "Legal bases/exceptions for collection and further processing; not cooperation with supervisory authority."}, {"id": "ce107f77eb9119ba01b0", "reason": "Privacy policy content; not cooperation with supervisory authority."}, {"id": "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "reason": "Notice to data subjects; not cooperation with supervisory authority."}, {"id": "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "reason": "Processing for a realized interest of the data subject; no supervisory authority cooperation rule."}, {"id": "a7597ada8323b333cc94", "reason": "Collection principles (purpose limitation, data minimization); not cooperation with supervisory authority."}, {"id": "7780dca28ee02b6e0f07", "reason": "Guardian rules for minors/incapacitated data subjects; not supervisory authority cooperation."}, {"id": "7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "reason": "Disclosure, including upon request of a public authority for security/judicial purposes; not cooperation with the PDPL supervisory authority."}, {"id": "90da7bc2380e8f3f2fb8", "reason": "Timing/means to respond to data subject requests; not cooperation with supervisory authority."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "جهة التحكم", "article": "Article 30(3)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجوز لجهة التحكم", "article": "Article 30(3)"}, "action": {"span": "التعاون مع الجهة المختصة", "article": "Article 30(3)"}, "scope": {"span": "في سبيل مباشرتها مهماتها المتعلقة بالإشراف على تطبيق أحكام النظام واللوائح", "article": "Article 30(3)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "جهة التحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 30(3)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation (shall)", "target_value": "يجوز (may/permitted)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Art. 30(3)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "cooperate with the supervisory authority", "target_value": "التعاون مع الجهة المختصة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 30(3)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "in the performance of the supervisory authority's tasks", "target_value": "في سبيل مباشرتها مهماتها المتعلقة بالإشراف على تطبيق أحكام النظام واللوائح", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 30(3)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "on request by the supervisory authority", "target_value": "No explicit 'on request' condition tied to the controller's cooperation", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "n/a"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "n/a"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "n/a"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "n/a"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.63, "reasoning_note": "Article 30(3) contains the cooperation concept but uses permissive language (يجوز), not a duty, and it does not condition cooperation ‘on request’. While Art. 30(4)(a) empowers the authority to request documents, the text does not create a corresponding obligation on controllers to cooperate upon request. Therefore, modality is weaker and the ‘on request’ condition is not captured.", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-311", "gdpr_article": 31, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 13, "total": 25}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 30}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim of a weaker modality is not entirely accurate, as the provisions suggest an obligation to cooperate with the supervisory authority and respond to requests from the data subject.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "d9a05a425b46428120ee", "span": "يجوز لجهة التحكم التعاون مع الجهة المختصة في سبيل مباشرتها مهماتها المتعلقة بالإشراف على تطبيق أحكام النظام واللوائح", "why": "This provision suggests that the controller has an obligation to cooperate with the supervisory authority."}, {"id": "d9a05a425b46428120ee", "span": "طلب الوثائق أو المعلومات اللازمة من جهة التحكم للتأكد من التزامها بأحكام النظام واللوائح", "why": "This provision implies that the supervisory authority has the power to request documents or information from the controller, and the controller is obligated to provide them."}, {"id": "17d4b446ea6ed7965d08", "span": "على جهة التحكم عند تلقيها طلباً من صاحب البيانات الشخصية يتعلق بحقوقه المنصوص عليها في النظام القيام بما يلي", "why": "This provision implies that the controller has an obligation to respond to requests from the data subject."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The modality of the provision in Article 30(3) is weaker than the GDPR requirement, and the condition for cooperation is not explicitly stated as 'on request'.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "d9a05a425b46428120ee", "span": "يجوز لجهة التحكم التعاون مع الجهة المختصة", "why": "The use of 'يجوز' (may) instead of 'يجب' (shall) or 'يتعين' (must) suggests a permission rather than an obligation."}, {"id": "d9a05a425b46428120ee", "span": "طلب الوثائق أو المعلومات اللازمة", "why": "The condition for cooperation is not explicitly stated as 'on request', which may not be equivalent to the GDPR requirement."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["21847c9e87d6df45a9a7", "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "17d4b446ea6ed7965d08", "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "ce107f77eb9119ba01b0", "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "a7597ada8323b333cc94", "7780dca28ee02b6e0f07", "7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "d9a05a425b46428120ee", "90da7bc2380e8f3f2fb8"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 319.38, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "06d29399071fcdf3a407", "mutation_id": "dfa8437b5ac237c59b91", "mtype": "modal_down", "required": "C3", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["877fafe0080725188d05", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Information right about procedures (إجراءات تصحيح أو محو...) only; does not confer a rectification right."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Addresses data portability, not rectification."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Addresses automated decision-making; not rectification."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification obligations; not rectification."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Complaints/enforcement mechanism; not the rectification right itself."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Provides right to restriction when accuracy is contested; related but not a rectification right."}, {"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "reason": "Obligation to provide contact methods to exercise rights; ancillary, not the rectification right."}, {"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "reason": "Right to object/stop processing; not rectification."}, {"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "Scope of law and exclusions; not rectification."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment; not rectification."}], "target_frame": {"proposition": {"span": "يحق لصاحب البيانات من مواطني الدولة طلب تصحيح بياناته الشخصية غير الدقيقة، أو استكمالها لدى المتحكم دون تأخير غير مبرر.", "article": "Article 15(1)"}, "addressee": {"span": "صاحب البيانات من مواطني الدولة", "article": "Article 15(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "يحق", "article": "Article 15(1)"}, "action": {"span": "طلب تصحيح بياناته الشخصية غير الدقيقة، أو استكمالها لدى المتحكم", "article": "Article 15(1)"}, "scope": {"span": "بياناته الشخصية غير الدقيقة", "article": "Article 15(1)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "دون تأخير غير مبرر", "article": "Article 15(1)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "The data subject has the right to obtain from the controller the rectification of inaccurate personal data concerning him or her.", "target_value": "A data subject who is a citizen has the right to request correction or completion of inaccurate personal data with the controller without undue delay; controllers must have measures to ensure correction of inaccurate data.", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": ["Article 15(1)", "Article 5(5)"], "slot": "proposition"}, {"gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "صاحب البيانات من مواطني الدولة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": ["Article 15(1)"], "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "يحق", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ["Article 15(1)"], "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "obtain from the controller the rectification", "target_value": "طلب تصحيح ... لدى المتحكم; وأن تتوفر تدابير وإجراءات لضمان ... تصحيح البيانات الشخصية غير الصحيحة", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": ["Article 15(1)", "Article 5(5)"], "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "inaccurate personal data concerning the data subject", "target_value": "بياناته الشخصية غير الدقيقة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ["Article 15(1)"], "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": [], "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": [], "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "without undue delay", "target_value": "دون تأخير غير مبرر", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ["Article 15(1)"], "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": [], "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.75, "reasoning_note": "UAE Article 15(1) grants a rectification right only to citizens and phrases it as a right to request correction, while Article 5(5) imposes a controller duty to have measures ensuring correction. This combination is functionally weaker than the GDPR’s right to obtain rectification and narrower in addressee.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-140", "gdpr_article": 16, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 13}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE jurisdiction's counterpart is narrower in scope, as it only applies to citizens of the UAE.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "span": "يحق لصاحب البيانات من مواطني الدولة طلب تصحيح بياناته الشخصية غير الدقيقة، أو استكمالها لدى المتحكم دون تأخير غير مبرر", "why": "The phrase 'من مواطني الدولة' limits the scope to citizens of the UAE."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict does not fully capture the limitations and nuances of the UAE law, specifically the limitation of Article 15(1) to citizens of the State and the requirement of Article 5(5) for controllers to have measures in place to correct inaccurate personal data.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "span": "يحق لصاحب البيانات من مواطني الدولة طلب تصحيح بياناته الشخصية غير الدقيقة، أو استكمالها لدى المتحكم دون تأخير غير مبرر", "why": "This provision limits the right to request rectification to citizens of the State."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "span": "أن تتوفر تدابير وإجراءات لضمان ... تصحيح البيانات الشخصية غير الصحيحة", "why": "This provision requires controllers to have measures in place to correct inaccurate personal data, but does not explicitly grant the data subject the right to request rectification."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "877fafe0080725188d05", "c34922f387019af45e42", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "9630e6d967b64e07d339"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 277.85, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "a24938511a8c99353dac", "mutation_id": "45649d8ee4bab82bee1d", "mtype": "narrow", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "1828db55e11b26ceda54", "8e585010f3f5f3f24dbb", "bd5a2bbf9e9652a21d70", "652b328bac75ed18d3be"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "601ddc5fd8dcb81306cb", "reason": "Board governance/policy powers; does not establish the authority’s duty to monitor application of the law."}, {"id": "129b122a7d0386567e65", "reason": "CEO administrative functions; not about monitoring the application of the law."}, {"id": "4415e9a46823d9615000", "reason": "Procedural tool for investigations; does not state a monitoring mandate."}, {"id": "d962cad99243b9952541", "reason": "Post-investigation decisions; not the general monitoring duty."}, {"id": "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "reason": "Notification obligations on controllers; not the authority’s monitoring task."}, {"id": "c24849787475f274ecac", "reason": "Sanctioning measures upon violations; does not establish the monitoring mandate."}, {"id": "3bf5db493f62912c0a15", "reason": "DPO disclosure duty; irrelevant to supervisory authority monitoring."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "الهيئة", "article": "Article 30"}, "modality": {"span": "على الهيئة ممارسة مهامها وصلاحياتها بكفاءة وفاعلية وشفافية ودون تمييز وعلى نحو مناسب", "article": "Article 31"}, "action": {"span": "مراقبة مدى الالتزام بأحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Article 30(2)"}, "scope": {"span": "تسري أحكام هذا القانون على الأشخاص الآتي ذكرهم: أ - كل شخص طبيعي يقيم عادة في المملكة أو له مقر عمل فيها. ب - كل شخص اعتباري له مقر عمل في المملكة. ج - كل شخص طبيعي أو اعتباري ... يعالِج بيانات باستخدام وسائل موجودة في المملكة", "article": "Article 2(2)"}, "condition": {"span": "القيام بالمهام والصلاحيات الأخرى المنصوص عليها في هذا القانون", "article": "Article 30(15)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "each supervisory authority", "target_value": "الهيئة (السلطة المختصة بحماية البيانات الشخصية الحساسة)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 30", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation (shall)", "target_value": "على الهيئة ممارسة مهامها وصلاحياتها", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 31", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "monitor the application of this Regulation", "target_value": "مراقبة مدى الالتزام بأحكام هذا القانون", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 30(2)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "on its territory", "target_value": "تسري أحكام هذا القانون على الأشخاص والعمليات المرتبطة بالمملكة (في المملكة/وسائل موجودة في المملكة)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 2(2)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "without prejudice to other tasks set out under this Regulation", "target_value": "القيام بالمهام والصلاحيات الأخرى المنصوص عليها في هذا القانون؛ وتعدد مهام الهيئة في المادة (30) مع وجوب ممارستها لمهامها وصلاحياتها", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 30(15); Article 30 (chapeau); Article 31", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.62, "reasoning_note": "Bahrain’s law gives the Authority a duty to exercise its functions and expressly includes monitoring compliance with the law, and the law’s territorial scope is the Kingdom. The specific GDPR nuance “without prejudice to other tasks” is not explicitly stated; however, Article 30 enumerates multiple tasks and preserves ‘other tasks’ in 30(15), which functionally indicates monitoring does not displace other duties. Accordingly, that slot is only partially covered.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-662", "gdpr_article": 57, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 11, "total": 23}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 26}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The cited provisions do not fully support the claim that the Bahraini law has a counterpart to the GDPR requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 30", "span": "مراقبة مدى الالتزام بأحكام هذا القانون", "why": "Only mentions monitoring the application of the law in relation to data protection, not the entire regulation."}, {"id": "Article 31", "span": "ممارسة المهام والصلاحيات بإجراء المشاورات على الهيئة", "why": "Does not explicitly state that the Authority is obliged to monitor the application of the regulation."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The BHR provisions do not explicitly capture the nuance of the GDPR requirement, specifically the phrase 'without prejudice to other tasks set out under this Regulation'", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 30", "span": "مراقبة مدى الالتزام بأحكام هذا القانون", "why": "This provision mentions monitoring compliance, but does not explicitly state that it is without prejudice to other tasks"}, {"id": "Article 31", "span": "بكفاءة وفاعلية وشفافية ودون تمييز وعلى نحو مناسب", "why": "This provision mentions the authority's exercise of powers, but does not explicitly state that it is without prejudice to other tasks"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["601ddc5fd8dcb81306cb", "652b328bac75ed18d3be", "8e585010f3f5f3f24dbb", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "129b122a7d0386567e65", "4415e9a46823d9615000", "d962cad99243b9952541", "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "c24849787475f274ecac", "1828db55e11b26ceda54", "bd5a2bbf9e9652a21d70", "3bf5db493f62912c0a15"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 341.87, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "7f273372a490c43e950a", "mutation_id": "22a47ab8aa8c3a952391", "mtype": "narrow", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "reason": "Sets lawful bases for processing; does not address implementing or maintaining data-protection policies."}, {"id": "a418980931b429c7909a", "reason": "Breach-notification content and timing; no requirement to implement internal data-protection policies."}, {"id": "e8fe267db21063b1b45f", "reason": "Scope clause defining who is covered; contains no operative requirement about policies."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "مقدم الخدمة", "article": "Article 5 (chapeau)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجوز", "article": "Article 5 (chapeau)"}, "action": {"span": "تطوير والالتزام بسياسات داخلية للحماية وخصوصية البيانات", "article": "Article 5(7)"}, "scope": {"span": "توفير التدابير الأمنية المناسبة", "article": "Article 5(1)"}, "condition": {"span": "ويجوز أن تكون هذه التدابير ملائمة لطبيعة ونطاق أنشطته وحساسية أي بيانات شخصية يتم جمعها وتخزينها", "article": "Article 5(1)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "مقدم الخدمة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 5 (chapeau)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation (shall)", "target_value": "يجوز (may)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Article 5 (chapeau)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "implement appropriate data protection policies as part of the measures", "target_value": "تطوير والالتزام بسياسات داخلية للحماية وخصوصية البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 5(7)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "as part of the measures established under Article 24(1)", "target_value": "سياسات داخلية ضمن تدابير أمن وحماية البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 5 (title and list)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "where proportionate in relation to processing activities", "target_value": "يجوز أن تكون هذه التدابير ملائمة لطبيعة ونطاق الأنشطة وحساسية البيانات", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 5(1)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "weaker_modality", "confidence": 0.73, "reasoning_note": "Although Article 5(7) explicitly references developing and adhering to internal data-protection/privacy policies, it sits under the chapeau ‘يجوز لمقدم الخدمة اتخاذ الآتي’, which makes the entire list permissive. The noun ‘الالتزام’ describes adherence as part of the optional action; it does not override the controlling permissive modal. Article 4(1) imposes an obligation to provide information about policies, but that is transparency about policies rather than an obligation to implement them.", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-207", "gdpr_article": 24, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 2, "total": 2}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 5}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 5}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim of a weaker modality and less comprehensive scope for data protection in KWT legislation may not fully account for the specific measures and conditions outlined in Articles 4 and 5.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "span": "المادة الخامسة: أمن وحماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This article outlines specific security measures, including the development of internal policies for data protection, which suggests a stronger commitment to data protection than initially claimed."}, {"id": "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "span": "المادة الرابعة: شروط جمع ومعالجة البيانات", "why": "This article provides a detailed framework for the collection and processing of data, emphasizing transparency, security, and the protection of personal data, which could be seen as equivalent to or broader than the GDPR's requirements."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict of 'weaker_modality' is potentially incorrect due to the presence of an obligation in Article 5, section 7.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "span": "تطوير والالتزام بسياسات داخلية للحماية وخصوصية البيانات", "why": "The use of the word 'الالتزام' (comply) implies an obligation rather than a permission."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 5, "candidate_ids": ["9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "a418980931b429c7909a", "e8fe267db21063b1b45f"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 351.95, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "42087dc946d1c48ce8b9", "mutation_id": "0051a17dfcb3febaf35d", "mtype": "modal_down", "required": "C3", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["db1b46495b01511abeef", "05b7537a91d92a0529ad"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "reason": "Sets DPO qualifications/competence; does not impose or describe an obligation to inform controller/processor/employees."}, {"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "reason": "Obligations on the controller to set processing controls; no DPO informing duty."}, {"id": "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "reason": "General obligation on controller/processor to follow Ministry procedures; not about DPO informing others."}, {"id": "a4136d70ee84d058ef85", "reason": "Requires publishing DPO contact details and data subject access; not an informing duty toward controller/processor/employees."}, {"id": "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "reason": "Mandates privacy policy visibility for data subjects; unrelated to DPO informing controller/processor/employees."}, {"id": "3a6219e8839cbad1f76e", "reason": "Breach notification duties; not about DPO informing internal parties of legal obligations."}, {"id": "40626451a5025d77cff5", "reason": "Pre-processing notice to data subjects; not a DPO informing duty."}, {"id": "487015f110e7b88b5c03", "reason": "Controller must attach DPO policy and breach measures to permit; not about DPO informing."}, {"id": "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "reason": "Permit application contents (including DPO contact); not about DPO informing."}, {"id": "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "reason": "Substantive/exemption scope of the law; not about DPO informing."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 35"}, "modality": {"span": "يتولى مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية المهام الآتية:", "article": "Article 35"}, "action": {"span": "تقديم المقترحات والاستشارات للمتحكم فيما يتعلق بالتزاماته الواردة في القانون وهذه اللائحة.", "article": "Article 35(1)"}, "scope": {"span": "التزاماته الواردة في القانون وهذه اللائحة", "article": "Article 35(1)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "data protection officer", "target_value": "مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 35"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يتولى ... المهام الآتية (shall undertake the following tasks)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 35"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "inform the controller or the processor and the employees who carry out processing of their data protection obligations", "target_value": "تقديم المقترحات والاستشارات للمتحكم فيما يتعلق بالتزاماته (provide proposals and consultations to the controller regarding its obligations)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 35(1)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "obligations under the GDPR and other Union or Member State data protection provisions", "target_value": "الالتزامات الواردة في القانون وهذه اللائحة (obligations under the Law and this Regulation)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 35(1)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.64, "reasoning_note": "Article 35(1) assigns the DPO an advisory/informational role toward the controller regarding its obligations, but does not mention informing the processor or employees who carry out processing. Therefore, the target text only partially covers the GDPR requirement’s action/recipients dimension.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-474", "gdpr_article": 39, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 18}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 18}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The action slot verdict is not fully supported by the citation, as Article 35(1) only requires the data protection officer to provide proposals and consultations to the controller, but not to inform the employees who carry out processing of their obligations.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "db1b46495b01511abeef", "span": "تقديم المقترحات والاستشارات للمتحكم فيما يتعلق بالتزاماته الواردة في القانون وهذه اللائحة", "why": "This provision only requires the data protection officer to provide proposals and consultations to the controller, but not to inform the employees who carry out processing of their obligations."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The target jurisdiction's provisions do not fully cover the GDPR's requirement to inform the controller or the processor and the employees who carry out processing of their obligations under the GDPR and other Union or Member State data protection provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "db1b46495b01511abeef", "span": "يتولى مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية المهام الآتية: 1- تقديم المقترحات والاستشارات للمتحكم فيما يتعلق بالتزاماته الواردة في القانون وهذه اللائحة.", "why": "This provision does not explicitly mention informing the employees who carry out processing of their obligations."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "db1b46495b01511abeef", "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "487015f110e7b88b5c03", "a4136d70ee84d058ef85", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "3a6219e8839cbad1f76e", "40626451a5025d77cff5", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 311.54, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "0d2338bf159951b12f33", "mutation_id": "c393eec583ca008a0103", "mtype": "narrow", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["f1d11d7b0c4a6479bbe4", "f6764b5004b8f04e4aa5", "3f916831456908af27d8"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "de8d26aee9201d58a52b", "reason": "Permit revocation grounds; not about administrative fines or their ceilings."}, {"id": "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "reason": "Breach-response measures (assessment, notification guidance, support); no administrative fine standards or ceilings."}, {"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "reason": "Controller obligations; not an enforcement or fine-ceiling rule."}, {"id": "7b56358becb03a8bf986", "reason": "Criminal fine for breach of Article 14; not an administrative fine imposed by the supervisory authority."}, {"id": "ed63575833a240a362fd", "reason": "Criminal fine for breach of Article 13; not an administrative fine imposed by the supervisory authority."}, {"id": "13bae20e5c1ff4e6a64b", "reason": "Criminal fines for breaches of specified articles; not administrative fines by the supervisory authority."}, {"id": "f09642dcc53965e1f6de", "reason": "Criminal liability of legal persons; not administrative fines by the supervisory authority."}, {"id": "c7ddf58d01bb4d45c9d5", "reason": "Notification duty about permit data changes; not about administrative fines."}, {"id": "dcd007160208896c8632", "reason": "Breach notification timeline/content; not about administrative fines."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجوز للوزارة فرض جزاءات إدارية", "article": "Article 32"}, "modality": {"span": "على ألا تزيد الغرامة الإدارية على (2000) ألفي ريال عماني", "article": "Article 32"}, "action": {"span": "غرامة إدارية لا تزيد على (2000) ألفي ريال عماني لكل مخالفة", "article": "Article 44"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": "في حالة مخالفة أحكام هذه اللائحة", "article": "Article 44"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "supervisory authority", "target_value": "the Ministry/the Minister as the competent authority to impose administrative sanctions", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 32; Article 44", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "prohibition", "target_value": "shall not exceed (لا تزيد) a stated ceiling for administrative fines", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 32", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "impose an administrative fine exceeding the higher of 20 000 000 EUR or, for an undertaking, 4% of worldwide annual turnover", "target_value": "impose an administrative fine with a fixed ceiling of 2000 OMR (per violation)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 44", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "in accordance with paragraph 2 (criteria for assessment in Art. 83(2))", "target_value": "no textual criteria cross-reference or assessment factors stated for setting administrative fine amounts", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "for infringements of the data subjects' rights pursuant to Articles 12 to 22", "target_value": "for violations of the regulation/law generally", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 44", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.64, "reasoning_note": "Articles 32 and 44 establish who may impose administrative fines and set a fixed ceiling (2000 OMR), but they do not provide assessment criteria akin to GDPR Art. 83(2). Article 8 lists non-monetary protective measures and a bylaw-based framework, not standards for calibrating fine amounts. Therefore, the ‘scope’ qualifier “in accordance with paragraph 2” remains textually unexpressed in the target materials.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-514", "gdpr_article": 42, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 20}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 22}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is based on incomplete information and does not fully address the GDPR requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "f1d11d7b0c4a6479bbe4", "span": "مع عدم الإخلال بالعقوبات المنصوص عليها في هذا القانون، يجوز للوزارة فرض جزاءات إدارية على المخالفات التي يتم ارتكابها من قبل المرخص لهم من الوزارة بالمخالفة لأحكام هذا القانون أو اللائحة أو القرارات الصادرة تنفيذاً له", "why": "The provision mentions administrative fines, but the amount is limited to 2000 OMR, which is significantly lower than the GDPR's maximum fine of 20,000,000 EUR or 4% of the total worldwide annual turnover."}, {"id": "f6764b5004b8f04e4aa5", "span": "يجوز للوزير توقيع أحد الجزاءات الإدارية الآتية في حالة مخالفة أحكام هذه اللائحة: 1- الإنذار. 2- وقف التصريح لحين إزالة المخالفة. 3- غرامة إدارية لا تزيد على (2000) ألفي ريال عماني لكل مخالفة", "why": "The provision mentions administrative fines, but the amount is limited to 2000 OMR per violation, which is significantly lower than the GDPR's maximum fine."}, {"id": "7b56358becb03a8bf986", "span": "يعاقب بغرامة لا تقل عن (500) خمسمائة ريال عماني، ولا تزيد على (2000) ألفي ريال عماني، كل من يخالف أحكام المادة (14) من هذا القانون", "why": "The provision mentions a fine range of 500-2000 OMR, which is significantly lower than the GDPR's maximum fine."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The scope slot may not be entirely 'uncovered' due to the presence of standards or criteria for imposing administrative fines in Articles 8 and 32.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "f1d11d7b0c4a6479bbe4", "span": "مع عدم الإخلال بالعقوبات المنصوص عليها في هذا القانون، يجوز للوزارة فرض جزاءات إدارية على المخالفات التي يتم ارتكابها من قبل المرخص لهم من الوزارة بالمخالفة لأحكام هذا القانون أو اللائحة أو القرارات الصادرة تنفيذاً له", "why": "This provision implies that there are standards or criteria for imposing administrative fines."}, {"id": "3f916831456908af27d8", "span": "تتخذ الوزارة في سبيل حماية حقوق أصحاب البيانات الشخصية أياً من الإجراءات الآتية", "why": "This provision suggests that there are standards or criteria for imposing administrative fines to protect the rights of data subjects."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["f1d11d7b0c4a6479bbe4", "f6764b5004b8f04e4aa5", "de8d26aee9201d58a52b", "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "7b56358becb03a8bf986", "3f916831456908af27d8", "f09642dcc53965e1f6de", "ed63575833a240a362fd", "13bae20e5c1ff4e6a64b", "c7ddf58d01bb4d45c9d5", "dcd007160208896c8632"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 377.2, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "f035e43bc815313d562a", "mutation_id": "913a043af01436929c27", "mtype": "narrow", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["c24849787475f274ecac", "14fe9b230c7ba11703d5"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "762372b7329c44286e43", "reason": "Sets lawful bases for processing; does not address liability for damage."}, {"id": "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "reason": "Conditions for processing sensitive data; no rule on civil liability or damages."}, {"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "reason": "Grants rectification/blocking/erasure rights; not a damages-liability provision."}, {"id": "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "reason": "Regulates processing of criminal-justice data; no liability-for-damages rule."}, {"id": "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "reason": "Access/information right; no liability-for-damages rule."}, {"id": "2ef716a5a0437defc8f2", "reason": "Cross-border transfer exceptions; not about liability for damage."}, {"id": "4415e9a46823d9615000", "reason": "Procedural (investigatory appointments); no liability-for-damages rule."}, {"id": "5bd7541a2690632a7c77", "reason": "Consent requirements; not about liability for damage."}, {"id": "231a37f671238dbf7112", "reason": "Definitions for a decision; no liability-for-damages rule."}, {"id": "eb633917dcbabe34df47", "reason": "Automated-decision safeguards; not about liability for damage."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المخالف", "article": "Article 55(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "مع عدم الإخلال بالمسئولية المدنية أو الجنائية", "article": "Article 55(1)"}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": "الضرر الذي أصاب صاحب البيانات نتيجة لذلك", "article": "Article 55(2)"}, "condition": {"span": "عند ثبوت المخالفة", "article": "Article 55(1)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller involved in processing", "target_value": "المخالف", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 55(1)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation (shall be liable)", "target_value": "مع عدم الإخلال بالمسئولية المدنية أو الجنائية؛ يعاقَب ...", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Article 55(1); Article 58 chapeau"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "be liable for the damage caused", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "—"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "damage caused by processing", "target_value": "الضرر الذي أصاب صاحب البيانات نتيجة لذلك", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 55(2)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "the processing infringes this Regulation", "target_value": "عند ثبوت المخالفة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 55(1)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "—"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "—"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "—"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.63, "reasoning_note": "Article 55 targets “the violator” (not specifically controllers) and preserves potential civil/criminal liability, but does not itself impose a duty to compensate for damage. The text only mentions damage as a factor when setting administrative fines and provides criminal penalties (Art. 58). Accordingly, addressee is broader and modality is weaker than GDPR Art. 82’s explicit civil liability rule.", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-930", "gdpr_article": 82, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": "broader", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 14, "total": 26}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 32}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict of 'uncovered' for the slot 'modality' is not entirely accurate. There are provisions that suggest controllers can be held liable for damage caused by processing that infringes the regulation.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "c24849787475f274ecac", "span": "عند ثبوت المخالفة", "why": "This provision implies that there are consequences for controllers who violate the law, which could be interpreted as liability for damage caused."}, {"id": "c24849787475f274ecac", "span": "يأمر مجلس الإدارة المخالف بالتوقف عن المخالفة وإزالة أسبابها أو آثارها", "why": "This provision implies that the controller is responsible for stopping the violation and removing its effects, which could be seen as a form of liability."}, {"id": "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "span": "العقوبات", "why": "This provision lists various penalties for violations of the law, including fines and imprisonment, which suggests that there are consequences for controllers who violate the law."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's slot verdicts for 'addressee' and 'modality' are not entirely accurate", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "c24849787475f274ecac", "span": "مع عدم الإخلال بالمسئولية المدنية أو الجنائية", "why": "The phrase implies that the controller's liability is not limited to administrative sanctions, but also includes civil and criminal liability"}, {"id": "c24849787475f274ecac", "span": "المخالف", "why": "The term refers to the controller that has committed a violation, rather than all controllers involved in processing"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["762372b7329c44286e43", "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "14fe9b230c7ba11703d5", "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "2ef716a5a0437defc8f2", "c24849787475f274ecac", "4415e9a46823d9615000", "5bd7541a2690632a7c77", "231a37f671238dbf7112", "eb633917dcbabe34df47"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 365.14, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "7f41f02204305643c3f3", "mutation_id": "aa76d59fec8cd175efb3", "mtype": "narrow", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "93fde8c87940ae524c86", "7448a27e7806f2c0c143"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "98fa9fe9b0650c71a971", "reason": "Deals with the right to object to direct marketing, not rectification."}, {"id": "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "reason": "Concerns the right to be informed/access about processing, not rectification."}, {"id": "5bd7541a2690632a7c77", "reason": "Regulates consent; no rectification right."}, {"id": "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "reason": "Imposes contract terms for cross-border transfers; mentions correction only in that limited context, not as a general right."}, {"id": "14fe9b230c7ba11703d5", "reason": "Sanctions; not about the substance of rectification rights."}, {"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "reason": "DPO functions; not the rectification right."}, {"id": "1fdf77ac047fc519d30b", "reason": "Right to object to direct marketing; unrelated to rectification."}, {"id": "762372b7329c44286e43", "reason": "Lawful bases for processing; not rectification."}, {"id": "5e5fa8a4888b88a04311", "reason": "Compensation; not rectification."}], "target_frame": {"proposition": {"text": "يجوز لكل صاحب بيانات من مواطني الدولة أن يتقدم إلى مدير البيانات بطلب، مشفوع بما يثبت هويته، لتصحيح أو حَجْب أو مسح البيانات الشخصية الخاصة به بحسب الأحوال", "article": "Article 23(1)"}, "addressee": {"text": "كل صاحب بيانات من مواطني الدولة", "article": "Article 23(1)"}, "modality": {"text": "يجوز لكل صاحب بيانات ... أن يتقدم إلى مدير البيانات بطلب", "article": "Article 23(1)"}, "action": {"text": "لتصحيح أو حَجْب أو مسح البيانات الشخصية الخاصة به بحسب الأحوال", "article": "Article 23(1)"}, "scope": {"text": "وعلى الأخص إذا كانت البيانات غير صحيحة أو ناقصة أو غير محدَّثة", "article": "Article 23(1)"}, "condition": {"text": "إذا كانت معالجتها تتم بالمخالفة لأحكام القانون", "article": "Article 23(1)"}, "exception": {"text": "ما لم يكن لديه مسوِّغ مقبول قانوناً", "article": "Article 23(1)"}, "temporal": {"text": "خلال عشرة أيام عمل من تاريخ تسلُّم الطلب", "article": "Article 23(1)"}, "consequence": {"text": "على مدير البيانات، خلال خمسة عشر يوماً من تاريخ استجابته ... إخطار أيّ طرف ثالث أفصح له عن تلك البيانات عن التصحيح أو المسح أو الحَجْب الذي تم نتيجة الطلب المشار إليه", "article": "Article 23(5)"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "The data subject has the right to obtain from the controller the rectification of inaccurate personal data concerning him or her.", "target_value": "Data subject may apply to the controller to correct his/her personal data, and the controller must comply unless he has a legally acceptable justification.", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 23(1); Article 17(1)(ج)(3)", "slot": "proposition"}, {"gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "each data subject who is a citizen of the state", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 23(1)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "may apply (right) + controller obliged to respond", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 23(1)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "obtain from the controller the rectification", "target_value": "submit a request to correct personal data; controller must respond", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 23(1)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "inaccurate personal data concerning the data subject", "target_value": "data that are inaccurate, incomplete, or not updated", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 23(1)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "processing contrary to the law (including inaccuracy); request accompanied by proof of identity", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 23(1); Article 3(4)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "controller may refuse with a legally acceptable justification; public registers may follow special correction procedures", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 23(1) (\"ما لم يكن لديه مسوغ مقبول قانوناً\"); Article 23(2)", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "without undue delay", "target_value": "within ten working days from receipt of the request", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Article 23(1)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "notify third parties who received the data of the correction/blocking/deletion within 15 days, unless impossible", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 23(5)", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.78, "reasoning_note": "Bahrain PDPL grants a rectification right tied to unlawful processing, explicitly including inaccuracy, and obliges controllers to act within 10 working days. However, it narrows beneficiaries to citizens and introduces refusal grounds and a public-register carve-out, and fixes a deadline rather than using an ‘undue delay’ standard. The core rectification function for inaccurate data is present but with constraints.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-140", "gdpr_article": 16, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": "broader", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 20}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 25}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "98fa9fe9b0650c71a971", "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "93fde8c87940ae524c86", "5bd7541a2690632a7c77", "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "14fe9b230c7ba11703d5", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "1fdf77ac047fc519d30b", "762372b7329c44286e43", "5e5fa8a4888b88a04311", "7448a27e7806f2c0c143"], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 182.15, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "cd01669442d7bdbd2756", "mutation_id": 