44(1)(هـ)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "each supervisory authority", "target_value": "الرئيس التنفيذي (عن الهيئة)", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 44(1)(هـ)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "permission", "target_value": "التزام بإعداد التقرير السنوي (لا نص على السماح بإدراج قوائم بأنواع المخالفات أو التدابير المتخذة)", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 44(1)(هـ)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "include in the annual report a list of types of infringement notified and types of measures taken (per Art. 58(2))", "target_value": "لا يوجد نص بإدراج قوائم بأنواع المخالفات المُبلّغ عنها أو التدابير المتخذة", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "content of the annual activity report", "target_value": "تقرير سنوي عن نشاط الهيئة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 44(1)(هـ)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "خلال ثلاثة أشهر على الأكثر من تاريخ انتهاء السنة المالية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 44(1)(هـ)"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.66, "reasoning_note": "Bahrain’s PDPL requires the CEO to prepare an annual report on the Authority’s activities, but there is no text granting permission to include a list of types of infringements notified or types of measures taken. Articles 30 and 55 show the Authority’s powers and available measures, yet they do not tie those lists to the annual report. This addresses the objection: no explicit permissive modal wording exists for including such lists.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-698", "gdpr_article": 59, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 11, "total": 23}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 24}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is based on an incomplete analysis of the provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "129b122a7d0386567e65", "span": "Article 44(1)(هـ)", "why": "The article mentions the preparation of an annual report by the President of the Executive Body, which may include information on infringements and measures taken."}, {"id": "c24849787475f274ecac", "span": "Article 54", "why": "The article states that the President of the Executive Body shall present a report to the Board of Directors, which may include information on the activity of the Authority, including any infringements and measures taken."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's modality claim of 'permission' is not directly supported by the modal wording in the provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 30", "span": "مهام الهيئة وصلاحياتها", "why": "The provision mentions the Authority's tasks and powers, but does not explicitly use the word 'permission'."}, {"id": "Article 44(1)(هـ)", "span": "إعداد تقرير سنوي عن نشاط الهيئة", "why": "The provision mentions the President of the Executive preparing an annual report, but does not explicitly state that the report includes a list of types of infringement notified and types of measures taken."}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["601ddc5fd8dcb81306cb", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "68b279470816abafcdd4", "e38e0bed35316765ba57", "a3c79315ae2d7920a38f", "129b122a7d0386567e65", "10e6e0e9f2f36b4c7b42", "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "d962cad99243b9952541", "c24849787475f274ecac"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 402.55, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "414b094f7e6ef2117101", "mutation_id": "08f89672c7dab33678c4", "mtype": "narrow", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
