الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 32(3) [8394f801a0a97e521f68]"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يتولى ... ويتولى على وجه الخصوص الآتي", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 32(3) [8394f801a0a97e521f68]"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "provide advice as regards the data protection impact assessment", "target_value": "إصدار التوصيات اللازمة لذلك (في سياق الإشراف على إجراءات تقويم الأثر)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 32(3)(ب) [8394f801a0a97e521f68]"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "the data protection impact assessment (DPIA)", "target_value": "إجراءات تقويم الأثر", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 32(3)(ب) [8394f801a0a97e521f68]; see also Article 25 [14105f25ea49e7794aaa]"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "where requested", "target_value": "لا يوجد قيد «بناءً على طلب»؛ الواجب مُقرر بصورة عامة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 32(3)(ب) [8394f801a0a97e521f68]"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.81, "reasoning_note": "Article 32(3)(b) assigns the DPO to supervise DPIA procedures and issue necessary recommendations, which functionally covers advising on DPIAs. The KSA text does not condition this duty on being requested; it is an ongoing responsibility, making the condition broader than GDPR’s “where requested.” Article 25 confirms the DPIA concept and context.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-477", "gdpr_article": 39, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 13, "total": 25}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 27}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The KSA regulations do not explicitly include a 'request' condition for the data protection officer's duty to provide advice regarding data protection impact assessments.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "span": "Article 32(3): \"يتولى مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية في جهة التحكم\"", "why": "This provision outlines the responsibilities of the data protection officer but does not explicitly mention a request condition for providing advice on data protection impact assessments."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The condition 'where requested' is not explicitly covered, but Article 32(3) implies a role for the data protection officer in supervising and advising on data protection impact assessments.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "span": "Article 32(3)", "why": "Implies a supervisory and advisory role for the data protection officer regarding data protection impact assessments."}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "ce107f77eb9119ba01b0", "a79606d0fb564d3b2b5d", "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "33d22a1a65039b5be3f9", "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "06b918a4049719ed530f", "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "14105f25ea49e7794aaa"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 336.36, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "a80b8c3294c16969c673", "mutation_id": "db2b39abde26a0be2854", "mtype": "narrow", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["674524dee00496cb5de7", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "reason": "Security and organizational measures; no duty to cooperate with the supervisory authority."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Data subject right to restriction; no authority-cooperation obligation."}, {"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "Territorial/material scope; does not address cooperation with the authority."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated decision-making rights; no authority-cooperation obligation."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Rectification/erasure rights; no authority-cooperation obligation."}, {"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Data subject information rights; not about cooperating with the supervisory authority."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "Processing principles; no duty to cooperate with the authority."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability right; no authority-cooperation obligation."}, {"id": "57844ac856d11c289650", "reason": "Legal bases for processing; not about cooperation with the authority."}, {"id": "1f0de28c69e3ad65d235", "reason": "Delegation of the Office’s powers; does not impose cooperation duties on controllers."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجب على المتحكم", "article": "Article 7"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب", "article": "Article 7"}, "action": {"span": "تزويد المكتب، وبناءً على قرار من الجهة القضائية المختصة، بأي معلومات يطلبها", "article": "Article 7(6)"}, "scope": {"span": "تنفيذاً لاختصاصاته الواردة في هذا المرسوم بقانون ولائحته التنفيذية", "article": "Article 7(6)"}, "condition": {"span": "على أن يقوم المتحكم بتوفير هذا السجل للمكتب متى ما طلب منه ذلك", "article": "Article 7(4)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 7"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يجب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 7"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "cooperate with the supervisory authority", "target_value": "تزويد المكتب بأي معلومات يطلبها / توفير السجل للمكتب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 7(6); Article 7(4)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "in the performance of the supervisory authority's tasks", "target_value": "تنفيذاً لاختصاصاته الواردة في هذا المرسوم بقانون ولائحته التنفيذية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 7(6)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "on request by the supervisory authority", "target_value": "متى ما طلب منه ذلك (لسجل المعالجة) / بأي معلومات يطلبها (لكن بناءً على قرار قضائي)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 7(4); Article 7(6); see also Article 9(1) \"أية متطلبات أخرى يطلبها المكتب\" (breach-specific)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.67, "reasoning_note": "UAE PDPL imposes on-request duties to provide a processing record (Art. 7(4)) and, more generally, to provide any information the Office requests to perform its functions, but only upon a competent judicial decision (Art. 7(6)). There is no general, unconditional ‘cooperate on request’ duty akin to GDPR Art. 31; breach reporting (Art. 9) is context-specific. Therefore, coverage is partial/narrower rather than full.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-311", "gdpr_article": 31, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 7, "total": 7}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 15}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 19}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE law introduces a condition (judicial decision) for the controller's cooperation with the supervisory authority, which is not present in the GDPR requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "span": "تزويد المكتب، وبناءً على قرار من الجهة القضائية المختصة، بأي معلومات يطلبها تنفيذاً لاختصاصاته الواردة في هذا المرسوم بقانون ولائحته التنفيذية", "why": "Introduces a condition (judicial decision) for cooperation not explicitly mentioned in the GDPR requirement."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE law may not provide an exact counterpart to the GDPR's 'on request' requirement, and the analyst's claim that the UAE law covers this aspect may be unsupported.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 7(4)", "span": "متى ما طلب منه ذلك", "why": "The wording used may not exactly match the GDPR's 'on request' requirement."}, {"id": "Article 7(6)", "span": "بناءً على قرار من الجهة القضائية المختصة", "why": "The wording used may not exactly match the GDPR's 'on request' requirement."}, {"id": "Article 9(1)", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم بمجرد علمه بوجود أي اختراق أو انتهاك للبيانات الشخصية", "why": "The article mentions the controller's obligation to notify the supervisory authority in case of a personal data breach, but it does not explicitly state that the controller shall cooperate with the supervisory authority in the performance of its tasks."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["9d65c2815c41a25064db", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "c34922f387019af45e42", "877fafe0080725188d05", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "57844ac856d11c289650", "1f0de28c69e3ad65d235"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 439.5, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "63624185b43f6bc3742e", "mutation_id": "c438828d61b0ec895613", "mtype": "narrow", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "3daba86dc4c13ff4e918", "34ea02d93464e8e2fa05"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "7e54d45e18f8371cc670", "reason": "Procedural requirements for registering external DPOs; not about controllers’ technical/organizational measures."}, {"id": "23f5fda398d01b0f5865", "reason": "Obligations of DPOs (conflicts, confidentiality); not about controller design/operational measures."}, {"id": "c9145cc9a91d8ff7530c", "reason": "Liability of DPO entities; not about technical/organizational measures."}, {"id": "a8603a05076226e9b8fc", "reason": "Establishes a DPO register; not about implementing measures."}, {"id": "231a37f671238dbf7112", "reason": "Definitions related to the DPO register; not bearing on Art. 25-type measures."}, {"id": "8e585010f3f5f3f24dbb", "reason": "Supervision/inspection of DPOs; not about controller design/operational measures."}, {"id": "762372b7329c44286e43", "reason": "Lawful bases for processing; does not regulate design/operational security/privacy measures."}, {"id": "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "reason": "Data subject right to be informed of processing; not about controller measures."}, {"id": "0c872442bf005518c094", "reason": "Conditions to register an internal DPO; not about technical/organizational measures."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على مدير البيانات", "article": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd Art. 8(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "على مدير البيانات تطبيق", "article": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd Art. 8(1)"}, "action": {"span": "تطبيق التدابير الفنية والتنظيمية الكفيلة بحماية البيانات الشخصية الحساسة", "article": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd Art. 8(1)"}, "scope": {"span": "تقييم التدابير المتخذة لمواجهة المخاطر، بما في ذلك الضمانات والتدابير الأمنية والآليات الكفيلة بحماية البيانات من أجل الامتثال للقانون والقرارات الصادرة تنفيذاً له، مع مراعاة الحقوق والمصالح المشروعة لأصحاب البيانات", "article": "3daba86dc4c13ff4e918 Art. 3(d)(4)"}, "condition": {"span": "مع مراعاة طبيعة المعالجة ونطاقها وسياقها وأغراضها ومخاطرها العالية على حقوق وحريات الأفراد", "article": "3daba86dc4c13ff4e918 Art. 3(a)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "وتطبيق تدابير الأمان في جميع مراحل المعالجة بشكل يتوقع مشاكل الخصوصية ويمنعها قبل حدوثها", "article": "34ea02d93464e8e2fa05 Art. 1 (Privacy by Design definition)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "controller", "target": "مدير البيانات (data controller)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "[7e2914aa34ab2739dafd] Art. 8(1)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "obligation", "target": "Obligatory phrasing: \"على مدير البيانات تطبيق\"", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "[7e2914aa34ab2739dafd] Art. 8(1)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "implement appropriate technical and organisational measures for the processing", "target": "Implement technical and organisational measures to protect sensitive personal data against destruction, loss, alteration, disclosure, access", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "[7e2914aa34ab2739dafd] Art. 8(1)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "measures may include pseudonymisation and aim to meet GDPR requirements and protect data subjects’ rights", "target": "Measures/safeguards are evaluated \"من أجل الامتثال للقانون ... مع مراعاة الحقوق والمصالح المشروعة لأصحاب البيانات\"; no express mention of pseudonymisation", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "[3daba86dc4c13ff4e918] Art. 3(d)(4)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "take into account state of the art, cost, nature, scope, context and purposes of processing, and risks of varying likelihood and severity to rights and freedoms", "target": "DPIA factors: nature, scope, context, purposes, high risks to rights/freedoms; Security provision (for sensitive data) adds state of the art, cost, nature of data, and risks", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "[3daba86dc4c13ff4e918] Art. 3(a), 3(d)(3); [7e2914aa34ab2739dafd] Art. 8(1)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": "No exception stated in the cited provisions", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "both at the time of determining means (design) and at the time of processing (operation)", "target": "Concept of Privacy by Design applies security measures \"في جميع مراحل المعالجة\" (all stages) proactively; operative obligation to implement measures appears during processing", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "[34ea02d93464e8e2fa05] Art. 1 (definition); [7e2914aa34ab2739dafd] Art. 8(1)"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": "No specific consequence stated here", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.63, "reasoning_note": "Bahrain’s texts impose TOMs and risk-based consideration, but state-of-the-art and cost are explicit only for sensitive data, and DPIA factors omit “likelihood and severity.” There is no explicit pseudonymisation element and the design-stage duty is only conceptual via a definition, not a binding “by design and by default” obligation. Hence coverage is partial as the reviewer notes that not all GDPR factors are explicitly present.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-209", "gdpr_article": 25, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 13, "total": 25}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 30}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The target jurisdiction's provisions do not fully consider the specified technological, economic, contextual, and risk factors.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "span": "على مدير البيانات تطبيق التدابير الفنية والتنظيمية الكفيلة بحماية البيانات الشخصية الحساسة من الإتلاف غير المقصود أو غير المصرَّح به، أو من الفقْد العَرَضي، أو مما هو غير مصرَّح به من التغيير أو الإفصاح أو النفاذ أو أيٍّ من الصور الأخرى للمعالَجة.", "why": "The provision does not explicitly mention the consideration of 'economic' factors."}, {"id": "3daba86dc4c13ff4e918", "span": "تقييم أثر حماية البيانات (Data Protection Impact Assessment) أ - يجوز لمدير البيانات إجراء تقييم لأثر حماية البيانات أثناء إجراءات المعالجة، مع مراعاة طبيعة المعالجة ونطاقها وسياقها وأغراضها ومخاطرها العالية على حقوق وحريات الأفراد،", "why": "The provision does not explicitly mention the consideration of 'technological' factors."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions do not explicitly mention all the factors required by the GDPR for implementing technical and organizational measures.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "span": "على مدير البيانات تطبيق التدابير الفنية والتنظيمية الكفيلة بحماية البيانات الشخصية الحساسة", "why": "The article mentions the implementation of technical and organizational measures, but it does not explicitly mention all the factors required by the GDPR."}, {"id": "3daba86dc4c13ff4e918", "span": "تقييم أثر حماية البيانات (Data Protection Impact Assessment)", "why": "The article mentions the evaluation of the risks to the rights and freedoms of individuals, but it does not provide a clear and comprehensive framework for considering all the factors required by the GDPR."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["34ea02d93464e8e2fa05", "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "7e54d45e18f8371cc670", "23f5fda398d01b0f5865", "c9145cc9a91d8ff7530c", "3daba86dc4c13ff4e918", "a8603a05076226e9b8fc", "231a37f671238dbf7112", "8e585010f3f5f3f24dbb", "762372b7329c44286e43", "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "0c872442bf005518c094"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 385.29, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "5e73c22155de9ad3523d", "mutation_id": "5fd42573041e64c886bb", "mtype": "narrow", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["5bedab371a9fc40ba93a"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Concerns objection to automated decision-making, not restriction of processing when accuracy is contested."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Provides rights to rectification/erasure; does not establish a right to restrict processing pending verification."}, {"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Right to obtain information, including about procedures for restriction, but not a substantive right to restrict processing."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment; unrelated to restriction right."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability; unrelated to restriction right."}, {"id": "57844ac856d11c289650", "reason": "Lawful bases/exemptions for processing; does not create a restriction right."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "Processing principles (including accuracy) but no right to restriction pending verification."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification; unrelated to restriction right."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "DPO-related duties; unrelated to restriction right."}, {"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "reason": "Right to stop processing on certain grounds (e.g., direct marketing), not the contested-accuracy/verification scenario."}, {"id": "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "reason": "Processor obligations; unrelated to restriction right."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يحق لصاحب البيانات", "article": "Article 16(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "يحق", "article": "Article 16(1)"}, "action": {"span": "إلزام المتحكم بتقييد وإيقاف معالجة بياناته الشخصية الحساسة", "article": "Article 16(1)"}, "scope": {"span": "معالجة بياناته الشخصية الحساسة", "article": "Article 16(1)"}, "condition": {"span": "اعتراض صاحب البيانات على دقة بياناته الشخصية الحساسة", "article": "Article 16(1)(أ)"}, "exception": {"span": "على الرغم مما ورد في البند (1) من هذه المادة، للمتحكم المضي في معالجة البيانات الشخصية الحساسة لصاحب البيانات دون موافقته في أي من الحالات الآتية: أ. إذا كانت المعالجة مقتصرة على تخزين البيانات الشخصية الحساسة. ب. إذا كانت المعالجة ضرورية لإقامة أي من إجراءات المطالبة بالحقوق والدعاوى القانونية أو الدفاع عنها أو تتعلق بالإجراءات القضائية. ج. إذا كانت المعالجة ضرورية لحماية حقوق الغير وفقاً للتشريعات السارية. د. إذا كانت المعالجة ضرورية لحماية المصلحة العامة.", "article": "Article 16(3)"}, "temporal": {"span": "وفي هذه الحالة يتم تقييد المعالجة لفترة محددة تسمح للمتحكم التحقق من دقتها.", "article": "Article 16(1)(أ)"}, "consequence": {"span": "وفي جميع الأحوال، يجب على المتحكم في حال قام برفع التقييد المنصوص عليه في هذه المادة، أن يخطر صاحب البيانات بذلك.", "article": "Article 16(4)"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "صاحب البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 16(1)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "يحق", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 16(1)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "obtain from the controller the restriction of processing", "target_value": "إلزام المتحكم بتقييد وإيقاف المعالجة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 16(1)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "processing of the data subject's personal data", "target_value": "processing of sensitive personal data only (معالجة بياناته الشخصية الحساسة)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 16(1)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "the accuracy of the personal data is contested by the data subject", "target_value": "اعتراض صاحب البيانات على دقة بياناته الشخصية الحساسة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 16(1)(أ)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "Controller may continue processing despite restriction in specified cases: storage-only; legal claims; rights of others; public interest.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 16(3)", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "for a period enabling the controller to verify the accuracy", "target_value": "لفترة محددة تسمح للمتحكم التحقق من دقتها", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 16(1)(أ)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "Controller must notify the data subject when lifting the restriction.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 16(4)", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "narrower", "confidence": 0.78, "reasoning_note": "Article 16(1)(أ) squarely provides a right to restrict processing when accuracy is contested, and includes the same verification-period formula. However, it is limited to sensitive personal data, narrowing the scope versus GDPR Art. 18. It also introduces express exceptions (Art. 16(3)); while these mirror GDPR Art. 18(2), the RU unit lists no exceptions, so the target text is broader on that slot.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-166", "gdpr_article": 18, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 17}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 18}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The scope and exception slots may not be entirely accurate", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "span": "Article 16(1)(أ)", "why": "The provision supports the proposition, but the scope and exception slots may require revision"}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "span": "Article 16(3)", "why": "The provision provides exceptions to the restriction of processing, which may affect the accuracy of the exception slot"}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential issues with scope of protection and exceptions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "span": "Article 16(1)(أ)", "why": "Narrower scope of protection for sensitive personal data only"}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "span": "Article 16(3)", "why": "Broader exceptions to restriction of processing"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "c34922f387019af45e42", "877fafe0080725188d05", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "57844ac856d11c289650", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 359.05, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "ec043a8111d37474b672", "mutation_id": "01a1933d8fa1e88822b7", "mtype": "narrow", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "9cfd6fbae8182dbc0028"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "14105f25ea49e7794aaa", "reason": "DPIA requirements; not about informing data subjects at collection."}, {"id": "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "reason": "Record-keeping by controller; internal logs, not data-subject notification."}, {"id": "5df1b1c5bce760454262", "reason": "Research/statistical processing conditions; not about identity notice at collection."}, {"id": "952167864cc3b0d724c1", "reason": "Withdrawal of consent; not about initial identity information."}, {"id": "a7597ada8323b333cc94", "reason": "Collection principles (minimization, fairness); no duty to provide controller identity."}, {"id": "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "reason": "Right to erasure; unrelated to informing at time of collection."}, {"id": "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "reason": "Conditions for indirect collection or other purposes; does not impose identity notice at direct collection."}, {"id": "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "reason": "Legitimate interest documentation; not about notice content/timing."}, {"id": "557230873031d6e5cb2c", "reason": "Marketing legal basis; no identity notice requirement."}, {"id": "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31", "reason": "Processor selection/contracting; not about informing data subjects."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "جهة التحكم", "article": "Article 13"}, "modality": {"span": "على جهة التحكم ... اتخاذ الوسائل الكافية لإحاطته علماً", "article": "Article 13"}, "action": {"span": "هوية من يجمع البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 13"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": "في حالة جمع البيانات الشخصية من صاحبها مباشرة", "article": "Article 13"}, "exception": {"span": "لا يطبق ما ورد في الفقرة (1) من هذه المادة في حال كانت المعلومات الموضحة في الفقرات الفرعية (أ) إلى (ز) متوفرة مسبقاً لصاحب البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 4(2)"}, "temporal": {"span": "عند البدء في جمع بياناته", "article": "Article 13"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "جهة التحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 13"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "على جهة التحكم ... اتخاذ الوسائل الكافية لإحاطته علماً", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 13"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "provide the data subject with the identity of the controller", "target_value": "هوية من يجمع البيانات الشخصية; الاسم النظامي لجهة التحكم (للبيانات الحساسة)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 13; Article 4(1)(أ)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "where personal data relating to a data subject are collected from the data subject", "target_value": "في حالة جمع البيانات الشخصية من صاحبها مباشرة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 13"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "where and insofar as the data subject already has the information", "target_value": "لا يطبق ... إذا كانت المعلومات ... متوفرة مسبقاً لصاحب البيانات الشخصية (للبيانات الحساسة فقط); كما توجد استثناءات أخرى مثل: ما لم يكن جمعها لأغراض أمنية", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 4(2); Article 13(3)"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "at the time when personal data are obtained", "target_value": "عند البدء في جمع بياناته; قبل أو عند جمع البيانات (للبيانات الحساسة)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 13; Article 4(1)"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "mostly_covered", "confidence": 0.73, "reasoning_note": "Article 13 requires the controller, when collecting directly, to inform the data subject of “the identity of the one who collects the personal data” at “the start of collecting,” which functionally satisfies timing and identity. Article 4(1)–(2) confirms, for sensitive data, explicit reference to the controller’s legal name and the exception where the data subject already has the information. The GDPR-style exception is thus only partially mirrored (for sensitive data), while Article 13 also adds a security exception.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-054", "gdpr_article": 13, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 11, "total": 23}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 26}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The KSA law only requires the controller to provide the data subject with the identity of the controller when collecting sensitive personal data directly from the data subject or when collecting data from a third party.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9cfd6fbae8182dbc0028", "span": "المادة الرابعة: الحق في العلم تسري أحكام هذه المادة فقط على معالجة البيانات الشخصية الحساسة.", "why": "This provision suggests that the KSA law only applies to sensitive personal data."}, {"id": "9cfd6fbae8182dbc0028", "span": "3- في حال تم جمع البيانات الشخصية من غير صاحبها مباشرة، على جهة التحكم عند تلقيها للبيانات الشخصية القيام -دون تأخر غير مبرر- وخلال مدة لا تتجاوز (30) يوماً اتخاذ الخطوات اللازمة لإبلاغ صاحب البيانات الشخصية بما نصت عليه الفقرة (1) من هذه المادة إضافة إلى فئات البيانات الشخصية التي تتم معالجتها، والمصدر الذي تم من خلاله حصول جهة التحكم على البيانات الشخصية.", "why": "This provision suggests that the KSA law requires the controller to provide the data subject with the identity of the controller when collecting data from a third party."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The KSA provision does not explicitly state that the controller is obliged to provide the identity of the controller 'at the time when personal data are obtained'", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "span": "عند البدء في جمع بياناته", "why": "The provision uses different wording than the GDPR requirement"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["14105f25ea49e7794aaa", "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "5df1b1c5bce760454262", "952167864cc3b0d724c1", "a7597ada8323b333cc94", "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "9cfd6fbae8182dbc0028", "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "557230873031d6e5cb2c", "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 410.77, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "098a92ef2227bd306271", "mutation_id": "ff81db79d527b3f87356", "mtype": "narrow", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["93fde8c87940ae524c86", "5a79146e04b73c99685c"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "c9145cc9a91d8ff7530c", "reason": "Concerns responsibility of data protection officers; not about informing data subjects of processing purposes."}, {"id": "552b4ae6d34230dd6e1f", "reason": "Definitions; does not itself grant or require disclosure of purposes to data subjects."}, {"id": "1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3", "reason": "Breach notification content and channels; unrelated to informing about processing purposes."}, {"id": "c9f5b5ef9189452960fe", "reason": "Registration obligation for DPOs; not about data subject information rights."}, {"id": "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "reason": "Cross-border transfer contract terms; context-specific and not a general right of the data subject to obtain purposes."}, {"id": "98fa9fe9b0650c71a971", "reason": "Right to object to direct marketing; does not address disclosure of processing purposes generally."}, {"id": "063ab5d9ef023666aed7", "reason": "Joint controllers’ transparency about joint processing; does not require disclosure of processing purposes as an access right."}, {"id": "23f5fda398d01b0f5865", "reason": "Obligations of DPO; not about data subject right to obtain purposes."}, {"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "reason": "DPO framework; not about informing data subjects of processing purposes."}, {"id": "231a37f671238dbf7112", "reason": "Definitions in an implementing decision; no operative rule on informing data subjects of purposes."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المعلومات الواجب إحاطة صاحب البيانات بها", "article": "Article 17"}, "modality": {"span": "على مدير البيانات إحاطته عند تسجيل هذه البيانات", "article": "Article 17(1)"}, "action": {"span": "إحاطته ... بما يأتي: ... ب - الأغراض التي من أجلها يُعتَزَم معالجة البيانات.", "article": "Article 17(1)(ب)"}, "scope": {"span": "الأغراض التي من أجلها يُعتَزَم معالجة البيانات", "article": "Article 17(1)(ب)"}, "condition": {"span": "في الحالات التي يتم فيها الحصول على البيانات من صاحبها مباشرة ... عند تسجيل هذه البيانات", "article": "Article 17(1)"}, "exception": {"span": "لا يسري حكم البند (2) من هذه المادة في الحالتين التاليتين: أ - إذا كانت معالجة البيانات لأغراض تاريخية أو إحصائية أو للبحث العلمي ... ب - إذا كانت معالجة البيانات تتم لغرض تنفيذ التزام يرتبه القانون ...", "article": "Article 17(3)"}, "temporal": {"span": "إحاطة صاحب البيانات خلال خمسة أيام من البدء في تسجيل هذه البيانات", "article": "Article 17(2)"}, "consequence": {"span": "يكون لصاحب البيانات تقديم شكوى إلى الهيئة ضد مدير البيانات.", "article": "Article 18(4)"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "صاحب البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17 (عنوان المادة)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "واجب على مدير البيانات إحاطة صاحب البيانات (عام)، وواجب على المدير إخطار صاحب البيانات بناءً على طلبه لبيانات حساسة (خاصة)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Article 17(1); Article 18(1)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "obtain from the controller information on the purposes of the processing", "target_value": "إحاطة/إخطار صاحب البيانات بالأغراض من المعالجة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17(1)(ب); Article 18(1)(ج)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "purposes of the processing", "target_value": "الأغراض التي من أجلها يُعتَزَم معالجة البيانات / الغرض من معالجة البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17(1)(ب); Article 18(1)(ج)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "where the personal data concerning the data subject are being processed", "target_value": "عند تسجيل البيانات إذا جُمِعت من صاحبها، أو خلال 5 أيام إذا جُمِعت من غيره؛ وعلى طلب صاحب البيانات إذا تعلقت المعالجة ببيانات حساسة", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 17(1)-(2); Article 18(1)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "استثناءات على الإحاطة عند الحصول من غير صاحب البيانات (بحث/إحصاء/تاريخي مع تعذر الإحاطة؛ تنفيذ التزام قانوني أو أوامر قضائية/نيابية)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 17(3)"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "الإحاطة خلال خمسة أيام من البدء في تسجيل البيانات (عند الحصول من غير صاحبها)؛ وخلال 15 يوم عمل لطلبات البيانات الحساسة", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 17(2); Article 18(1)"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "حق تقديم شكوى إلى الهيئة عند الرفض أو عدم الرد", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 18(4)"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.67, "reasoning_note": "Article 17(1) indeed requires the controller to inform the data subject of the purposes, which covers the content element the reviewer highlights. However, GDPR Art. 15 confers an on-demand access right; Bahrain’s text provides proactive notice (Art. 17) and a request-driven right only for sensitive data (Art. 18), making the target regime narrower/weaker in modality for general personal data.", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-124", "gdpr_article": 15, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 11, "total": 23}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 24}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The target jurisdiction (BHR) does not provide a full counterpart to the GDPR provision, as the right to access information about the processing of personal data is limited to sensitive personal data and requires a request from the data subject.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 18(1)(ج)", "span": "على مدير البيانات، بناءً على طلب من صاحب البيانات مشفوع بما يثبت هويته، إخطار مقدِّم الطلب دون مقابل خلال ميعاد أقصاه خمسة عشر يوم عمل من تاريخ الطلب، عما إذا كان مدير البيانات يعالِج بيانات شخصية حساسة خاصة بصاحب الطلب", "why": "This provision limits the right to access information about the processing of personal data to sensitive personal data and requires a request from the data subject."}, {"id": "Article 17(1)(ب) and 17(2)(ب)", "span": "في الحالات التي يتم فيها الحصول على البيانات من صاحبها مباشرة، على مدير البيانات إحاطته عند تسجيل هذه البيانات بما يأتي: أ - اسم مدير البيانات كاملاً ومجال نشاطه أو مهنته، بحسب الأحوال، وعنوانه. ب - الأغراض التي من أجلها يُعتَزَم معالجة البيانات.", "why": "These provisions provide additional information that must be disclosed to the data subject when collecting personal data, but do not provide a general right to access information about the processing of personal data."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is not entirely accurate, and the provision of Article 17(1) can be considered as counter-evidence.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 17(1)", "span": "على مدير البيانات إحاطته عند تسجيل هذه البيانات بما يأتي: أ - اسم مدير البيانات كاملاً ومجال نشاطه أو مهنته، بحسب الأحوال، وعنوانه. ب - الأغراض التي من أجلها يُعتَزَم معالجة البيانات.", "why": "This provision requires the controller to inform the data subject about the purposes of processing their personal data, without limiting it to sensitive personal data."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["c9145cc9a91d8ff7530c", "552b4ae6d34230dd6e1f", "1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3", "c9f5b5ef9189452960fe", "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "93fde8c87940ae524c86", "98fa9fe9b0650c71a971", "063ab5d9ef023666aed7", "23f5fda398d01b0f5865", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "231a37f671238dbf7112"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 393.23, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "872439d4d0104756dd2a", "mutation_id": "6ac4ec9de6585ab6c4a2", "mtype": "narrow", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["17d4b446ea6ed7965d08"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "4919410df7147924356b", "reason": "Addresses format and provision of a copy of personal data; no rule on response-time extensions."}, {"id": "085e0379de48628139e3", "reason": "Concerns rectification and related verification; no rule on extending response periods."}, {"id": "6f4fee23b0aedf942410", "reason": "Sets limits on access rights; no response-time extension rule."}, {"id": "33d22a1a65039b5be3f9", "reason": "Definitions; no operative rule on deadlines or extensions."}, {"id": "1fc3063dbbcf8d500da0", "reason": "Security measures; unrelated to deadlines for rights requests."}, {"id": "59abf8ad06d6b694538c", "reason": "Enumerates data-subject rights; does not set response-time extensions."}, {"id": "90da7bc2380e8f3f2fb8", "reason": "Requires responding within a period to be set by regulations; does not itself authorize or define extensions."}, {"id": "9cfd6fbae8182dbc0028", "reason": "Right to be informed (including 30-day notice when collected indirectly); not about extending response to rights requests."}, {"id": "cf114b62f7d3612bb117", "reason": "Complaint handling; not about response-time extensions."}, {"id": "1c2ee470fae7b5023951", "reason": "Procedural issuance of regulations; no substantive rule on extensions."}, {"id": "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "reason": "Record-keeping obligations; no rule on extending response periods."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"text": "على جهة التحكم في القطاع المالي", "article": "Article 3(1)"}, "modality": {"text": "ولها تمديد ذلك", "article": "Article 3(1)(أ)"}, "action": {"text": "تمديد ذلك", "article": "Article 3(1)(أ)"}, "scope": {"text": "عند تلقيها طلباً من صاحب البيانات الشخصية يتعلق بحقوقه المنصوص عليها في النظام", "article": "Article 3(1)"}, "condition": {"text": "في حال تطلب التنفيذ جهداً إضافياً غير متوقع أو غير معتاد أو في حال تلقيها طلبات متعددة من صاحب البيانات الشخصية ... بشرط أن تشعر صاحب البيانات الشخصية مسبقا بالتمديد ومبرراته", "article": "Article 3(1)(أ)"}, "exception": {"text": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"text": "بما لا يزيد على (ثلاثين) يوماً إضافية", "article": "Article 3(1)(أ)"}, "consequence": {"text": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "جهة التحكم في القطاع المالي (controllers in the financial sector only)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 3(1)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "permission", "target_value": "permission (ولها تمديد ذلك)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 3(1)(أ)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "extend the one-month response period", "target_value": "extend the 30-day execution period (تمديد ذلك)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 3(1)(أ)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "responding to requests under Articles 15–22 (data subject rights)", "target_value": "upon receiving a request related to rights stipulated in the Law", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 3(1)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "where necessary, considering complexity and number of requests", "target_value": "if execution requires unexpected or unusual extra effort, or if multiple requests are received from the data subject; with prior notice and reasons", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 3(1)(أ)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "up to two further months", "target_value": "up to 30 additional days", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 3(1)(أ): \"بما لا يزيد على (ثلاثين) يوماً إضافية\""}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.72, "reasoning_note": "KSA Article 3(1)(أ) permits extending the 30-day period for rights requests but only by up to 30 additional days (not two months) and only for financial-sector controllers. It also conditions any extension on prior notice with reasons and on specific triggers (extra/unusual effort or multiple requests), which is stricter than the GDPR’s broader ‘complexity and number’ criterion.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-035", "gdpr_article": 11, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 19}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 23}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The KSA provision does not explicitly allow for an extension of up to two further months, and the analyst's own slot verdict acknowledges that the KSA provision is narrower.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "17d4b446ea6ed7965d08", "span": "ولها تمديد ذلك في حال تطلب التنفيذ جهداً إضافياً غير متوقع أو غير معتاد أو في حال تلقيها طلبات متعددة من صاحب البيانات الشخصية، وذلك بما لا يزيد على (ثلاثين) يوماً إضافية", "why": "This provision does not explicitly allow for an extension of up to two further months."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The KSA jurisdiction's provision for extending the response period is not entirely equivalent to the GDPR requirement unit [RU-035].", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "17d4b446ea6ed7965d08", "span": "Article 3(1)(أ): \"بما لا يزيد على (ثلاثين) يوماً إضافية\"", "why": "The extension period is limited to 30 additional days, which is not equivalent to the two-month extension allowed under the GDPR."}, {"id": "17d4b446ea6ed7965d08", "span": "Article 3(1)(أ): \"بشرط أن تشعر... بالتمديد ومبرراته\"", "why": "The KSA jurisdiction requires prior notice and reasons to be given to the data subject, which is not explicitly mentioned in the GDPR provision."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["4919410df7147924356b", "17d4b446ea6ed7965d08", "085e0379de48628139e3", "6f4fee23b0aedf942410", "33d22a1a65039b5be3f9", "1fc3063dbbcf8d500da0", "59abf8ad06d6b694538c", "90da7bc2380e8f3f2fb8", "9cfd6fbae8182dbc0028", "cf114b62f7d3612bb117", "1c2ee470fae7b5023951", "c95a0b593cc554df0eae"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 334.13, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "1a1a2bf24e9e90eb99e9", "mutation_id": "f51e278533db341d2adf", "mtype": "narrow", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "db6e2be94f2388e169a8", "reason": "Addresses refusal of requests when repetitive or requiring extraordinary effort, not the specific substantive grounds analogous to GDPR Art. 17(3)(a)-(e)."}, {"id": "823830174d241884bd73", "reason": "Complaint mechanism; does not govern erasure or exceptions."}, {"id": "40626451a5025d77cff5", "reason": "Pre-processing notice obligations; not about erasure exceptions."}, {"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "reason": "Security/processing controls; no erasure exception rules."}, {"id": "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "reason": "Disclosure prohibitions; unrelated to erasure exceptions."}, {"id": "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "reason": "Policy publication duty; not substantive erasure exceptions."}, {"id": "5483caf68765f09059fb", "reason": "Records retention for processing documents; not right-to-erasure exceptions."}, {"id": "2712fe4ebdba355a134b", "reason": "Consent requirements; not erasure exceptions."}, {"id": "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "reason": "Permit application content; not erasure exceptions."}, {"id": "de8d26aee9201d58a52b", "reason": "Permit cancellation grounds; not erasure exceptions."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المتحكم", "article": "Article 18; Article 11"}, "modality": {"span": "يجوز للمتحكم - بحسب الأحوال -", "article": "Article 18"}, "action": {"span": "رفض طلب صاحب البيانات الشخصية [بمحو بياناته الشخصية]", "article": "Article 18"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": "1- تنفيذ التزام قانوني ملقى على عاتق المتحكم بموجب أي قانون أو حكم أو قرار قضائي. 2- وجود نزاع قائم بين المتحكم وصاحب البيانات الشخصية. … وما لم تكن تلك المعالجة ضرورية لأغراض الحفظ والتوثيق الوطنية.", "article": "Article 18; Article 11(هـ)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 18; Art. 11(b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "permission", "target_value": "يجوز للمتحكم - بحسب الأحوال -", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 18 (93f989531fe30cac1ed5)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "refrain from erasing personal data under paragraph 1", "target_value": "رفض طلب صاحب البيانات الشخصية [بمحو بياناته الشخصية]", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 18 (93f989531fe30cac1ed5)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "processing is necessary for (a) freedom of expression/information; (b) legal obligation or public interest task/official authority; (c) public health (Art. 9(2)(h),(i), 9(3)); (d) archiving in public interest/scientific/historical/statistical with Art. 89(1); (e) legal claims", "target_value": "1- تنفيذ التزام قانوني … أو حكم أو قرار قضائي. 2- وجود نزاع قائم بين المتحكم وصاحب البيانات الشخصية. … ما لم تكن تلك المعالجة ضرورية لأغراض الحفظ والتوثيق الوطنية.", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 18 (93f989531fe30cac1ed5); Art. 11(هـ) (b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "narrower", "confidence": 0.66, "reasoning_note": "OMN permits refusal of erasure for compliance with a legal obligation/court order, for an ongoing dispute, and where processing is necessary for national archiving/documentation. It does not provide grounds paralleling freedom of expression, public health, public interest tasks/official authority, or research/statistics beyond national archiving, so coverage of GDPR Art. 17(3)(a)-(e) is narrower/partial.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-029", "gdpr_article": 8, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 11, "total": 23}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 27}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The OMN jurisdiction only partially covers the grounds listed in points (a) to (e) of paragraph 3 of the GDPR requirement unit [RU-029].", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "span": "1- تنفيذ التزام قانوني…؛ 2- وجود نزاع قائم…", "why": "The grounds listed in Article 18 of the OMN jurisdiction only partially correspond to the grounds listed in points (a) to (e) of paragraph 3 of the GDPR requirement unit [RU-029]."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["db6e2be94f2388e169a8", "823830174d241884bd73", "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "40626451a5025d77cff5", "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "de8d26aee9201d58a52b", "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "5483caf68765f09059fb", "2712fe4ebdba355a134b", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 308.49, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "8c9eff88a8e9ee5fb604", "mutation_id": "a8592702ae788ae1def7", "mtype": "narrow", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["5df1b1c5bce760454262", "a409908037f5e17f0eba"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "557230873031d6e5cb2c", "reason": "Marketing lawful basis; no safeguards or pseudonymisation for research/statistics."}, {"id": "fb0cfd03e454392db4cc", "reason": "Legitimate interest conditions; not about research/statistics safeguards or pseudonymisation."}, {"id": "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "reason": "Record-keeping duties; no technical/organisational safeguards relevant here."}, {"id": "a7597ada8323b333cc94", "reason": "General collection/minimisation principles; does not specify pseudonymisation for research/statistics."}, {"id": "14105f25ea49e7794aaa", "reason": "DPIA requirements; no express rule on pseudonymisation for research/statistics."}, {"id": "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "reason": "Disclosure conditions; not about safeguards or pseudonymisation."}, {"id": "c44e3478969c6bbb366c", "reason": "Further processing framework; does not establish pseudonymisation as a safeguard for research/statistics."}, {"id": "62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "reason": "Information security controls; does not address pseudonymisation or research/statistics context."}, {"id": "1fc3063dbbcf8d500da0", "reason": "General organisational/technical measures to preserve data; not specific to research/statistics pseudonymisation."}, {"id": "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "reason": "DPO designation and tasks; no relevant safeguard content."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على جميع الأشخاص والجهات عند جمع أو معالجة البيانات الشخصية لأغراض علمية أو بحثية أو إحصائية دون موافقة صاحبها الالتزام بالآتي", "article": "5df1b1c5bce760454262"}, "modality": {"span": "الالتزام بالآتي", "article": "5df1b1c5bce760454262"}, "action": {"span": "ترميز البيانات الشخصية التي تجري معالجتها", "article": "5df1b1c5bce760454262"}, "scope": {"span": "اتخاذ التدابير اللازمة لضمان جمع البيانات الشخصية وفق الحد الأدنى اللازم لتحقيق الأغراض المحددة", "article": "5df1b1c5bce760454262"}, "condition": {"span": "في الأحوال التي ل