: "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.66, "reasoning_note": "Article 30 imposes an obligation (not a permission) to pseudonymise by ‘ترميز البيانات الشخصية’ when it does not affect achieving the purpose, directly addressing the reviewer’s modality concern. The condition is textually supported by the quoted phrase ‘في الأحوال التي لا يؤثر ذلك على تحقيق الغرض من المعالجة’. Coverage is partial because the safeguard is framed as an obligation in research/statistics (and not expressly for archiving) and pseudonymisation is not explicitly tied as a measure to ensure minimisation, though minimisation is mandated alongside.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-966", "gdpr_article": 89, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": "broader", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 17, "total": 29}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 33}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provision in Article 30(3) does not explicitly permit pseudonymisation as a technical and organisational measure, and the condition in the proposition is not explicitly mentioned in the cited provision.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "5df1b1c5bce760454262", "span": "ترميز البيانات الشخصية التي تجري معالجتها، في الأحوال التي لا يؤثر ذلك على تحقيق الغرض من المعالجة", "why": "This provision mentions encoding, but does not explicitly permit pseudonymisation as a measure, and the condition is not explicitly mentioned."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Deontic modality claim not supported by modal wording, and condition slot verdict not fully supported by citation", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "5df1b1c5bce760454262", "span": "الالتزام بالآتي", "why": "The provision uses the term 'obligation' instead of 'permission', which changes the deontic modality"}, {"id": "5df1b1c5bce760454262", "span": "في الأحوال التي لا يؤثر ذلك على تحقيق الغرض من المعالجة", "why": "The provision does not explicitly mention the condition that the archiving in the public interest, scientific or historical research, or statistical purposes can be fulfilled in that manner"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["557230873031d6e5cb2c", "fb0cfd03e454392db4cc", "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "5df1b1c5bce760454262", "a7597ada8323b333cc94", "14105f25ea49e7794aaa", "a409908037f5e17f0eba", "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "c44e3478969c6bbb366c", "62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "1fc3063dbbcf8d500da0", "8394f801a0a97e521f68"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 406.2, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "f4da5d6ef66118e845c5", "mutation_id": "2eae705b45c5ddd26061", "mtype": "broaden", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["f1d11d7b0c4a6479bbe4", "f6764b5004b8f04e4aa5"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "de8d26aee9201d58a52b", "reason": "License revocation grounds; not about administrative fine caps."}, {"id": "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "reason": "Substantive prohibition on disclosure; no fine limitation."}, {"id": "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "reason": "Breach-handling measures; no administrative fine cap."}, {"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "reason": "Controller obligations; no sanction ceiling."}, {"id": "6e8de83975a220288296", "reason": "Promulgation clause; not an operative sanction rule."}, {"id": "3f916831456908af27d8", "reason": "Supervisory remedial measures (warnings, orders); not fine caps."}, {"id": "caad155111190c1aa274", "reason": "Definitions; no fine limitation."}, {"id": "f09642dcc53965e1f6de", "reason": "Criminal fine for legal persons; not an administrative fine by the supervisory authority."}, {"id": "c7ddf58d01bb4d45c9d5", "reason": "Notification duty; no sanction ceiling."}, {"id": "dcd007160208896c8632", "reason": "Breach notification duty; no sanction ceiling."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجوز للوزارة فرض جزاءات إدارية", "article": "f1d11d7b0c4a6479bbe4"}, "modality": {"span": "على ألا تزيد الغرامة الإدارية على (2000) ألفي ريال عماني", "article": "f1d11d7b0c4a6479bbe4"}, "action": {"span": "غرامة إدارية لا تزيد على (2000) ألفي ريال عماني", "article": "f6764b5004b8f04e4aa5"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": "على المخالفات التي يتم ارتكابها بالمخالفة لأحكام هذا القانون أو اللائحة أو القرارات الصادرة تنفيذاً له", "article": "f1d11d7b0c4a6479bbe4"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "supervisory authority", "target": "الوزارة (يجوز للوزارة فرض جزاءات إدارية)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ["f1d11d7b0c4a6479bbe4"]}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "prohibition (shall not impose)", "target": "على ألا تزيد الغرامة الإدارية على (2000) ألفي ريال عماني", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ["f1d11d7b0c4a6479bbe4"]}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "impose an administrative fine exceeding the higher of 20 000 000 EUR or, for an undertaking, 4% of the total worldwide annual turnover", "target": "غرامة إدارية لا تزيد على (2000) ألفي ريال عماني (سقف ثابت دون نسبة من رقم الأعمال)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": ["f1d11d7b0c4a6479bbe4", "f6764b5004b8f04e4aa5"]}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "in accordance with paragraph 2", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": []}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "for infringements of the data subjects' rights pursuant to Articles 12 to 22", "target": "على المخالفات لأحكام هذا القانون أو اللائحة أو القرارات الصادرة تنفيذاً له (عام يشمل كافة المخالفات)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": ["f1d11d7b0c4a6479bbe4"]}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": []}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": []}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": []}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.74, "reasoning_note": "OMN law does provide an explicit administrative fine ceiling: the Ministry/Minister may not exceed OMR 2,000 (Arts. 32, 44), so there is a counterpart limiting administrative fines. However, it does not mirror the GDPR’s dual threshold (EUR 20M or 4% turnover) and is not specifically tied to infringements of data-subject rights, but rather to any violation of the law/regulation. Hence the match is partial rather than absent.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-514", "gdpr_article": 42, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 11, "total": 23}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 30}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is based on incomplete or inaccurate analysis of the target jurisdiction's provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "f1d11d7b0c4a6479bbe4", "span": "مع عدم الإخلال بالعقوبات المنصوص عليها في هذا القانون، يجوز للوزارة فرض جزاءات إدارية على المخالفات التي يتم ارتكابها بالمخالفة لأحكام هذا القانون أو اللائحة أو القرارات الصادرة تنفيذاً له", "why": "The provision refers to 'الوزارة (the Ministry)' imposing administrative sanctions, which may not be the exact equivalent of a supervisory authority."}, {"id": "f1d11d7b0c4a6479bbe4", "span": "على ألا تزيد الغرامة الإدارية على (2000) ألفي ريال عماني", "why": "The provision mentions a fixed cap of 2000 OMR for administrative fines, which does not seem to be equivalent to the GDPR's requirement of not exceeding 20,000,000 EUR or 4% of the total worldwide annual turnover."}, {"id": "f6764b5004b8f04e4aa5", "span": "غرامة إدارية لا تزيد على (2000) ألفي ريال عماني لكل مخالفة", "why": "The provision mentions a fixed cap of 2000 OMR for administrative fines, which does not seem to be equivalent to the GDPR's requirement of not exceeding 20,000,000 EUR or 4% of the total worldwide annual turnover."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's conclusion about the absence of a counterpart for limiting administrative fines might be too broad, as the OMN jurisdiction does establish caps on such fines, albeit differently from the GDPR.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "f1d11d7b0c4a6479bbe4", "span": "على ألا تزيد الغرامة الإدارية على (2000) ألفي ريال عماني", "why": "This provision shows that the OMN jurisdiction does have a cap on administrative fines, suggesting some form of counterpart to the GDPR's fine limitation, even if the specifics differ."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["f1d11d7b0c4a6479bbe4", "f6764b5004b8f04e4aa5", "de8d26aee9201d58a52b", "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "6e8de83975a220288296", "3f916831456908af27d8", "caad155111190c1aa274", "f09642dcc53965e1f6de", "c7ddf58d01bb4d45c9d5", "dcd007160208896c8632"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 461.16, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "70fd8eb50c1596758374", "mutation_id": "23e05ef8a884798a460c", "mtype": "broaden", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["6ee1b976a5203de50c77"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "557230873031d6e5cb2c", "reason": "Marketing-purpose processing conditions; not about data-subject access rights."}, {"id": "4919410df7147924356b", "reason": "Right to obtain a copy of personal data; ancillary to access but not required to establish the basic access right in RU-123."}, {"id": "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "reason": "Legal bases for collection/processing; not about access rights."}, {"id": "085e0379de48628139e3", "reason": "Right to rectification/restriction; different right."}, {"id": "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "reason": "Controller interest documentation; not about access rights."}, {"id": "ce107f77eb9119ba01b0", "reason": "Privacy policy content; not the operative access right."}, {"id": "772962994f8e191e84a3", "reason": "Research/statistics processing; not about access rights."}, {"id": "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "reason": "Transparency at collection; not the access right."}, {"id": "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "reason": "Disclosure conditions to third parties; not about a data-subject access right."}, {"id": "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "reason": "Public-interest processing by public bodies; not about access rights."}, {"id": "5b4b690e4d5442b49eac", "reason": "Household exemption; not about access rights."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "لصاحب البيانات الشخصية أو ممثله النظامي أو من يفوضه تفويضاً موثقاً", "article": "Article 5(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "الحق في الوصول إلى البيانات الشخصية ... يكون لصاحب البيانات الشخصية ... حق الوصول", "article": "Article 5(1)"}, "action": {"span": "حق الوصول إلى بياناته الشخصية", "article": "Article 5(1)"}, "scope": {"span": "بياناته الشخصية", "article": "Article 5(1)"}, "condition": {"span": "المتوافرة لدى جهة التحكم", "article": "Article 5(1)"}, "exception": {"span": "دون الإخلال بأحكام المادة (التاسعة) والمادة (السادسة عشرة) ... ألا تؤثر ممارسة الحق في الوصول إلى البيانات الشخصية سلباً على حقوق الغير ... التأكد من أن ذلك لا يتضمن الإفصاح عن بيانات شخصية تحدد هوية فرد آخر", "article": "Article 5(1)-(2)"}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "data subject or his legal representative or a duly authorized delegate", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 5(1): \"لصاحب البيانات الشخصية أو ممثله النظامي أو من يفوضه تفويضاً موثقاً\"", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "right (حق)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 5(1): \"الحق في الوصول ... يكون ... حق الوصول\"", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "obtain access to personal data concerning the data subject", "target_value": "right to access his personal data", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 5(1): \"حق الوصول إلى بياناته الشخصية\"", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "personal data concerning the data subject", "target_value": "his personal data (بياناته الشخصية)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 5(1): \"بياناته الشخصية\"", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "where the personal data concerning the data subject are being processed", "target_value": "his personal data available with the controller (المتوافرة لدى جهة التحكم)", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 5(1): \"... حق الوصول إلى بياناته الشخصية المتوافرة لدى جهة التحكم\"", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "subject to not prejudicing other provisions; must not adversely affect others' rights; must avoid disclosing another individual's personal data", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 5(1)-(2): limitations and safeguards listed", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "mostly_covered", "confidence": 0.73, "reasoning_note": "Article 5(1) expressly grants the data subject a right to access their personal data. While it does not repeat the GDPR phrase “where processed,” the phrase “available with the controller” functionally captures the same condition: access applies to data the controller holds/handles. The article adds limitations (e.g., protecting others’ rights), which narrow the right relative to RU-123 but do not negate its core availability.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-123", "gdpr_article": 15, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": "broader", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 9, "total": 21}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 21}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The KSA regulation does not explicitly mention the condition 'where such personal data are being processed' in Article 5(1), and the scope of the right to access personal data is subject to certain conditions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "6ee1b976a5203de50c77", "span": "المادة الخامسة: الحق في الوصول إلى البيانات الشخصية 1- دون الإخلال بأحكام المادة (التاسعة) والمادة (السادسة عشرة) من النظام، يكون لصاحب البيانات الشخصية أو ممثله النظامي أو من يفوضه تفويضاً موثقاً حق الوصول إلى بياناته الشخصية المتوافرة لدى جهة التحكم", "why": "The article mentions the right to access personal data, but does not explicitly mention the condition 'where such personal data are being processed'."}, {"id": "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "span": "المادة العاشرة: لا يجوز لجهة التحكم جمع البيانات الشخصية إلا من صاحبها مباشرة، ولا تجوز كذلك معالجة تلك البيانات إلا لتحقيق الغرض الذي جمعت من أجله.", "why": "The article mentions that personal data can only be collected and processed for a specific purpose, which is related to the condition 'where such personal data are being processed'."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The cited provision does not fully support the claim that the data subject has the right to obtain access to personal data concerning them where such personal data are being processed.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "6ee1b976a5203de50c77", "span": "الحق في الوصول إلى البيانات الشخصية 1- دون الإخلال بأحكام المادة (التاسعة) والمادة (السادسة عشرة) من النظام، يكون لصاحب البيانات الشخصية أو ممثله النظامي أو من يفوضه تفويضاً موثقاً حق الوصول إلى بياناته الشخصية المتوافرة لدى جهة التحكم مع مراعاة ما يلي:", "why": "The provision does not explicitly state that the data subject has the right to obtain access to personal data concerning them where such personal data are being processed."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["557230873031d6e5cb2c", "6ee1b976a5203de50c77", "4919410df7147924356b", "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "085e0379de48628139e3", "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "ce107f77eb9119ba01b0", "772962994f8e191e84a3", "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "5b4b690e4d5442b49eac"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 409.34, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "06403c521edbe4fdf647", "mutation_id": "724cd20aca3547c328e9", "mtype": "broaden", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "e8fe267db21063b1b45f", "reason": "General scope of the regulation; does not set record-of-processing content requirements."}, {"id": "62dc9e8ad2aa962982ad", "reason": "Pre-service collection/consent information duties; not about records of processing or their contents."}, {"id": "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "reason": "Transparency and processing conditions toward data subjects; not the controller’s record-of-processing content."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على جميع مقدمي الخدمات وأي شخص طبيعي أو اعتباري يقوم بمعالجة البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 5 (chapeau)"}, "modality": {"span": "على ... اتخاذ الآتي", "article": "Article 5 (chapeau)"}, "action": {"span": "على أن تتضمن السجلات كافة المعلومات التالية: 4.1. اسم وبيانات الاتصال بمقدم الخدمة، وممثله إذا كان خارج دولة الكويت ومسؤول حماية البيانات.", "article": "Article 5(4.1)"}, "scope": {"span": "الاحتفاظ بسجلات أنشطة المعالجة", "article": "Article 5(4)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "جميع مقدمي الخدمات وأي شخص طبيعي أو اعتباري يقوم بمعالجة البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 5 (chapeau)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "على ... اتخاذ الآتي", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 5 (chapeau)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "include the name and contact details of the controller in the record", "target_value": "على أن تتضمن السجلات ... اسم وبيانات الاتصال بمقدم الخدمة ...", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 5(4.1)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "the record of processing activities maintained under Article 30(1)", "target_value": "الاحتفاظ بسجلات أنشطة المعالجة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 5(4)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.86, "reasoning_note": "Article 5(4.1) expressly requires the record to include the name and contact details of the service provider, which functionally corresponds to including the controller’s details in a ROPA. This is not narrower than GDPR Art. 30(1)(a); if anything, it also adds representative (if outside Kuwait) and DPO. The addressee formulation is broader, but the specific content requirement fully covers the GDPR unit.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-255", "gdpr_article": 30, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": "broader", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 1, "total": 1}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 3}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 4}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential discrepancy in the definition of 'controller' and 'service provider'", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "span": "اسم وبيانات الاتصال بمقدم الخدمة", "why": "The KWT law requires the record to include the name and contact details of the service provider, but it is unclear if this refers to the controller or the service provider."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Lack of clear support for the claim that the KWT law has a narrower counterpart to the GDPR requirement", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "span": "Article 5(4.1)", "why": "The provision only mentions the requirement to include the name and contact details of the service provider, without explicitly stating that this is a narrower or broader requirement than the GDPR"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 4, "candidate_ids": ["2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "e8fe267db21063b1b45f", "62dc9e8ad2aa962982ad", "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 324.01, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "8b6ed2c831c05cae195c", "mutation_id": "be63f2e3c16a7243f1d9", "mtype": "broaden", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["877fafe0080725188d05", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "dec351a1e477287e3b22"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Right of access to information; does not grant or regulate rectification."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability; unrelated to rectification."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated decision-making rights; not about rectification."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification; unrelated to rectification right."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Complaints mechanism; not the rectification right itself."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Restriction of processing when accuracy is contested; ancillary to accuracy but not the rectification entitlement."}, {"id": "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "reason": "Processor obligations; no data-subject rectification right."}, {"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "reason": "Right to stop processing; not rectification."}, {"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "Scope of the law; not a substantive rectification right."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "صاحب البيانات", "article": "Article 15(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "يحق", "article": "Article 15(1)"}, "action": {"span": "طلب تصحيح بياناته الشخصية غير الدقيقة، أو استكمالها لدى المتحكم أو المعالج", "article": "Article 15(1)"}, "scope": {"span": "بياناته الشخصية غير الدقيقة", "article": "Article 15(1)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "دون تأخير غير مبرر", "article": "Article 15(1)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "صاحب البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art 15(1)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "يحق (a right is granted)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art 15(1)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "obtain from the controller the rectification of inaccurate personal data concerning him or her", "target_value": "يحق له طلب تصحيح بياناته الشخصية غير الدقيقة لدى المتحكم أو المعالج؛ كما يلتزم المتحكم بتوفر تدابير لضمان تصحيح البيانات غير الصحيحة", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Art 15(1); Art 5(5)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "inaccurate personal data concerning the data subject", "target_value": "بياناته الشخصية غير الدقيقة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art 15(1)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No conditions stated for exercising correction", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art 15(1)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No exceptions stated for correction (exceptions in Art 15(2)-(3) relate to erasure, not correction)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art 15(1)-(3)"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "without undue delay", "target_value": "دون تأخير غير مبرر", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art 15(1)"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No specific consequence stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.72, "reasoning_note": "Article 15(1) grants a right to request correction “without undue delay,” but does not expressly state a right to obtain rectification from the controller. However, Article 5(5) imposes a controller duty to ensure erasure or correction of inaccurate data, which functionally supports fulfilling such requests. Given the explicit wording remains “request,” the action is assessed as weaker modality relative to GDPR Art. 16.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-140", "gdpr_article": 16, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 14}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE provision (Article 15) does not explicitly mention the data subject's right to 'obtain from the controller' the rectification, which might imply a different process or mechanism.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "span": "يحق لصاحب البيانات طلب تصحيح بياناته الشخصية غير الدقيقة، أو استكمالها لدى المتحكم أو المعالج دون تأخير غير مبرر", "why": "The provision focuses on the data subject's right to 'request' the correction, rather than 'obtaining' it from the controller."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "877fafe0080725188d05", "c34922f387019af45e42", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9"], "n_llm_calls": 5, "latency_s": 212.56, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "4537974eec54041d5a99", "mutation_id": "c847904ec95157251012", "mtype": "broaden", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "9d65c2815c41a25064db"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "fdfffc71ce002ff82134", "reason": "Concerns controller DPIAs; does not set processor security-measure obligations."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "Addresses DPO appointment triggers; not the implementation of security measures."}, {"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "reason": "Controller-specific obligations; RU addressee is the processor."}, {"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "reason": "Defines DPO roles; not substantive processor security obligations."}, {"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "reason": "Concerns communication channels with the controller; unrelated to security measures."}, {"id": "57844ac856d11c289650", "reason": "Lawful bases/exemptions for processing; not about security measures."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "Obligations toward DPO; not about implementing security measures."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "General processing principles; not a processor-targeted security obligation."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification duties; not the ex ante implementation of measures."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Data subject right to restriction; not a processor security obligation."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجب على المعالج وأي طرف آخر يقوم بمعالجة البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 8 (chapeau)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب على", "article": "Article 20(1)"}, "action": {"span": "وضع واتخاذ إجراءات وتدابير تقنية وتنظيمية ملائمة، لضمان تطبيق مستوى أمن المعلومات الذي يتناسب مع المخاطر المصاحبة للمعالجة", "article": "Article 20(1)"}, "scope": {"span": "معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 8 (title/chapeau)"}, "condition": {"span": "يراعى عند تقييم مستوى أمن المعلومات المنصوص عليها في البند (1) من هذه المادة، ما يأتي: أ. المخاطر المصاحبة للمعالجة، بما فيها تلف البيانات الشخصية أو ضياعها أو التعديل العرضي عليها أو غير القانوني لها أو الإفشاء أو الوصول غير المصرح به لها سواء تم نقلها أو تخزينها أو معالجتها. ب. تكاليف تنفيذ المعالجة وطبيعتها ونطاقها وأغراضها، وكذلك تباين المخاطر المحتملة على خصوصية وسرية البيانات الشخصية لصاحب البيانات.", "article": "Article 20(2)(أ)-(ب)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "processor", "target_value": "المعالج (addressed explicitly)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 8 (chapeau)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يجب على (must/shall)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 20(1)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to ensure a level of security appropriate to the risk", "target_value": "وضع واتخاذ إجراءات وتدابير تقنية وتنظيمية ملائمة لضمان مستوى أمن المعلومات المتناسب مع المخاطر", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 20(1)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "processing of personal data", "target_value": "معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 8 (title/chapeau)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "taking into account the state of the art, implementation costs, and the nature, scope, context and purposes of processing, as well as risks of varying likelihood and severity to the rights and freedoms of natural persons", "target_value": "يراعى المخاطر المصاحبة للمعالجة وتباينها، وتكاليف التنفيذ، وطبيعة المعالجة ونطاقها وأغراضها (Article 20(2)(أ)-(ب))، ووفق أفضل المعايير والممارسات الدولية (state of the art) (Article 20(1)); يُراعى كذلك في التصميم تكلفة التدابير وطبيعة المعالجة ونطاقها وأغراضها (Article 8(2)).", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 20(2)(أ)-(ب); Article 20(1); Article 8(2)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No exception expressed for this obligation", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No temporal qualifier expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No consequence specified in the provision", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.86, "reasoning_note": "Article 20(1) imposes on processors an obligation to implement appropriate technical and organisational measures ensuring a security level appropriate to risk, and Article 20(2)(a)-(b) specifies risk-, cost-, nature-, scope-, and purpose-based factors; Article 20(1) also reflects state of the art via “وفق أفضل المعايير والممارسات الدولية.” Article 8(2) reinforces consideration of costs, nature, scope, and purposes at design. Accordingly, the GDPR condition is fully covered.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-316", "gdpr_article": 32, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 11, "total": 11}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 15}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 15}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE provisions do not fully align with the GDPR requirement, particularly with regards to the consideration of costs and additional factors when evaluating the level of security.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 20(2)", "span": "يراعى عند تقييم مستوى أمن المعلومات المنصوص عليها في البند (1) من هذه المادة، ما يأتي: أ. المخاطر المصاحبة للمعالجة، بما فيها تلف البيانات الشخصية أو ضياعها أو التعديل العرضي عليها أو غير القانوني لها أو الإفشاء أو الوصول غير المصرح به لها سواء تم نقلها أو تخزينها أو معالجتها. ب. تكاليف تنفيذ المعالجة وطبيعتها ونطاقها وأغراضها، وكذلك تباين المخاطر المحتملة على خصوصية وسرية البيانات الشخصية لصاحب البيانات.", "why": "This provision introduces additional factors to be considered when evaluating the level of security, which might not be fully aligned with the GDPR requirement."}, {"id": "Article 8(2)", "span": "تطبيق الإجراءات والتدابير التقنية والتنظيمية الملائمة لحماية البيانات الشخصية في مرحلة التصميم، سواء أثناء تحديد وسائل المعالجة أو أثناء المعالجة نفسها، على أن يراعى فيها تكلفة تطبيق هذه الإجراءات والتدابير وطبيعة المعالجة ونطاقها وأغراضها.", "why": "This provision emphasizes the importance of considering the cost of implementing security measures, which might not be fully aligned with the GDPR requirement."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict on the condition slot is too conservative, and the condition is actually fully covered.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "span": "Article 20(1)", "why": "The provision covers the specified factors, such as the state of the art, implementation costs, and the nature, scope, context, and purposes of processing, as well as risks of varying likelihood and severity to the rights and freedoms of natural persons."}, {"id": "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "span": "Article 8(2)", "why": "The provision covers the specified factors, such as the cost of applying these measures and the nature, scope, and purposes of the processing."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "fdfffc71ce002ff82134", "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "57844ac856d11c289650", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 341.89, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "bf5ce27698a8ba521f75", "mutation_id": "6984507b39d3eabbaa05", "mtype": "broaden", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["877fafe0080725188d05", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated decision-making objections; does not address rectification/completion of personal data."}, {"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Right to obtain information; mentions procedures for correction but does not establish the rectification/completion right itself."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Right to restriction of processing; distinct from the right to complete incomplete data."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability; unrelated to completing incomplete data."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification; unrelated to rectification/completion rights."}, {"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "reason": "Security measures; does not confer a right to complete data."}, {"id": "80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "reason": "Consent conditions; not about completing incomplete data."}, {"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "reason": "Objection/stop processing; not about completing incomplete data."}, {"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "reason": "Controller obligations and records; does not grant the data subject a right to completion."}, {"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "Scope of law; not about the right to complete data."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يحق لصاحب البيانات أو من ينوب عنه قانوناً", "article": "Article 15(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "يحق", "article": "Article 15(1)"}, "action": {"span": "طلب تصحيح بياناته الشخصية غير الدقيقة، أو استكمالها لدى المتحكم", "article": "Article 15(1)"}, "scope": {"span": "بياناته الشخصية ... أو استكمالها", "article": "Article 15(1)"}, "condition": {"span": "أن تكون البيانات الشخصية كافية ومقتصرة على ما هو ضروري وفقاً للغرض الذي تمت المعالجة من أجله.", "article": "Article 5(3)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "دون تأخير غير مبرر", "article": "Article 15(1)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "صاحب البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 15(1)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "يحق (a right)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 15(1)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "have incomplete personal data completed, including by providing a supplementary statement", "target_value": "طلب ... استكمال بياناته الشخصية (completion) without mention of providing a supplementary statement", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 15(1)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "incomplete personal data concerning the data subject", "target_value": "بياناته الشخصية ... أو استكمالها (data subject’s personal data; completion implies incompleteness)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 15(1)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "taking into account the purposes of the processing", "target_value": "General purpose-linked data quality principle (adequacy/necessity per purpose), not tied expressly to the completion right", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 5(3); see also Article 5(2)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No exceptions stated for rectification/completion", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 15(1)", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "دون تأخير غير مبرر (without undue delay)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 15(1)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No consequence specified", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.77, "reasoning_note": "Article 15(1) directly grants a right to complete personal data, but it does not state the GDPR qualifier “taking into account the purposes of the processing.” That linkage is only inferable from Article 5’s purpose-related principles, especially 5(3) on adequacy/necessity to purpose (and 5(2) on purpose limitation). Hence the condition slot is only partially covered, while the ‘supplementary statement’ method is not textually provided.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-141", "gdpr_article": 16, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 10, "total": 10}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 15}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 16}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The condition of taking into account the purposes of the processing is not explicitly stated in the UAE provisions but is indirectly related through provisions on data collection and processing purposes.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "span": "ألا يتم معالجتها في أي وقت لاحق على نحو يتنافى مع ذلك الغرض", "why": "Indicates consideration of processing purposes in data collection and further processing."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["c34922f387019af45e42", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "877fafe0080725188d05", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 270.94, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "4770e5cee6011af6c1ff", "mutation_id": "9d9e99778f2f380bcdc3", "mtype": "broaden", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "6201d16404c0d4b9f63d"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "Concerns DPO appointment thresholds, not territorial applicability or a general duty to comply irrespective of processing location."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "Addresses duties vis-à-vis the DPO; not about territorial scope or establishment-based applicability."}, {"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "reason": "Defines DPO roles; does not set territorial scope or the establishment-based trigger to comply."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Regulates automated decision-making rights; unrelated to territorial scope or establishment-based applicability."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Right to restriction; not about whether controllers/processors must comply based on establishment."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Complaint handling; not a rule on territorial applicability or establishment-triggered compliance."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability right; not relevant to territorial scope."}, {"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "reason": "Controller–data subject contact methods; not territorial scope."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "كل متحكم أو معالج متواجد في الدولة", "article": "Article 2(1)(ب)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب على المتحكم الالتزام بما يأتي", "article": "Article 7 (chapeau)"}, "action": {"span": "إجراء المعالجة وتنفيذها طبقاً للقواعد والاشتراطات والضوابط المحددة بهذا المرسوم بقانون ولائحته التنفيذية", "article": "Article 8(9)"}, "scope": {"span": "تسري أحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون على معالجة البيانات الشخصية سواء كلها أو جزء منها عن طريق وسائل الأنظمة الإلكترونية التي تعمل بشكل تلقائي وآلي، أو غيرها من الوسائل الأخرى", "article": "Article 2(1)"}, "condition": {"span": "كل متحكم أو معالج متواجد في الدولة يقوم بمزاولة أنشطة معالجة البيانات الشخصية لأصحاب البيانات في الدولة أو خارجها", "article": "Article 2(1)(ب)"}, "exception": {"span": "لا تسري أحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون على ما يأتي: أ. البيانات الحكومية. ب. الجهات الحكومية المتحكمة بالبيانات الشخصية أو تلك التي تقوم بمعالجتها. ج. البيانات الشخصية لدى الجهات الأمنية والقضائية. هـ. البيانات الشخصية الصحية التي لديها تشريع ينظم حماية ومعالجة تلك البيانات. و. البيانات والمعلومات الشخصية المصرفية والائتمانية التي لديها تشريع ينظم حماية ومعالجة تلك البيانات. ز. الشركات والمؤسسات الواقعة في المناطق الحرة في الدولة ولديها تشريعات خاصة بحماية البيانات الشخصية.", "article": "Article 2(2)"}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller or processor with an establishment in the Union", "target_value": "كل متحكم أو معالج متواجد في الدولة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 2(1)(ب)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يجب على المتحكم/المعالج ...", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 7 (chapeau); Art. 8 (chapeau)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "comply with this Regulation for the processing of personal data", "target_value": "إجراء المعالجة وتنفيذها طبقاً للقواعد ... المحددة بهذا المرسوم بقانون؛ تطبيق التدابير ... بهدف الامتثال لأحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 8(9); Art. 7(2)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "processing of personal data", "target_value": "معالجة البيانات الشخصية ... عن طريق وسائل الأنظمة الإلكترونية ... أو غيرها من الوسائل الأخرى", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 2(1)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "processing is in the context of the activities of an establishment of the controller or the processor in the Union, regardless of where the processing takes place", "target_value": "متواجد في الدولة يقوم بمزاولة أنشطة معالجة ... لأصحاب البيانات في الدولة أو خارجها", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 2(1)(ب); see also cross-border processing/transfer framework: Art. 23", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "استثناءات متعددة (البيانات/الجهات الحكومية، الأمنية والقضائية، الصحية ذات تشريع خاص، المصرفية والائتمانية ذات تشريع خاص، والمناطق الحرة ذات تشريعات خاصة)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 2(2)", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed specific to this scope trigger", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.58, "reasoning_note": "Article 2(1)(ب) establishes establishment-based applicability for controllers/processors in the UAE and is paired with explicit compliance duties in Arts. 7–8. However, it does not explicitly state “regardless of where the processing takes place,” and Art. 2(2) introduces sectoral/location exceptions, making the UAE counterpart narrower than RU-008.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-008", "gdpr_article": 3, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 20}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 22}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE law does not explicitly require controllers or processors to comply with the law for all processing of personal data in the context of the activities of their establishment, regardless of where the processing takes place.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "span": "المادة (2) نطاق سريان المرسوم بقانون", "why": "Article 2(1)(ب) does not explicitly state that the processing must be in the context of the activities of the establishment, regardless of where the processing takes place."}, {"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "span": "2. لا تسري أحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون على ما يأتي:", "why": "Article 2(2) lists several exceptions to the applicability of the law, which may limit the scope of the law and create uncertainty about whether it applies to all processing of personal data in the context of the activities of an establishment."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "c34922f387019af45e42", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "6201d16404c0d4b9f63d"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 300.2, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "f96f09daeaf208870ee0", "mutation_id": "af36f775d2be64a7eedc", "mtype": "broaden", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["877fafe0080725188d05", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "57844ac856d11c289650", "reason": "Lawful bases/exemptions for processing; does not create a data subject right to rectification/completion."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated decision-making; unrelated to rectification or completion of personal data."}, {"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Right to obtain information (including procedures for correction) but does not itself grant the completion/rectification right."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Right to restriction of processing; different right than completion/rectification."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability; not about completing/rectifying data."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification duties; unrelated to completion/rectification."}, {"id": "fdfffc71ce002ff82134", "reason": "Data protection impact assessment obligations; not a data subject right to completion."}, {"id": "80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "reason": "Consent conditions; not about completing/rectifying data."}, {"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "reason": "Right to stop processing; not rectification/completion."}, {"id": "2b337b9a20a4e33b6ad2", "reason": "Regulator’s exemption power; not a data subject right."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "صاحب البيانات", "article": "Article 15(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "يحق", "article": "Article 15(1)"}, "action": {"span": "استكمالها لدى المتحكم", "article": "Article 15(1)"}, "scope": {"span": "تصحيح بياناته الشخصية غير الدقيقة التي قدمها مباشرة إلى المتحكم", "article": "Article 15(1)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "دون تأخير غير مبرر", "article": "Article 15(1)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "data subject", "target": "صاحب البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 15(1)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "right", "target": "يحق", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 15(1)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "have incomplete personal data completed, including by providing a supplementary statement", "target": "استكمالها لدى المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 15(1)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "incomplete personal data concerning the data subject", "target": "بياناته الشخصية ... التي قدمها مباشرة إلى المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 15(1)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "taking into account the purposes of the processing", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "None stated for the completion/rectification right", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "دون تأخير غير مبرر", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 15(1)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.66, "reasoning_note": "Article 15(1) expressly grants a right to have personal data completed, but it is limited to data provided directly to the controller and does not mention completion by a supplementary statement. The GDPR qualifier “taking into account the purposes of the processing” is not expressed; Article 5 sets accuracy/purpose principles but does not connect them to the right of completion. Accordingly, the target is narrower in scope and lacks the GDPR’s purpose-based condition.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-141", "gdpr_article": 16, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 10, "total": 10}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 17}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 18}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE jurisdiction does not explicitly provide a right to complete personal data taking into account the purposes of the processing, and the right to provide a supplementary statement is not mentioned.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "span": "المادة (15) حق تصحيح أو محو البيانات الشخصية المقدمة مباشرة إلى المتحكم", "why": "This provision provides a right to correction or completion of personal data, but it does not explicitly mention the right to provide a supplementary statement or take into account the purposes of the processing."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The counterpart found in Article 15(1) is not a complete match, and the condition 'taking into account the purposes of the processing' is not covered.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "span": "المادة (15) حق تصحيح أو محو البيانات الشخصية المقدمة مباشرة إلى المتحكم", "why": "The article only mentions the correction of inaccurate personal data, not the completion of incomplete personal data."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "span": "المادة (5) ضوابط معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "why": "The article mentions the importance of considering the purposes of the processing, but it is not explicitly linked to the completion of incomplete personal data."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["57844ac856d11c289650", "c34922f387019af45e42", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "877fafe0080725188d05", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "fdfffc71ce002ff82134", "80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "2b337b9a20a4e33b6ad2"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 404.52, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "973c796840f73198f905", "mutation_id": "973635c1ac972002f6ff", "mtype": "narrow", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "reason": "Defines the Authority’s powers and receipt of notifications under Article 14 (processing notifications), not breach-notification duties."}, {"id": "7448a27e7806f2c0c143", "reason": "Data quality principles; does not regulate breach notification to the Authority."}, {"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "reason": "DPO functions (including reporting generic violations) but not the controller’s breach-notification duty to the Authority."}, {"id": "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "reason": "Concerns investigation of DPOs; not about breach notification."}, {"id": "14fe9b230c7ba11703d5", "reason": "Sanctions for other violations; no operative rule on notifying the Authority of a breach."}, {"id": "762372b7329c44286e43", "reason": "Lawful bases for processing; not about breach notification."}, {"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "reason": "Data subject rectification/hiding/erasure; not about breach notification."}, {"id": "5e5fa8a4888b88a04311", "reason": "Damages; not about breach notification duties."}, {"id": "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "reason": "Conditions for processing sensitive data; not about breach notification."}, {"id": "231a37f671238dbf7112", "reason": "Definitions for DPO; not about breach notification."}, {"id": "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "reason": "Rules on criminal-offence data; not about breach notification."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يلتزم مدير البيانات", "article": "Article 4(b)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب عليه وضع إجراءات محددة لإخطار الهيئة", "article": "Article 4(b)"}, "action": {"span": "إخطار الهيئة بحدوث خرق أو انتهاك للبيانات الشخصية الحساسة", "article": "Article 4(b)"}, "scope": {"span": "الهيئة", "article": "Article 4(b)"}, "condition": {"span": "حدوث خرق أو انتهاك للبيانات الشخصية الحساسة", "article": "Article 4(b)"}, "exception": {"span": "ما لم يكن من غير المحتمل أن يؤدي خرق البيانات الشخصية الحساسة إلى خطر يُهدد حقوق أصحاب البيانات", "article": "Article 4(b)"}, "temporal": {"span": "خلال مدة لا تجاوز اثنان وسبعين ساعة من وقت اكتشافه", "article": "Article 4(b)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "مدير البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4(b)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يجب عليه", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4(b)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "notify the competent supervisory authority of the personal data breach", "target_value": "إخطار الهيئة بحدوث خرق أو انتهاك", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4(b)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "to the supervisory authority competent in accordance with Article 55", "target_value": "الهيئة (الجهة المختصة بحماية البيانات)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4(b)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "in the case of a personal data breach", "target_value": "حدوث خرق أو انتهاك للبيانات الشخصية الحساسة فقط", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 4(b)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "unless the personal data breach is unlikely to result in a risk to the rights and freedoms of natural persons", "target_value": "ما لم يكن من غير المحتمل أن يؤدي إلى خطر يُهدد حقوق أصحاب البيانات (ومحصور بحوادث تخص البيانات الحساسة)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 4(b)", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "without undue delay after becoming aware", "target_value": "خلال مدة لا تجاوز 72 ساعة من وقت الاكتشاف", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Article 4(b)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.71, "reasoning_note": "The Bahraini text imposes notification to the Authority but limits it to sensitive-personal-data breaches and sets a fixed 72-hour window, without the GDPR’s “without undue delay” qualifier. Its exception tracks a low-risk standard but speaks only to “rights” (not “rights and freedoms”) and, again, only for sensitive-data breaches. These points explain the timeframe and exception misalignment noted by the reviewer.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-345", "gdpr_article": 33, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 15, "total": 27}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 29}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The BHR law only requires notification for breaches of sensitive personal data, and has a narrower scope of application compared to the GDPR requirement unit [RU-345].", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 4(b)", "span": "يلتزم مدير البيانات بتوثيق حالات خرق أو انتهاك البيانات الشخصية الحساسة", "why": "The BHR law only requires notification for breaches of sensitive personal data."}, {"id": "Article 4(c)", "span": "لا يُلزَم مدير البيانات بإخطار صاحب البيانات بحادثة الخرق أو الانتهاك في الحالات الآتية", "why": "The BHR law has a narrower scope of application compared to the GDPR requirement unit [RU-345]."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Inconsistent notification timeframe and exception criteria", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3", "span": "Article 4(b)", "why": "Notification timeframe and exception criteria do not fully align with GDPR requirements"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "7448a27e7806f2c0c143", "1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "14fe9b230c7ba11703d5", "762372b7329c44286e43", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "5e5fa8a4888b88a04311", "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "231a37f671238dbf7112", "3d71a23a91370cadf799"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 360.56, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "2d84758550a044008235", "mutation_id": "fa624f3fb100583934c5", "mtype": "narrow", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "5483caf68765f09059fb", "reason": "Concerns retention of processing documents and security for retention; does not address implementing data protection policies."}, {"id": "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "reason": "General obligation to follow Ministry-issued controls/procedures; does not itself require implementing data protection policies."}, {"id": "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "reason": "Addresses appointing a data protection officer; not the implementation of data protection policies."}, {"id": "c62011bb3dda1c9374e5", "reason": "Declaratory protection clause; no operative requirement about policies."}, {"id": "6e8de83975a220288296", "reason": "Promulgation decision; not a substantive rule on policies."}, {"id": "498c9cb637b86367567b", "reason": "Ministry’s powers to issue controls/procedures; not a controller obligation to implement policies."}, {"id": "fd2c91edc2e3ff926c6b", "reason": "Requires risk assessment for external processing/transfers; it does not condition the duty to implement data protection policies on proportionality."}, {"id": "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf", "reason": "Cooperation with the Ministry; unrelated to implementing data protection policies."}, {"id": "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "reason": "DPO designation; not an obligation to implement policies."}, {"id": "caad155111190c1aa274", "reason": "Definitions; no operative requirement about policies."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يلتزم المتحكم أو المعالج - بحسب الأحوال -", "article": "Article 21"}, "modality": {"span": "يلتزم", "article": "Article 21"}, "action": {"span": "بوضع سياسة حماية البيانات الشخصية في مكان ظاهر يتيح لصاحب البيانات الشخصية الاطلاع عليها ... على أن تتضمن تلك السياسة - على الأقل - آلية وإجراءات ممارسة صاحب البيانات الشخصية لحقوقه", "article": "Article 21"}, "scope": {"span": "التدابير الفنية والإجرائية لضمان تنفيذ المعالجة وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Article 13"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "قبل معالجة بياناته", "article": "Article 21"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المتحكم (وأيضاً المعالج بحسب الأحوال)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 21: \"يلتزم المتحكم أو المعالج - بحسب الأحوال -\""}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يلتزم / يجب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 21: \"يلتزم\"; Art. 13: \"يلتزم\""}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "implement appropriate data protection policies as part of the measures referred to in Article 24(1)", "target_value": "بوضع سياسة حماية البيانات الشخصية ... وتتخذ ضوابط وإجراءات داخلية لمعالجة البيانات", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 21: \"بوضع سياسة حماية البيانات الشخصية ...\"; Art. 13: \"بوضع الضوابط والإجراءات الواجب الالتزام بها عند معالجة البيانات الشخصية\""}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "measures established under Article 24(1)", "target_value": "التدابير الفنية والإجرائية لضمان تنفيذ المعالجة وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 13: \"التدابير الفنية والإجرائية لضمان تنفيذ المعالجة وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون\""}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "where proportionate in relation to processing activities", "target_value": "No proportionality qualifier attached to the duty to implement policies", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 21 and Art. 13 impose policy/controls without a proportionality condition; Art. 39 (\"يجب على المتحكم إجراء تقييم ... مخاطر نقل أو تحويل البيانات\") concerns transfers/external processing only and does not condition the policy duty."}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "قبل معالجة بياناته (policy made available before processing)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 21: \"قبل معالجة بياناته\""}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated in the cited provisions", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.68, "reasoning_note": "OMN law requires both an internal set of controls/procedures and a published data protection policy, which functionally meets the GDPR policy-implementation action. However, OMN texts do not qualify this duty by proportionality; Art. 39’s risk assessment is context-specific (transfers/external processors) and does not operate as a general proportionality condition on implementing policies.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-207", "gdpr_article": 24, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 11, "total": 23}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 24}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The condition 'where proportionate in relation to processing activities' may have a counterpart in the target jurisdiction, distributed across several provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم وأي معالج أو جهة أو شخص يشارك في معالجة البيانات الشخصية بوضع الضوابط والإجراءات الواجب الالتزام بها عند معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Implies a need for proportionality and assessment of risks in processing activities."}, {"id": "fd2c91edc2e3ff926c6b", "span": "يجب على المتحكم إجراء تقييم لمستوى الحماية التي توفرها جهة المعالجة الخارجية ومخاطر نقل أو تحويل البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Mentions an assessment of risks in processing activities, which may be related to proportionality."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict on the condition slot is incorrect, as the OMN jurisdiction has a provision that relates to proportionality.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "fd2c91edc2e3ff926c6b", "span": "يجب على المتحكم إجراء تقييم لمستوى الحماية التي توفرها جهة المعالجة الخارجية ومخاطر نقل أو تحويل البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision implies that the controller should consider the risks and proportionality of the processing activities when implementing the data protection policy."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "5483caf68765f09059fb", "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "c62011bb3dda1c9374e5", "6e8de83975a220288296", "498c9cb637b86367567b", "fd2c91edc2e3ff926c6b", "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf", "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "caad155111190c1aa274"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 376.76, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "1bd6550c9b7ec573f707", "mutation_id": "897cdd5e82288b5aaf42", "mtype": "broaden", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
