"Article 20(1)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 7(1)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يجب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 7(1)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "include pseudonymisation in the implemented security measures", "target_value": "تشمل هذه التدابير آلية إخفاء البيانات", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 7(2); Art. 20(1)(a)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "personal data processed", "target_value": "حماية وتأمين البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 7(1)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "as appropriate to the risk", "target_value": "مستوى أمن المعلومات الذي يتناسب مع المخاطر المصاحبة للمعالجة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 20(1)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.64, "reasoning_note": "UAE law does not use the GDPR term “pseudonymisation,” but Art. 7(2) expressly includes “a data masking mechanism” within the controller’s required measures, and Art. 20(1)(a) lists data masking as an example under a risk-based security obligation. Data masking is functionally akin to pseudonymisation, though not identically defined, so the action slot is marked partial. All other elements (addressee, obligation, scope, and risk-appropriateness) are directly covered.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-317", "gdpr_article": 32, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 10, "total": 10}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 12}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 16}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE jurisdiction does not explicitly require pseudonymisation as a security measure, despite mentioning data masking and encryption.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "span": "Article 20(1)(أ) تشفير البيانات الشخصية وتطبيق آلية إخفاء البيانات", "why": "This article mentions data masking, but not explicitly as a security measure for pseudonymisation."}, {"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "span": "Article 7(2) آلية إخفاء البيانات", "why": "This article mentions data masking, but not explicitly as a security measure for pseudonymisation."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE jurisdiction does not explicitly require pseudonymisation as a security measure.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "span": "Article 20(1)", "why": "Does not explicitly mention pseudonymisation as a required security measure."}, {"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "span": "Article 7(2)", "why": "Mentions data masking, but it is not clear if this is equivalent to pseudonymisation."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["9630e6d967b64e07d339", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "c34922f387019af45e42", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 429.01, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "17b0780a3b8bb4ed7012", "mutation_id": "d26763731fb2cf85614f", "mtype": "broaden", "required": "C4", "condition": "mutation"}
