12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 12, "total": 24}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 26}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Lack of explicit language in Article 32(3)(ب) regarding the data protection officer's obligation to provide advice, and unclear basis for the 'broader' verdict for the slot 'condition'", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "span": "الإشراف على إجراءات تقويم الأثر وتقارير المراجعة والتدقيق المتعلقة بضوابط حماية البيانات الشخصية، وتوثيق نتائج التقويم وإصدار التوصيات اللازمة لذلك", "why": "Article 32(3)(ب) does not explicitly state that the data protection officer is obliged to provide advice as regards the data protection impact assessment"}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The target jurisdiction's provision does not have a request condition stated, whereas the GDPR requirement has a 'where requested' condition.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "span": "الإشراف على إجراءات تقويم الأثر ... وإصدار التوصيات اللازمة لذلك", "why": "This provision does not explicitly state that the data protection officer is obliged to provide advice 'where requested'."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["33d22a1a65039b5be3f9", "7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "ce107f77eb9119ba01b0", "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "06b918a4049719ed530f", "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "14105f25ea49e7794aaa"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 320.75, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "87659c8d1f679bd52d66", "mutation_id": "06beea21fb992180cdef", "mtype": "slot_drop", "required": "C2", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "62dc9e8ad2aa962982ad", "reason": "Requires obtaining consent before collection/processing but does not impose an obligation to be able to demonstrate/ prove that consent."}, {"id": "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "reason": "Addresses transparency, withdrawal of consent, and specific marketing-consent, but not the controller’s ability to demonstrate consent."}, {"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "reason": "Covers security, records of processing, and breach notification; it does not require keeping proof of consent or the ability to demonstrate consent."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "مقدم الخدمة", "article": "Article 3"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب أن يكون", "article": "Article 3"}, "action": {"span": "القدرة على إثبات موافقة صاحب البيانات على معالجة البيانات", "article": "Article 3"}, "scope": {"span": "معالجة البيانات", "article": "Article 3"}, "condition": {"span": "في جميع الأحوال", "article": "Article 3"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "مقدم الخدمة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 3: \"... لمقدم الخدمة ...\"", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يجب أن يكون", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 3: \"وفي جميع الأحوال يجب أن يكون ...\"", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "be able to demonstrate that the data subject has consented to the processing of their personal data", "target_value": "القدرة على إثبات موافقة صاحب البيانات على معالجة البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 3: \"... القدرة على إثبات موافقة صاحب البيانات على معالجة البيانات.\"", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "processing of personal data based on consent", "target_value": "معالجة البيانات (in the personal-data context of the instrument)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 3 (processing); see also Article 2/5 referencing \"البيانات الشخصية\"", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "Where processing is based on consent", "target_value": "في جميع الأحوال", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 3: \"وفي جميع الأحوال يجب أن يكون ...\"", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.77, "reasoning_note": "Article 3 expressly requires the service provider to be able to prove the data subject’s consent to processing, which functionally matches GDPR Art. 7(1)’s demonstrability requirement. The condition is broader (“in all cases”) than GDPR’s trigger (“where processing is based on consent”), but it subsumes the GDPR scenario; the addressee is sector-specific yet functionally equivalent to a controller in this regime.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-017", "gdpr_article": 7, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 2, "total": 2}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 4}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 4}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's citation for the slot 'condition' is incomplete, and the verdict for the slot 'scope' is incorrect.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "span": "المادة الثالثة: مشروعية جمع ومعالجة البيانات لا تكون جمع ومعالجة البيانات مشروعة وقانونية 1. الحصول على موافقة المستخدم صاحب البيانات.", "why": "The Kuwaiti law requires consent for the processing of personal data, but it does not explicitly state that the processing must be based on consent."}, {"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "span": "وفي جميع الأحوال يجب أن يكون لمقدم الخدمة القدرة على إثبات موافقة صاحب البيانات على معالجة البيانات", "why": "The analyst's citation for the slot 'condition' is incomplete."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provision may not be directly equivalent to the GDPR requirement, and the scope of the provision may be broader than intended.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "span": "في جميع الأحوال يجب أن يكون لمقدم الخدمة القدرة على إثبات موافقة صاحب البيانات على معالجة البيانات", "why": "The provision applies to all cases, not just when processing is based on consent, and does not explicitly state that the controller is obliged to demonstrate consent when processing is based on consent."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 4, "candidate_ids": ["b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "62dc9e8ad2aa962982ad"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 301.51, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "bb4f245c8b12efefaa11", "mutation_id": "aadefdbd6ca776d573dd", "mtype": "slot_drop", "required": "C2", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["9cfd6fbae8182dbc0028", "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "8394f801a0a97e521f68"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "reason": "Regulates public-interest processing safeguards by public bodies; does not address informing data subjects or DPO contact details."}, {"id": "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "reason": "Sets conditions for disclosure of personal data; not about providing information to data subjects at collection."}, {"id": "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "reason": "Record-keeping requirements for controllers; not about notice content to data subjects."}, {"id": "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "reason": "Addresses destruction of personal data; unrelated to provision of DPO contact details."}, {"id": "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "reason": "Governs sources and purposes of collection/processing; does not set notice content."}, {"id": "772962994f8e191e84a3", "reason": "Research/statistics processing conditions; not about informing data subjects or DPO details."}, {"id": "4919410df7147924356b", "reason": "Right of access to a copy of data; not about notice at collection or DPO contact."}, {"id": "557230873031d6e5cb2c", "reason": "Marketing processing conditions; not about informing data subjects of DPO contact details."}, {"id": "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "reason": "Documentation of legitimate interest where data subject cannot be contacted; not about DPO contact notice."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على جهة التحكم", "article": "Art. 4(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب", "article": "Art. 4(1)"}, "action": {"span": "ب- بيانات الاتصال بمسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية -إن وجد- المعين من قبل جهة التحكم.", "article": "Art. 4(1)(ب)"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": "في حال تم جمع البيانات الشخصية من صاحبها مباشرة", "article": "Art. 4(1)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "عند البدء في جمع بياناته", "article": "Art. 13"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "controller", "target": "جهة التحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 4(1)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "obligation", "target": "يجب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 4(1)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "provide the data subject with the contact details of the data protection officer", "target": "إبلاغ صاحب البيانات الشخصية ببيانات الاتصال بمسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية -إن وجد-", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 4(1)(ب)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "where personal data are collected from the data subject and where provision of the DPO contact is applicable", "target": "في حال تم جمع البيانات الشخصية من صاحبها مباشرة؛ وتقديم تفاصيل مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية يكون إن وُجد", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 4(1) and 4(1)(ب)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "unless and insofar as the data subject already has the information", "target": "لا استثناء مماثلاً منصوصاً عليه", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "at the time when personal data are obtained", "target": "عند البدء في جمع بياناته", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 13", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "covered_except_exception", "confidence": 0.79, "reasoning_note": "Art. 4(1)(ب) requires informing the data subject of the DPO’s contact details (if any) when data are collected directly, matching the GDPR’s content and applicability. Art. 13 supplies the explicit timing “at the start of collection,” satisfying the temporal element. There is no express exception for cases where the data subject already has the information.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-058", "gdpr_article": 13, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 19}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 22}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "9cfd6fbae8182dbc0028", "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "772962994f8e191e84a3", "4919410df7147924356b", "557230873031d6e5cb2c", "04322a32135a68c65bb5"], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 171.38, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "325c54bd092e409a8c20", "mutation_id": "55bf1c29cb61c68fad55", "mtype": "slot_drop", "required": "C2", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "db6e2be94f2388e169a8", "93f989531fe30cac1ed5"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "d0bb19cb0c67952144b4", "reason": "Data portability; does not concern refusal of erasure or grounds permitting non-erasure."}, {"id": "546cfd19de051c612c06", "reason": "Procedural handling of data subject requests; no substantive grounds for refusing erasure."}, {"id": "40626451a5025d77cff5", "reason": "Transparency notice content; not about erasure or exceptions."}, {"id": "495e30846d7a1f70c077", "reason": "Security obligations; unrelated to erasure exceptions."}, {"id": "c7ddf58d01bb4d45c9d5", "reason": "Administrative notification to authority; not about erasure."}, {"id": "de8d26aee9201d58a52b", "reason": "Permit revocation conditions; not about erasure."}, {"id": "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "reason": "Restrictions on disclosure; not about erasure."}, {"id": "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "reason": "Requirement to publish a privacy policy; not about erasure exceptions."}, {"id": "3f916831456908af27d8", "reason": "Supervisory enforcement powers; not the controller’s permission to refrain from erasure."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المتحكم", "article": "Article 17 (db6e2be94f2388e169a8)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجوز", "article": "Article 17 (db6e2be94f2388e169a8)"}, "action": {"span": "يجوز للمتحكم رفض طلب صاحب البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 17 (db6e2be94f2388e169a8)"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": "ما لم تكن تلك المعالجة ضرورية لأغراض الحفظ والتوثيق الوطنية", "article": "Article 11 (b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 17 (db6e2be94f2388e169a8)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "permission", "target_value": "يجوز", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 17 (db6e2be94f2388e169a8)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "refrain from erasing personal data under paragraph 1", "target_value": "يجوز للمتحكم رفض طلب صاحب البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 17 (db6e2be94f2388e169a8)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "processing is necessary for: (a) freedom of expression and information; (b) legal obligation or public/official task; (c) public interest in public health (Art 9(2)(h),(i), 9(3)); (d) archiving in the public interest/scientific or historical research/statistics per Art 89(1), where erasure would impair objectives; (e) establishment, exercise or defence of legal claims", "target_value": "ما لم تكن تلك المعالجة ضرورية لأغراض الحفظ والتوثيق الوطنية", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 11 (b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "narrower", "confidence": 0.62, "reasoning_note": "OMN text permits the controller to refuse erasure requests (Art. 17) and limits the erasure right where processing is necessary for national archiving/documentation (Art. 11), which functionally allows refraining from erasure on that single ground. However, it does not enumerate the broader GDPR grounds (freedom of expression, legal obligation/public tasks, public health, research/statistics with impairment test, legal claims). Art. 17’s other refusal bases (repetitive or extraordinary effort) are unrelated to GDPR Art. 17(3) grounds.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-029", "gdpr_article": 8, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 12, "total": 24}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 28}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The counterpart to the GDPR requirement unit [RU-029] is distributed across several provisions, including Article 11 and Article 17.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "span": "ما لم تكن تلك المعالجة ضرورية لأغراض الحفظ والتوثيق الوطنية", "why": "This condition is similar to the grounds listed in points (a) to (e) of paragraph 3 of the GDPR requirement unit [RU-029]."}, {"id": "db6e2be94f2388e169a8", "span": "يجوز للمتحكم رفض طلب صاحب البيانات الشخصية جزئياً أو كلياً", "why": "This provision allows the controller to refuse a request to erase personal data, but it does not explicitly mention the grounds listed in Article 11."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The OMN jurisdiction's provisions do not explicitly list the grounds for refusing erasure, as required by the GDPR.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "span": "ما لم تكن تلك المعالجة ضرورية لأغراض الحفظ والتوثيق الوطنية", "why": "This provision only mentions one ground for refusing erasure, whereas the GDPR lists multiple grounds."}, {"id": "db6e2be94f2388e169a8", "span": "إذا كان الطلب متكرراً بشكل غير مبرر، أو أن تنفيذه يتطلب جهداً غير عادي", "why": "This provision does not explicitly mention the grounds listed in points (a) to (e) of paragraph 3 of the GDPR."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["d0bb19cb0c67952144b4", "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "546cfd19de051c612c06", "40626451a5025d77cff5", "495e30846d7a1f70c077", "db6e2be94f2388e169a8", "c7ddf58d01bb4d45c9d5", "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "de8d26aee9201d58a52b", "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "3f916831456908af27d8"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 353.17, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "d49e5d630a1122394035", "mutation_id": "669ea5de8c35671c7eec", "mtype": "slot_drop", "required": "C2", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "79ac84c7165bc6aa1c06", "reason": "Record-keeping duties; no cooperation-with-authority obligation."}, {"id": "3f916831456908af27d8", "reason": "Enumerates Ministry enforcement measures; does not impose a cooperation duty on processors."}, {"id": "495e30846d7a1f70c077", "reason": "Confidentiality and security controls for controllers only; no authority-cooperation duty."}, {"id": "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "reason": "Controller permitting/notification content; not a general cooperation duty."}, {"id": "6ada991a77a31372fb4c", "reason": "External auditor access; relates to audits, not cooperation with supervisory authority."}, {"id": "b08fd8d6893cd6de53e8", "reason": "Retention of processing documents; no cooperation duty."}, {"id": "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "reason": "Privacy policy transparency; not cooperation with authority."}, {"id": "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "reason": "DPO designation criteria; not cooperation with authority."}, {"id": "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "reason": "DPO designation (controller); not cooperation with authority."}, {"id": "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "reason": "On-request appointment of external auditor; specific audit mechanism, not the general cooperation duty."}, {"id": "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "reason": "Compliance with Ministry's procedures generally; does not state a cooperation obligation."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المتحكم والمعالج", "article": "Article 18"}, "modality": {"span": "يلتزم", "article": "Article 18"}, "action": {"span": "بالتعاون مع الوزارة، وتقديم ما تطلبه من بيانات ومستندات", "article": "Article 18"}, "scope": {"span": "لممارسة اختصاصها طبقاً لأحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Article 18"}, "condition": {"span": "تقديم ما تطلبه", "article": "Article 18"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "processor", "target": "المتحكم والمعالج (includes the processor)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 18 [a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf]"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "obligation", "target": "يلتزم (is obliged)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 18 [a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf]"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "cooperate with the supervisory authority", "target": "بالتعاون مع الوزارة، وتقديم ما تطلبه من بيانات ومستندات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 18 [a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf]"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "in the performance of the supervisory authority's tasks", "target": "لممارسة اختصاصها طبقاً لأحكام هذا القانون", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 18 [a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf]"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "on request by the supervisory authority", "target": "تقديم ما تطلبه (providing what it requests)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 18 [a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf]"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": "No exception stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "None", "target": "No temporal qualifier stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": "No consequence stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.74, "reasoning_note": "Article 18 expressly imposes an obligation on the processor to cooperate with the Ministry and to provide what it requests, which textually captures the GDPR’s “on request” condition. The same provision ties cooperation to the Ministry’s exercise of its competences, aligning with “in the performance of its tasks.” While Article 16 uses an on-request trigger for a different duty (appointing an external auditor), Article 18 itself already contains the request-based cooperation requirement.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-312", "gdpr_article": 31, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 19}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 22}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict for the slot 'on request by the supervisory authority' is not entirely supported by the citation of Article 18 alone.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم والمعالج - بناء على طلب الوزارة - بتعيين مدقق خارجي", "why": "Article 16 explicitly mentions 'on request' by the Ministry, which supports the 'on request' condition more directly than Article 18."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The condition slot 'on request by the supervisory authority' is not fully supported by the cited provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم والمعالج بالتعاون مع الوزارة، وتقديم ما تطلبه من بيانات ومستندات تراها لازمة لممارسة اختصاصها طبقاً لأحكام هذا القانون", "why": "The provision mentions cooperation with the Ministry, but does not explicitly state that it is 'on request' by the supervisory authority."}, {"id": "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم والمعالج - بناء على طلب الوزارة - بتعيين مدقق خارجي", "why": "The phrase 'on request of the Ministry' is mentioned in this provision, but it is related to the appointment of an external auditor, not cooperation with the supervisory authority."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["79ac84c7165bc6aa1c06", "3f916831456908af27d8", "495e30846d7a1f70c077", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "6ada991a77a31372fb4c", "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf", "b08fd8d6893cd6de53e8", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 287.18, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "725d3768df2633de0283", "mutation_id": "8a8885ae2303abad7598", "mtype": "slot_drop", "required": "C2", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "6c76988b817262e3e312"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "reason": "General privacy principle; does not establish a specific access right."}, {"id": "76d28900b8b4cbbb215d", "reason": "Special categories and permits; no bearing on the access right."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "Creates exemptions for certain provisions (Arts. 4, 9, 15, 17) but does not regulate the access right in Art. 6."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Conditions for disclosure/transfer; not about data subject access."}, {"id": "fca1aa50445ca4475333", "reason": "Consent withdrawal, objection, erasure, rectification; not the access right."}, {"id": "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "reason": "Security safeguards; not the access right."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification; not the access right."}, {"id": "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "reason": "Pre-processing transparency; not the access right."}, {"id": "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "reason": "Lawful basis (consent/legitimate interest); not the access right."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "للفرد", "article": "Article 6"}, "modality": {"span": "وله بوجه خاص الحق", "article": "Article 6"}, "action": {"span": "الوصول إلى بياناته الشخصية", "article": "Article 6"}, "scope": {"span": "بياناته الشخصية", "article": "Article 6"}, "condition": {"span": "تسري أحكام هذا القانون على البيانات الشخصية عندما تتم معالجتها على نحو إلكتروني، أو يتم الحصول عليها أو جمعها أو استخراجها على أي نحو آخر تمهيداً لمعالجتها إلكترونياً، أو تتم معالجتها عن طريق الجمع بين المعالجة الإلكترونية والمعالجة التقليدية.", "article": "Article 2"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "للفرد", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 6", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "الحق", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 6", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "obtain access to personal data concerning the data subject", "target_value": "الوصول إلى بياناته الشخصية (وكذلك: الحصول على نسخة من بياناته الشخصية)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 6", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "personal data concerning the data subject", "target_value": "بياناته الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 6", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "where the personal data concerning the data subject are being processed", "target_value": "سريان أحكام القانون عندما تتم المعالجة إلكترونياً أو تمهيداً لها أو عبر الجمع بين الإلكترونية والتقليدية", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 2; Article 6", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.78, "reasoning_note": "Article 6 directly grants an access right to individuals and thus covers the core of GDPR Art. 15. However, the condition is not stated in Article 6; it arises only from Article 2’s material scope (electronic/related processing), which differs from the GDPR’s simple ‘being processed’ condition. Therefore, the condition slot is marked partial to address the reviewer’s objection.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-123", "gdpr_article": 15, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 14}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The condition 'where such personal data are being processed' is not fully covered in the QAT jurisdiction.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "span": "تسري أحكام هذا القانون على البيانات الشخصية عندما تتم معالجتها على نحو إلكتروني، أو يتم الحصول عليها أو جمعها أو استخراجها على أي نحو آخر تمهيداً لمعالجتها إلكترونياً، أو تتم معالجتها عن طريق الجمع بين المعالجة الإلكترونية والمعالجة التقليدية.", "why": "This provision discusses the scope of the law, but does not explicitly grant the right to access personal data when it is being processed."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The condition slot verdict is not entirely accurate, and the right to access personal data might not be conditional on the processing of personal data as stated in the GDPR.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 6", "span": "للفرد الوصول إلى بياناته الشخصية وطلب مراجعتها، في مواجهة أي مراقب، وله بوجه خاص الحق فيما يلي: 1- إخطاره بمعالجة بياناته الشخصية وبالأغراض التي تجري من أجلها تلك المعالجة.", "why": "The article provides the right to access personal data, but it does not explicitly state that this right applies when the personal data are being processed."}, {"id": "Article 2", "span": "تسري أحكام هذا القانون على البيانات الشخصية عندما تتم معالجتها على نحو إلكتروني ... أو تتم معالجتها عن طريق الجمع بين المعالجة الإلكترونية والمعالجة التقليدية", "why": "The article provides a condition for the application of the law, which is related to the processing of personal data, but it does not explicitly state that the right to access personal data is conditional on the processing of personal data."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "76d28900b8b4cbbb215d", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "fca1aa50445ca4475333", "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "f5c366135483fe580381", "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "f169b712b14aea8718ee"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 305.03, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "be022349190b7b26f2f7", "mutation_id": "ddd4cc7d9bc3ed2e59d1", "mtype": "slot_drop", "required": "C2", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["80f95c322bb3204c7f65"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Addresses automated-decision objections and consent as a lawful basis in that context, not the controller's duty to demonstrate consent."}, {"id": "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "reason": "Obligations of the processor; does not concern demonstrating data subject consent by the controller."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification duties; unrelated to proving consent."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Right to restriction; does not impose a duty to demonstrate consent."}, {"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "reason": "DPO roles; no rule about demonstrating consent."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability where processing is based on consent or contract; does not address demonstrating consent."}, {"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Right to information; no obligation on controller to prove consent."}, {"id": "57844ac856d11c289650", "reason": "Lists lawful bases without consent; does not concern demonstrating consent when consent is the basis."}, {"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "reason": "Controller contact mechanisms for rights requests; not about demonstrating consent."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "General processing principles; does not require the controller to be able to demonstrate consent."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Rights to rectification and erasure; does not impose a demonstration-of-consent duty."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المتحكم", "article": "Art. 6(1)(أ)"}, "modality": {"span": "يُشترط للاعتداد بموافقة صاحب البيانات على معالجتها", "article": "Art. 6(1)"}, "action": {"span": "أن يكون المتحكم قادراً على إثبات موافقة صاحب البيانات", "article": "Art. 6(1)(أ)"}, "scope": {"span": "معالجة بياناته الشخصية", "article": "Art. 6(1)(أ)"}, "condition": {"span": "في حال كانت المعالجة مبنية على موافقة صاحب البيانات لمعالجة بياناته الشخصية", "article": "Art. 6(1)(أ)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 6(1)(أ)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يُشترط للاعتداد بموافقة صاحب البيانات على معالجتها", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 6(1)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "be able to demonstrate that the data subject has consented to the processing of their personal data", "target_value": "أن يكون المتحكم قادراً على إثبات موافقة صاحب البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 6(1)(أ)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "processing of personal data based on consent", "target_value": "معالجة بياناته الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 6(1)(أ)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "Where processing is based on consent", "target_value": "في حال كانت المعالجة مبنية على موافقة صاحب البيانات لمعالجة بياناته الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 6(1)(أ)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.93, "reasoning_note": "Article 6(1)(أ) explicitly requires, as a condition of relying on consent, that the controller be able to prove the data subject’s consent (“يُشترط… أن يكون المتحكم قادراً على إثبات موافقة صاحب البيانات”), which functionally matches GDPR Art. 7(1). Article 5 is general and does not bear on demonstrating consent. Thus the UAE text directly covers RU-017.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-017", "gdpr_article": 7, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 16}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 17}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE jurisdiction does not explicitly cover the GDPR requirement unit [RU-017] regarding the obligation to demonstrate consent.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "span": "Article 6(1)(أ)", "why": "The article only mentions that the controller must be able to prove consent, but does not explicitly state the obligation to demonstrate consent."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "span": "Article 5", "why": "The article outlines the controls for processing personal data, but does not explicitly mention the obligation to demonstrate consent."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "c34922f387019af45e42", "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "57844ac856d11c289650", "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "877fafe0080725188d05"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 215.31, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "7ac07f0aa277ce83e52b", "mutation_id": "e688add38d3cabf8af72", "mtype": "slot_drop", "required": "C2", "condition": "mutation"}
{"candidates_selected": ["d4e35bf9645b0a055e79", "129b122a7d0386567e65"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "601ddc5fd8dcb81306cb", "reason": "Board powers and approvals; does not establish the duty to draw up the annual activity report."}, {"id": "8e585010f3f5f3f24dbb", "reason": "Supervision/inspection functions; unrelated to annual activity reporting."}, {"id": "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "reason": "Lists authority tasks; no requirement to prepare an annual report."}, {"id": "cbcb4f73e9dfbf01c9bf", "reason": "Internal investigation by data controllers; not about the authority’s annual report."}, {"id": "3e6cee6b3f058328aa31", "reason": "Requires periodic reports to the minister; distinct from the public annual activity report."}, {"id": "0834eba911a2478f8604", "reason": "Budget and financial resources; not about annual reporting."}, {"id": "291bfc570e191bcff109", "reason": "Establishes the authority; does not impose annual reporting."}, {"id": "51a58b98a34fba9eb037", "reason": "Training obligations on data controllers; not relevant."}, {"id": "1828db55e11b26ceda54", "reason": "General performance principles; no annual report requirement."}, {"id": "d962cad99243b9952541", "reason": "Procedure for investigation reports; unrelated to annual activity reporting."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "تعد الهيئة تقريراً سنوياً", "article": "Article 33"}, "modality": {"span": "تعد", "article": "Article 33"}, "action": {"span": "تعد الهيئة تقريراً سنوياً يعتمده مجلس الإدارة عن نشاطها وسير العمل بها", "article": "Article 33"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "تقريراً سنوياً", "article": "Article 33"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "each supervisory authority", "target_value": "الهيئة (هيئة حماية البيانات الشخصية)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 33; see also Art. 27 for the authority’s establishment"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "تعد (shall prepare)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 33"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "draw up an annual report on its activities", "target_value": "تعد الهيئة تقريراً سنوياً ... عن نشاطها وسير العمل بها", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 33; operational allocation in Art. 44(1)(هـ)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "annually", "target_value": "تقريراً سنوياً (annual report); timeline operationalized within three months of fiscal year end", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 33; Art. 44(1)(هـ)"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.84, "reasoning_note": "Article 33 places the duty on the Authority itself to prepare an annual report on its activities; Article 44(1)(e) merely assigns the Executive President to prepare and submit that report for Board approval, operationalizing the Authority’s obligation. Internal delegation does not negate that the obligation lies with the supervisory authority.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-697", "gdpr_article": 59, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 20}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 23}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provision does not explicitly state that the report is annual in the classical sense, but rather that it should be submitted within three months from the end of the financial year.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 33(1)", "span": "تعد الهيئة تقريراً سنوياً", "why": "The provision mentions that the report is annual, but the timeframe for submission is within three months from the end of the financial year."}, {"id": "Article 44(1)(هـ)", "span": "إعداد تقرير سنوي عن نشاط الهيئة", "why": "The provision reinforces the annual report requirement, but the timeframe for submission is within three months from the end of the financial year."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The target jurisdiction's provision may not exactly match the GDPR requirement, as the annual report is prepared by the Executive President, not the supervisory authority itself.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "129b122a7d0386567e65", "span": "هـ - إعداد تقرير سنوي عن نشاط الهيئة، على النحو المنصوص عليه في المادة (33) من هذا القانون، خلال السنة المالية السابقة وعرضه - من أجل إقراره – على مجلس الإدارة خلال ثلاثة أشهر على الأكثر من تاريخ انتهاء السنة المالية، مشفوعا بنسخة من الحسابات المدققة للهيئة عن ذات السنة المالية.", "why": "This provision suggests that the annual report is prepared by the Executive President, not the supervisory authority itself, which may not exactly match the GDPR requirement."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["d4e35bf9645b0a055e79", "601ddc5fd8dcb81306cb", "129b122a7d0386567e65", "8e585010f3f5f3f24dbb", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "cbcb4f73e9dfbf01c9bf", "3e6cee6b3f058328aa31", "0834eba911a2478f8604", "291bfc570e191bcff109", "51a58b98a34fba9eb037", "1828db55e11b26ceda54", "d962cad99243b9952541"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 311.42, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 20260801, "id": "7df6cb395fd080931023", "mutation_id": "d1128fdfefb6e3ac79b1", "mtype": "slot_drop", "required": "C2", "condition": "mutation"}
